<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Matiyo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi Nii Matiyo Sɛʋɛni</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matiyo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nii Matiyo Sɛʋɛni</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Matiyo ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ɠa ga Minazeɠe Niinɛi zu zɛʋɛ naanigɔiti gila, niiti ti Yesu Kilista ná-eteai zu vaiti suɠulazu. Ti ɠilagilagiti pɛ ti-laasei ka ga «Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi». Ti zɛʋɛʋɛ Yesu ná-saai ʋoluma, ti-zɛʋɛ nuiti ta ga: Matiyo, Maleke, Luke ta Zan. Faaɠwɛ nu wolaiti ti la yeeɠɛɠala ɠitei ɠwɛɛ, siɛgi zu Matiyo ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi zɛʋɛai la, kɛlɛ tanisu toɠa ɠɛ sɛʋɛni kona ʋuulɔzita (60) ɠɛɠala leʋegai ma, Kilista zɔlɔɔga ʋoluma. Naa ʋoluma ɓalaa ade la kwɛɛ, ʋɛ Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi nii zɛʋɛai ná, kɛlɛ nu mɔinmɔin ka ɠisiɛzu ga Palɛsetine ʋe, tanisu vɔlɔ Zeluzalɛme.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sɛʋɛi nii ma nui laasei ka ga Matiyo, nii é ɠɛni ga mulu zo nui, aisa Yesu ʋa toli ga é ɠɛ ga kaladopoi ta. Daaseigi taɠili ka ga Levi. Matiyo ɠɛni ga kaladopo puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) ti ɠila, é ná-sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛʋɛ sɛʋɛ ɠala nuiti bɛ ti ga Zuifuiti. Naa ɠulaʋɛ kɛlɛma ga Minazeɠe Pɔlɔmai zu vaiti, é laaʋilɛgai ti ʋa, naama wooiti mɔinʋɛ puulɔzita (60) ma ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi zu. Nii wɔin ɠɛni Matiyo ma, naa ɠɛni ga, é dɛɛ ga Yesu ɠa é ga Mesi, Kizo Nui nii GALA ge yiimazeɠeai la, nii paa vai woni ma yeeluɠɔ. Matiyo faa mɔinmɔin sɛʋɛʋɛ ɓalaa, é lo GALA ná-masadai ʋa. Zuifuiti ti ɠɛni maaɓɔungi zu ga Mesi ʋa, é ɠɛ ga zou masa kpɔɠɔɓɔɠɔ. Matiyo ti zeɠeʋɛ naama ɠisiɛi ʋolu, é GALA ná-masadai ma vai zɛʋɛ zɛnvu zu vai letegi zu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Matiyo ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ɠa ga sɛʋɛ ʋagɔ Minazeɠe Niinɛi lɔɔzei vaa zu, tɔɔzei Minazeɠe Pɔlɔmai zu wooiti ba, é laaʋilɛsu ti ʋa. Toɠa Minazeɠe felegɔiti gilizu ʋa. Sɛʋɛ ɠwɛɛ nu wolai tanigaa ti ɠɛɛʋɛ ma, Matiyo ɠɛni pɔ ga é ná-sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛ ʋelei ʋokɔɠɔ Moize ná-sɛʋɛiti kɛɛ ʋelei ma, niiti ti ga Minazeɠe Pɔlɔmai ma zɛʋɛ lɔɔlugɔ mɔungiti.</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Matiyo ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi lɔɔzeiʋɛ ga é Yesu zɔlɔɔ pelei lɛɛ, ta ʋelei naa botii lɔɔzei ʋelei ɠɛni la (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 1:1-4:25">1:1—4:25</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Naa ʋoluma Matiyo Yesu ná-botii ɠɛʋele zuɠulaʋɛ, ta kalagi niiti naa ɠɛni ti wosu, é naa ma mɔinmɔin sɛʋɛʋɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5:1-25:46">5:1—25:46</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Matiyo ná-sɛʋɛi ɠaaɓelasuʋɛ logɛ Yesu ná-botii ma un golai ʋa: Saa vai ta buzeɠe vai, é ɠula saai ya (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 26:1-28:20">26:1—28:20</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu Kilista mɛmɛwolaiti dɔlɔ sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luke 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>Yesu Kilista mɛmɛwolaiti dɔlɔ sɛʋɛi ɠa ga nii, é ɠɛni ga Davide ta Abalaame ti-mavofodai: <verse eid="MAT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2"/>Abalaame Izaake zɔlɔɔni, Izaake Zakɔɓe zɔlɔɔ, Zakɔɓe Zuda ta kɛɛɠɛlointi sɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="MAT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3"/>Zuda Pelɛze ta Zela zɔlɔɔ Tamaal ʋa, Pelɛze Ɠɛsɛlon zɔlɔɔ, Ɠɛsɛlon Alame zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="MAT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4"/>Alame Aminadaɓe zɔlɔɔ, Aminadaɓe Naason zɔlɔɔ, Naason Salema zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="MAT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5"/>Salema Ɓoaze zɔlɔɔ Laɠaɓe ʋa, Ɓoaze Woɓɛde zɔlɔɔ Lute ʋa. Woɓɛde Izayi zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="MAT 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6"/>Izayi Davide zɔlɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Masagi Davide Salomɔn zɔlɔɔ Ilii anza wɔlɔmai ʋa, <verse eid="MAT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7"/>Salomɔn Loɓoame zɔlɔɔ, Loɓoame Aɓiya zɔlɔɔ, Aɓiya Aza zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="MAT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8"/>Aza Zozafate zɔlɔɔ, Zozafate Yolame zɔlɔɔ, Yolame Woziase zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="MAT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9"/>Woziase Yotame zɔlɔɔ, Yotame Aɠaze zɔlɔɔ, Aɠaze Ezekiase zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="MAT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10"/>Ezekiase Manasé zɔlɔɔ, Manasé Amon zɔlɔɔ, Amon Zoziase zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="MAT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11"/>Zoziase Yekonia ta kɛɛɠɛlointi sɔlɔɔ, Izilayɛle nuiti dii ziɛgi duɔlai zu Ɓaɓilɔne.<verse eid="MAT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12"/>Ɓaɓilɔne luɔlai ɠulaai ʋoluma ga, Yekonia Seyalitiyɛle zɔlɔɔni, Seyalitiyɛle Zoloɓaɓɛle zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="MAT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13"/>Zoloɓaɓɛle Aɓiyude zɔlɔɔ, Aɓiyude Eliakime zɔlɔɔ, Eliakime Azɔɔl zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="MAT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14"/>Azɔɔl Sadɔke zɔlɔɔ, Sadɔke Akime zɔlɔɔ, Akime Eliyude zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="MAT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15"/>Eliyude Eleazaal zɔlɔɔ, Eleazaal Matan zɔlɔɔ, Matan Zakɔɓe zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16"/>Zakɔɓe Zozɛfe zɔlɔɔni, nii anzai ɠɛni ga Mali, nii Yesu zɔlɔɔgai ba, é lolisu ga Kilista.<verse eid="MAT 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nuɓusɛi mavofoda puugɔ maazu naanigɔ (14) ɠa é Abalaame yɔɠɔzu ta Davide. Naa ʋoluma, nuɓusɛi mavofoda puugɔ maazu naanigɔ (14) ɠɛ Davide yɔɠɔzu ta Izilayɛle nuiti dii ziɛgi duɔlai zu Ɓaɓilɔne. Naa ʋoluma, nuɓusɛi mavofoda puugɔ maazu naanigɔ (14) ɠɛ Izilayɛle nuiti dii ziɛgi yɔɠɔzu duɔlai zu ta Kilista zɔlɔɔ siɛgi.<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Kilista zɔlɔɔ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luke 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>Wɛlɛ Yesu Kilista zɔlɔɔ pelei ʋa. Dee Mali maazoga ɠɛni de Zozɛfe ʋɛ, kɛlɛ ti ʋa ɠɛ ti zeeli ɓɔɠɔ ma ga zinini ta anza, Mali kogi zeɠeni ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ná-zobogi. <verse eid="MAT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>Zozɛfe, nii é ɠɛni ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu ga sinigi, naa ɠɛni ga telebo nu. É la ɠɛni pɔ ga é naa unfe kɛlɛzu. Naa ɠa é kɛɛni, é ɠisiɛni nɔ ga é ɠɛlɛ ba dɔɔɠuzu. <verse eid="MAT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>É yɛni ɠisiɛzu naama vai zu, eyɛsu Maliɠii ná-geezuɠeelai gila ge ɠula bɛ kɛlɛma segi zu, é ɠɛ ma: «Davide mavofodai Zozɛfe, mina lua Mali zeɠe vai ʋa ga è-anza, mazɔlɔɔ doin é koozu, Zɛnvu Ɲadegai laazɔgi ʋe. <verse eid="MAT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/>Toɠa doun zunu zɔlɔɔsu, nii è ʋaazu daaseigi ʋɛɛzu ga Yesu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yesu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Daaseigi nii poluʋɛ ga «GALA ka kizogi wosu».</char></note> tɔɔzei tɔ ɠa é ʋaazu ná-nuɓusɛiti kizosu ta-ɠotoiti ma.»<verse eid="MAT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>Naa pɛ ge ɠɛɛni, nii a kɛ Maliɠii wooi nii ʋilɛsu, nii GALA goo wo nui boni ga:<verse eid="MAT 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/>«Wɛlɛ, anzalopo ɓeai, nii é la dɛ zunu vaa ɠwɛɛ, naa ɠa kogi zeɠezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:23">é zunu loun zɔlɔɔ, ta daasei pɛɛ ga Emanuwɛle.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Eza 7:14</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 1:23">Daaseigi naa ʋoluʋɛ ɠa ga «GALA ka ade ʋa».<verse eid="MAT 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>Zozɛfe wuungai ma, é naama wooi zoni, nii Maliɠii ná-geezuɠeelai deveni ma, é Mali zeɠeni ga anza. <verse eid="MAT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/>Kɛlɛ ti la ɓɔɠɔ ɠwɛɛni pɛ ta naa, eyɛsu naa doin zɔlɔɔ ga zunu, nii Zozɛfe daaseigi ʋɛɛni ga Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠima nu wolaiti ti zeeli vai Zeluzalɛme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>Yesu zɔlɔɔni Ɓɛteleyɛme, Zudé yooi zu, masagi Elɔde ná-siɛgi zu. Naa ʋoluma ɠima nu wolaiti ti zeɠeni folo ɠulazu ʋelei yooiti su, ti ʋa Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/>Ti gaazaɠagi woni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Mini ɠa Zuifuiti ta-masagi ná, nii sɔlɔɔga niinɛi? Tɔɔzei gi ná-somideɠai ʋɛtɛgɛ folo ɠulazu ʋelei, naa ɠa é kɛa gi ʋaai nɔkɔsu bɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>Siɛgi zu masagi Elɔde naama wooi mɛnini da, ziiɓɔlɔni gola, ta Zeluzalɛme nuiti pɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>É Zuifuiti ta-zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti pɛ gaalɛɛni ba, ta tɔ kalamɔinti, é ti ɠaazaɠa Kilista zɔlɔɔsuʋɛ ma. <verse eid="MAT 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛteleyɛme ʋe, Zudé yooi zu, tɔɔzei naa ɠa GALA goo wo nui sɛʋɛai ga:<verse eid="MAT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>‹Ɗa ɓalaa, ɗɛi è ga Ɓɛteleyɛme, è Zuda yooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">gaamazu è la lɔini Zuda laa wolaiti saama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">Tɔɔzei è ʋɔ bɛ ɠa totuɠɔi a zɔlɔɔ ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">nii a zɔɓela zo nà-nuɓusɛi Izilayɛle ma.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="MIC 5:1">Mis 5:1</ref></char>.</char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>Elɔde zɛba é ɠima nuiti toli dɔɔɠuzu ga naati ti yeeɠɛɠalai ɠiteɠitegi wo ma, nii somideɠai ɠulani ma. <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ti leʋeni Ɓɛteleyɛme, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À li, wo doungoi ná-faiti buuʋɛtɛ ga pagɔ. Wa kaana, à ʋa, wo bo mà, naa ɠa a kɛ nà ɓalaa gè li, gè nɔkɔ bɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9"/>Siɛgi zu ti ɓeni la ga masagi wooi mɛni, ti pele zoni. Somideɠai nii ti kaani folo ɠulazu ʋelei, naa loni ti luɠɔ. É zeelini naama adɛ maazuʋɛ, ʋɛ doungoi ɠɛni ná, é lo. <verse eid="MAT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10"/>Siɛgi zu ti somideɠai ɠaani la loni, ti wola ɠoozunɛɛni. <verse eid="MAT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Ti lɛɛni pɛlɛi wu, ti doungoi ʋɛtɛ ta dee Mali. Ti nɔkɔni bu. Naa ʋoluma, ti ta-ɠasɔiti maavieni, ti sabai ve ga zanugi, ta ansansegi, naa ʋɛɛ miilegi ʋa. <verse eid="MAT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>Naa ʋoluma, tɛi GALA ge ti lɛnɛni segi zu ga ti mina ɠale ma ga Elɔde ʋɔ pelei, ti liini ta-yooi zu ga pele ɠili.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu maaʋela vai ti lii la Ezipete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>Siɛgi zu ɠima nu wolaiti ti liini la, Maliɠii ná-geezuɠeelai gila ge ɠulani kɛlɛma Zozɛfe ʋɛ segi zu, é ɓɔɛ pɔ, é ɠɛ ma: «Wuzeɠe, è doungoi zeɠe ta dee, è ʋela ga tiye Ezipete yooi zu, miná ɠa è yɛsu ná, eyɛsu yeei gè ɓɔɛzu la ʋolu è ʋɔ. Tɔɔzei Elɔde ɠa doungoi ʋaa ɠeleɠele gaiziɛzu.» <verse eid="MAT 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>Naa ɠa é kɛɛni Zozɛfe wuzeɠeni kpidii, é doungoi zeɠe ta dee, é ʋela ga tiye, é li Ezipete yooi zu. <verse eid="MAT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/>É yɛni ná eyɛsu Elɔde za, naa ɠa a kɛ Maliɠii wooi ʋilɛsu, nii GALA goo wo nui boni ga: «Gè dòun zunui loliga ga é ɠula Ezipete yooi ʋa.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Woz 11:1</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓɛteleyɛme loungoiti paa vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>Elɔde kaai ma ga ɠima nuiti ti gaaʋɛa, é wola yiiɠaawanani. É devei veeni ga ti zunu loungoiti pɛ paa Ɓɛteleyɛme taazuʋɛ ta ná maaɠoolii zu, niiti pɛ ti kona felegɔ zɔlɔɔgai na, é yei bu, é zoloo yeeɠɛɠalai ma nii ɠima nuiti ti dɛɛni la. <verse eid="MAT 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17"/>Ʋele ɠana naama wooi ʋilɛni la su, nii GALA goo wo nui Zelemi boni ga:<verse eid="MAT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18"/>«Woo ɠa mɛnisu Lama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">kpee wooiti, ta gɔlɔ woo mɔinmɔingiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Lasɛle ɠa é ná-dointi saa wɔlɔi wosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">é la kɛɛni gaa ʋa nɛɛnɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">mazɔlɔɔ ti la mɔ ná.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:15">Zel 31:15</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Elɔde zaai ma, Maliɠii ná-geezuɠeelai gila ge ɠulani kɛlɛma Zozɛfe ʋɛ segi zu Ezipete. <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Wuzeɠe, è doungoi zeɠe ta dee, è ɠale ma Izilayɛle yooi zu, tɔɔzei zɔiti doungoi undaaʋili wɔin ɠɛa ti ma, naati ti zaa.»<verse eid="MAT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Zozɛfe wuzeɠeni, é doungoi ta dee zeɠe, é ɠale ma Izilayɛle yooi zu. <verse eid="MAT 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Kɛlɛ é mɛnigai ma ga Aalakelayuse ɠa masadai ɠɛɛzu Zudé yooi zu kɛɛɠɛ Elɔde ʋotogi zu, é luani ga dii vai ná. Tɛi GALA ge tɛnɛni segi zu, é liini ga Galilé yooi zu ʋele. <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/>É zei taa wolai ta zu nii daaseigi ga Nazalɛte, naa ɠa a kɛ naama wooi ʋilɛsu, nii GALA goo wo nuiti ti boni ga: «Daaseigi ɠa ɠɛ ga Nazalɛte nui.»<verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s">GALA keelai Zan Ɓatisete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maleke 1:1-8</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luke 3:1-18</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Zan 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1"/>Naama ziɛgi zu Zan Ɓatisete ɠulani kɛlɛma, é ɠɛni GALA daawooi laazeelizu teʋebai zu Zudé yooi zu. <verse eid="MAT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2"/>É ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: «À wo-ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo, tɔɔzei geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai maaɓuɠaa.» <verse eid="MAT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/>Zan ɠa GALA goo wo nui Ezayi vaani ma, siɛgi zu é ɠɛni la ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">«Nui ta ɠa ɓainsu teʋebai zu, é ɗa ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">‹À Maliɠii ná-pelei ɓɛtɛ bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">À ná-pele goiti sɔle.› »<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Eza 40:3</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>Zan ɠɔba zeɠei ɠɛni ga seɠei fɛlɛai ga ɲɔmɛ leɠai, ná-saamaɠiligi ɠɛni ga kɔlɔ ʋaai. Kɔnɔgi ɠɛni ga kotogi ta dɔɓɔ ɠɔin gulɔi. <verse eid="MAT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>Nuiti ti ɠɛni ʋaazu pɔ, ti zeɠe Zeluzalɛme, ta Zudé yooi zu ná pɛ, ta Zuludɛn ɠoba yooi pɛ su, <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>é ɗa ti ɓatize Zuludɛn wu, ti ɗa laa zɔ ga ga ta-ɠotoiti.<verse eid="MAT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>Faliziɛinti ta Saduseyɛinti ti ɠɛni ʋaazu pɔ ga mɔinɗa, ti ɓatize fai ma. É ɠɛni ti ma: «Pɛɛɠaali zuwuzuiti! Ɓɛ ɠa é wo ɠalaga ga wo ʋela GALA ná-ziiɠaawanai ʋa, é ʋaazu? <verse eid="MAT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>À kɛɛwotiiti kɛ, niiti ti dɛɛzu ga wo wo-ziɛ ʋelei maavaliboga. <verse eid="MAT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/>À mina ɠisiɛ nɔ, wo ʋa ɗa bo yiimaʋɛ ga: ‹Ada ga Abalaame mavofodaiti.› Mazɔlɔɔ gè bo wo ma, zobogi ɠa GALA bɛ, é kɔtui niiti falibo ga Abalaame mavofodaiti. <verse eid="MAT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/>Zoovɛi laa ɠana vɔlɔ gulu zapeiti ba. Gulu nɔpɛ é la gwaa ʋagɔ wosu, naa ɠa leʋe ga, é ʋili abui zu.<verse eid="MAT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>«Nɔ̀un, nà wo ɓatizesu ga ziɛi, é ɠɛ ga poogi ga wo wo-ziɛ ʋelei maavaliboga. Kɛlɛ zɔi é ʋaazu nɔ̀un poluma, sɛbɛi wɔɔlɔʋɛ nɔ̀nɔi ʋa. Gè la vɔlɔ kula ɠɛɛni su ga gè ʋa ná-saʋalagiti seɠe. Tɔun, toɠa wo ɓatize ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ta abui. <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/>Ná-sɛpɛgi ɠa zoni zea. Toɠa ná-molo loɠazuʋɛ ɓalesu, é moloi ɠaalɛ ba, é pu molo ɠotai zu, kɛlɛ toɠa molo ɠaʋai ɠala abui zu, nii é la zaa eyɛsu pɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɓatize fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maleke 1:9-11</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luke 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, Yesu zeɠeni Galilé yooi zu, é ʋa Zuludɛn ziɛlaʋɛ Zan ʋɔ bɛ, ga naa kpatize. <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Kɛlɛ Zan ɠɛni pɔ é ɠɛlɛ, é ɠɛ ma: «Nɔ̀un mu ka kpɛ̀dɛi ba ga è nɔ̀un kpatize, kɛlɛ ɗɔun ɗa ʋaazu pɔ̀ ɠale!» <verse eid="MAT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Va bu, é ɠɛ ɠana dɛ niima ziɛgi zu. Ʋele ɠana de maanɛai la, ga de GALA ziima vaiti daazeeli la.» Zan vaani naa wu. <verse eid="MAT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>Yesu ɓatizegai ma feya, é ɠulani ziɛi wu. Geeɠɔlɔgi laalaoni, é GALA Zɛnvui ɠa, é ɗa yei eɠɛ poopogi, é ʋa, é zei ma. <verse eid="MAT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/>Wooi ta ɠulani geeɠɔlɔgi zu, é ɠɛ ma: «Nii ɠa é ga nɛ̀ɛbɛ Loun Zunui, nii é gòla yiilaazu.»<verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s">Tɛgai nii é zeelini Yesu ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maleke 1:12-13</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luke 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>Naa ʋoluma, GALA Zɛnvui loni Yesu luɠɔ, é lii la teʋebai zu, nii a kɛ Inɛgi tɛ ga. <verse eid="MAT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>Kpegai ma ga zugi zo folo ʋuunaanigɔ (40) ta kpidi ʋuunaanigɔi (40) laawu, pului soni. <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Tɛga nui maaɓuɠani ba, é ɠɛ ma: «Tɛi è ga GALA Doun Zunui, devei ve kɔtui niiti zea, ti valibo ga ɓului.» <verse eid="MAT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: ‹Nui la zɛnvui woga ga daamianigi nɔ, kɛlɛ kɛni wooiti pɛ maaʋele ti ɠulazu GALA da.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">TSV 8:3</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>Naa ʋoluma, Inɛgi liini la Zeluzalɛme, taa ɲadegai, é pilɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ungaʋɛ, <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/>é ɠɛ ma: «Tɛi è ga GALA Doun Zunui, ʋili bu, mazɔlɔɔ sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: ‹Toɠa devei ve ná-geezuɠeelaiti zea ɗa-vaa zu.› Bogɛ ɓalaa ga: ‹Ta è la yeezu, nii a kɛ è-ɠɔɠɔi mina ziɠa kɔtu ʋa.› »<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Guy 91:11-12</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Sɛʋɛʋɛ ɓalaa GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: ‹Mina Maliɠii ɗa-ƓALAGI zuɠɔɠɔ.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">TSV 6:16</ref></char>.</char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Naa ʋoluma, Inɛgi liini la gize gaaɠooza golai ta unmaʋɛ, é eteai zu masadai pɛ dɛɛ la, naa ʋɛɛ ma lɛbiyai pɛ ba, <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>é ɠɛ ma: «Nà nii pɛ fe è ya, ni ɗa nɔkɔna bù.» <verse eid="MAT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>Názu ɠa Yesu ɠɛni ma la: «Zeɠe kòba, Setana! Tɔɔzei sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: ‹Nɔkɔ Maliɠii ɗa-ƓALAGI wu, tɔ ɠila kpe nɔ ɠa ɗa dɛbi.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">TSV 6:13</ref></char>.</char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>Naa ʋoluma, Inɛgi zeɠeni koba. Geezuɠeelaiti ti ʋaani, ti ɗa maaleʋebo.<verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ná-botii lɔɔzei vai Galilé</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maleke 1:14-15</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luke 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12"/>Yesu mɛnigai ma ga ti Zan ʋiligɛ kasoi ɠa, é liini Galilé yooi zu. <verse eid="MAT 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13"/>Naa ʋoluma, é zeɠeni Nazalɛte, é li, é zei Kapɛɛlɛnawume taazuʋɛ, Galilé ɗɛ wolai ɠobaʋɛ, Zaɓulɔn ta Nɛfɛtali ɠoʋii ma, <verse eid="MAT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>naa ɠa a kɛ GALA goo wo nui Ezayi wooi ʋilɛsu, nii é boni ga:<verse eid="MAT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>«Zaɓulɔn ta Nɛfɛtali yooi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">niiti ti kpoloɗɛi ma ʋelei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">Zuludɛn ziɛ ʋoluʋelei yooi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">Galilé yooi, ʋɛ zii ɠiligiti ti zeini ná:<verse eid="MAT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>Nuɓusɛi niiti ti zeini kpidii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">naati ti wozakala golai ʋɛtɛga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Niiti ti zooi zu kpidi ɓɔii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">wozakalagi ɠulaa naati bɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:15-16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 8:23-9:1">Eza 8:23—9:1</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>Naama ziɛgi zu ɠa Yesu tɔɔzeini la niina ga GALA daawooi laazeelia, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «À wo-ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo, tɔɔzei geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai maaɓuɠaa.»<verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ná-kaladopo mɔungiti toli fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maleke 1:16-20</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luke 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>Yeeta, Yesu yɛni leʋesu Galilé ɗɛ wolai laaʋɛ, é ɠɛɛɠɛloun felegɔ ɠa. Ma mɔungi laaseigi ɠɛni ga Simon (nii é lolisu ɓalaa ga Piyɛlɛ), kɛɛɠɛloin laaseigi ɠɛni ga Andelé. Ti ɠɛni kale ɓɛɛ lumɔi ʋilisu ziɛ wolai wu, tɔɔzei ti ɠɛni ga kale ɓɛɛ nuiti. <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «À ʋilɛ pòlu, nà wo ɠɛ ga nu ɠaiziɛ nu.» <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>Gaamago, ti ta-lumɔiti zɛni ná, ti ʋilɛ polu.<verse eid="MAT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>É yɛni liizu ga ná-pelei naa nɔ, é ɠɛɛɠɛloun felegɔ ɠiligaa ɠa: Zeɓedé ná-doun zunui Zake, ta kɛɛɠɛloin Zan. Ti ɠɛni keingi zu ta ti-ɠɛɛ Zeɓedé, ti ɗa ta-lumɔiti kpɛtɛ. É ti lolini. <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>Gaamago, ti ta-ɠeingi yɛni ná ta ti-ɠɛɛ, ti ʋilɛ Yesu ʋolu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kalagi wo fai <optbreak/> ta nuiti kɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luke 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>Naa ʋolu, Yesu ɠɛni leʋeteʋesu Galilé yooi zu ná pɛ, é ɗa kalagi wo GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu, é ɗa GALA ná-masadai ma Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli, é ɠɛni seeɓɛ nuiti ta maalɛɠɛfɛ nui ma zii pɛ kɛdɛsu. <verse eid="MAT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>Tɔɠɔi ɠulani, é zeeli Siili yooi zu ná pɛ. Ti ɠɛni ʋaazu pɔ ga seeɓɛ nuiti ta niiti kpein ti ɠɛni zoolɛzu ga ʋe kɛʋelei pɛ su, inɛ su nuiti, fɔlivɔli nuiti, kɔlɔsama nuiti, tama é ɠɛni naati pɛ kɛdɛsu. <verse eid="MAT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Bɛbɛ wolai ɠɛni ʋilɛsu polu, ti ɗa zeɠe Galilé yooi zu, ta Taa Wola Puugɔiti su, ta Zeluzalɛme, ta Zudé yooi zu, naa ʋɛɛ Zuludɛn ʋoluʋele yooiti ba.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="ms1">Yesu ná-tɛnɛ gooi gizei ma</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-7:29">5:1—7:29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>Yesu bɛbɛi ɠaai ma, é lɛɛni, é zei gizei ta unma. Ná-kaladopoiti ti maaɓɔni koba. <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>É tɔɔzeini ga é ɗa ti ɠala, é ɠɛni ti ma:<verse eid="MAT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Undaanɛ ɠitei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luke 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/>«Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga niiti ti ga bala nuiti zɛnvui zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:3">tɔɔzei geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai ɠa ga tɔnɔ.<verse eid="MAT 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga niiti ti ɠɔlɔzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:4">tɔɔzei GALA ka ti ɠaanɛɛnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga ɓɔɠɔmaayei nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:5">tɔɔzei GALA ka zooi ve ti ya ga tɔnɔ.<verse eid="MAT 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga niiti telebodai ma ʋului ta ma ɓɔle wɔin ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:6">tɔɔzei ta yiɠo.<verse eid="MAT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga niiti ti maawɔinɠai ɠɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:7">tɔɔzei GALA ka ti maawɔinɠa.<verse eid="MAT 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga niiti ti-yiimaʋɛ ɲadegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:8">tɔɔzei ta GALA ka.<verse eid="MAT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga niiti ti ʋaazu ga ziilɛigi ti-maaɠoolii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:9">tɔɔzei ta loli ga GALA dointi.<verse eid="MAT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga niiti wɔinzeɠemai zeelizu ti ma telebodai maaʋele ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:10">tɔɔzei geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai ɠa ga tɔnɔ.<verse eid="MAT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/>«Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga woye, siɛgi zu nuiti ti wo ʋoomusu da, ti wo wɔinzeɠe, ti zɛɛiti pɛ wo ma nɔ̀un maaʋele ma. <verse eid="MAT 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/>À ɠoozunɛ naazu ga gola, mazɔlɔɔ kulanuma wola ɠa wo ya geeɠɔlɔgi zu. Tɔɔzei ʋele nɔ ɠana ti GALA goo wo nuiti wɔinzeɠeni la, niiti ti leʋegai wo luɠɔ.<verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kpoloi ta wozakalagi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maleke 9:50</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luke 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>«Wa ɠa wo ga eteai ná-kpoloi. Kɛlɛ ni kpoloi ná-ɲɛmigi ɠa ɠulana ba, nu ɠa zoo feezu zea ɠale ʋolu? Kulanuma nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ba, kɛni niina é ʋili ya nɔ, nuiti ti ɗa ziɛ su. <verse eid="MAT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/>Wa ɠa wo ga eteai ná-wozakalagi. Taa wolai nii togai gize unmaʋɛ, naa la ɗa ga zoo lɔɔɠuzu. <verse eid="MAT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/>Nu la ɗa ga lanboi ɠaazoga, è ʋa dɔ aniɲakai wu, kɛlɛ nu mu ka ɗa sei lanbo zei anii ɠa, ʋɛ a ɠɛ zosu ná, é nuiti pɛ maa ɠɛ kala pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="MAT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/>Ʋele ɠana, wa-wozakalagi maanɛai é volo la nuiti gaazu, naa ɠa a kɛ ti wo-ɠɛɛ vaa ʋagɔiti pɛtɛ, ti lɛbiyai ve wo-Ɠɛɛ ʋɛ, nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu.<verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ta tɔgi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>«À mina ɠisiɛ ga nɔ̀un, pàaʋɛ ga gè naa ɠoloɠolo, nii sɛʋɛai GALA ná-tɔgi zu, ta GALA goo wo nuiti ta-zɛʋɛiti su. Gè la ʋaani ti ɠoloɠolo faa ma, kɛlɛ tɔun pàaʋɛ ga gè ti laazeeli. <verse eid="MAT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, geeɠɔlɔgi ta zooi ti ʋa ɠɛ ti leʋe, tɔgi ná tago nɔpɛ, ɓaa ma zɛʋɛ ɠaei ɠila kpalaa ge la ɲɛɛlɛa pɛ, eyɛsu ti pɛ ti ʋilɛ su. <verse eid="MAT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/>Naa ɠa é ba, zɔi nɔpɛ é niima leve goi gila kpalaa koloɠolosu, é zɛba é zɔiti ɓalaa kala ga ti kɛ ga tɔun kɛʋelei, naama nui ɠa a lɔi geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai zu. Kɛlɛ zɔi é ɠolozu ti ʋɛ, é zɔiti ɓalaa kala ga ti ʋokɔɠɔ ma, naama nui ɠa wɔɔlɔ geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai zu. <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/>Tɔɔzei gè bo wo ma, ni wo la ɠoloni GALA ziimai ʋɛ, wo ʋa ɓudɛ tɔ kalamɔinti ta Faliziɛinti maazu, wo la lɔa pɛ geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai zu.<verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kalagi é ʋilɛ ziiɠula vai ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>«Wo mɛnigɛ ga é woni ade-mɛmɛwolaiti ma ga: ‹Mina nu ʋaa. Zɔi a nu ʋaana, naama nui ná-tukpɔi ɠaa ɠa leʋe.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Ɛgz 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">TSV 5:17</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/>Kɛlɛ nɔ̀un, nà bosu wo ma ga: Zɔi nɔpɛ é yiiɠaawanazu kɛɛɠɛloin ma, naama nui ná-tukpɔi ɠaa ɠa leʋe. Zɔi a ɠɛ kɛɛɠɛloin ma: ‹Kibalama nui!›, tukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolaiti ta naama nui ná-tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe. Zɔi a ɠɛ kɛɛɠɛloin ma: ‹Ɠimalala nui!›, naama nui ɠa ʋili undaaʋili abui zu.<verse eid="MAT 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/>«Naa ɠa é ba, ni ɗa yɛna ʋaazu ɗa-ƓALA kɔɔi leʋesu zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, è-ɠigi loo ná zu ga è-ɠɛɛloin yiiɠaawanaʋɛ è ma fai ta zu, <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/>ɗa-ƓALA kɔɔi yɛ miná zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ laawuʋɛ, é li dɛ, wo yɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛ wa è-ɠɛɛloin. Naa ʋoluma ɗa ʋa niina, é ɗa-ƓALA kɔɔi leʋe.<verse eid="MAT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/>«Ni nui ta a è maaɓaazaɠa laana, zuvilɛ, wo yɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛ wa tɔ, siɛgi zu wo pelei zu la, wo ɗa li tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ, è-ɓɔɛɲɔɠɔi mina è ve tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui ya, naa ʋa è ve salaʋusui ya, naa ʋa è ʋili kasoi ɠa. <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/>Gè bo è ma ga gaamai, è la ɠulaa kasoi ɠa pɛ, kɛni ɗa ɓena ga ɗa walii pɛ sala.<verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kalagi é ʋilɛ wɛɛnziɛ fai ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>«Wo mɛnigɛ ga é woni ga: ‹Mina wɛɛnziɛ bo.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Ɛgz 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">TSV 5:18</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/>Kɛlɛ nɔ̀un, nà bosu wo ma ga: Zɔi nɔpɛ é wɛlɛzu anzanui ta ʋa, gaazuɠulapɔ, é ɓega ga wɛɛnziɛgi wo ta naa, ziimaʋɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/>Ni è-yeezazu ʋele ɠaazuɠɛzɛi ɠa é è loozu kotoi zu, kula su, è pili ya poun. Tɔɔzei fizɔgɛ è ma, è-ʋaalobazuʋɛ gila kpe nɔ undaaʋili, kɛlɛ è-ɓusɛi pɛ ge mina ʋili undaaʋili abui zu. <verse eid="MAT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/>Ni è-yeezazu ʋele yeei ɠa é è ʋilisu kotoi zu, teʋe ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, è pili ya poun. Tɔɔzei fizɔgɛ è ma, è-ʋaalobazuʋɛ gila kpe nɔ undaaʋili, kɛlɛ è-ɓusɛi pɛ ge mina ʋili undaaʋili abui zu.<verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kalagi é ʋilɛ vulu zaa vai ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Matiyo 19:9</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maleke 10:11-12</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luke 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>«É woni ɓalaa ga: ‹Zɔi é ɠɛlɛzu anzai ʋa, é vulu zaa zɛʋɛi ve naa ya.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 24:1">TSV 24:1</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/>Kɛlɛ nɔ̀un, nà bosu wo ma ga: Zɔi nɔpɛ é ɠɛlɛzu anzai ʋa, é ɠula koloɠolo faa ʋolu, toɠa naa liizu tɔun wɛɛnziɛgi ma. Zɔi ma é anzanu zeizu, nii sinigi ɠɛlɛai ba, tɔ ɓalaagi wɛɛnziɛgi ɠɛa.<verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kalagi é ʋilɛ kona wo fai ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>«Wo mɛnigɛ ga é woni ade-mɛmɛwolani ma ga: ‹Mina zɛɛ ɠona wo, kɛlɛ minazeɠegi nii è boga Maliɠii GALA bɛ konai maazu, kɛni è naa laazeeli.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:12">Lev 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 30:3">GlS 30:3</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/>Kɛlɛ nɔ̀un, nà bosu wo ma ga: À mina vɔlɔ kona nɔpɛ bo. À mina ɠona geeɠɔlɔgi ma, tɔɔzei naa ɠa é ga GALA ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi. <verse eid="MAT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/>À mina ɠona zooi ma, tɔɔzei naa ɠa é ga ná-kɔɠɔloma anii. À mina ɓalaa ɠona Zeluzalɛme ma, tɔɔzei tɔ ɠa é ga Masa golai ná-taa wolai. <verse eid="MAT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/>À mina ɓalaa ɠona wɔungi ma, tɔɔzei wo la zooga wɔundeɠai gila kpalaa kolezu ɓaa wo ʋa tɛi. <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/>Wa ɠɛna ɓɔɛa, à ɠɛ nɔ ‹Un,› ɓaa wo ɠɛ ‹Ɓa.› Nii kpein é ʋilɛsu naa ʋolu, naati ta ɠulazu Inɛgi ya.<verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kalagi é ʋilɛ potokulai ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luke 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>«Wo mɛnigɛ ga é woni ga: ‹Nu ɠaazuɠɛzɛi ʋoto ka ɠɛ ga nu ɠaazuɠɛzɛi, nu ɲiiga ʋoto ka ɠɛ ga nu ɲiiga.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 21:24">Ɛgz 21:24</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:20">Lev 24:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:21">TSV 19:21</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/>Kɛlɛ nɔ̀un, nà bosu wo ma ga: À mina wɔnɔ ʋotokula nu ɲɔu ma. Ni nu a è loɠana è-yeezazu ʋele woizuʋɛ, è-ɠɔʋɛzu ʋele gelei lete ma. <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/>Ni nui ta ɠa pɔ ga wo lukpɔ wa tɔ, é ʋa ɗa-zeɠewuzeɠei ɠula è ya, ɗa-zeɠe wolai ɓalaa yɛ zea. <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/>Ni nui ta a kɛɛna è ya ga zeeɠaaɓa, ga kɛni wa tɔ wo ziɛ ʋɔɔma ga kɔɠɔlo waagila (1.000), ɗɔun kɛ ga kɔɠɔlo waafelegɔ (2.000). <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/>Zɔi é è valizu, naa ɠɔ. Mina ʋoluave naama nui ʋa, nii é pɔ ga é ziingao bo è ma.<verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">È zili nui nɛɛ vai ʋɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luke 6:27-28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>«Wo mɛnigɛ ga é woni ga: ‹Ɗa è-zeiɲɔɠɔi nɛɛ ʋɛ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref></char>.</char></note> è è zili nui wɔinzeɠe.› <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/>Kɛlɛ nɔ̀un, nà bosu wo ma ga: À wo zili nuiti nɛɛ ʋɛ, wo GALA fali naati bɛ, ti wo wɔinzeɠezu, <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/>nii a kɛ wo-Ɠɛɛ nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu, wo ɠɛ ga ná-doun ɠiteɠitegiti. Tɔɔzei toɠa ɗa ná-foloi ɠula nu ɲɔiti ta nu ʋagɔiti bɛ, é tonai ʋu telebo nuiti ta telebotala nuiti bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/>Tɔɔzei ni wa naati nɔ nɛɛna ʋɛ, niiti ti wo nɛɛzu ʋɛ, lee ɠulanuma ɠa wa sɔlɔɔ? Ʋele nɔ lɛi mulu zo nuiti ti kɛɛzu la vɔlɔ ɓaa? <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/>Naa ʋolu lee ɠa wo kɛɛzu, nii é la ɠɛɛzu pɔlɔma, ni wa laaliizu wo-ɠɛɛlointi nɔ ma? Ʋele nɔ lɛi ɓalaa GALA kwɛɛtala nuiti ti kɛɛzu la ɓaa? <verse eid="MAT 5:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/>Naa ɠa é ba, à ɠaaɓa, wo laazeeli fai pɛ su, ʋelei wo-Ɠɛɛ laazeeliai la, nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu.<verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s">Kalagi é ʋilɛ faaɓɔɠɔ ɠɛɛ vai ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>«À dama ga wo ɠoloi ʋelei GALA bɛ, wo mina naa ɠɛ ga nuiti gaazu vaa nɔ, nii a kɛ ti ʋa ɗa wo ʋɛtɛ. Ni wa kɛɛna ɠana, wo la kulanuma zɔlɔɔga wo-Ɠɛɛ ya, nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu.<verse eid="MAT 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/>«Naa ɠa é ba, siɛgi zu ɗa ɠɛ faaɓɔɠɔ ɠɛɛzu la bala nuiti bɛ, mina puʋu fɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma, ga woovele nuiti kɛʋele GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu, ta pele zaamaʋɛti, ta ɗa naa ɠɛ, nii nɔ a kɛ nuiti ti ʋa ɗa ti lɛbi. Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, ta-ɠulanumai ɠana ti sɔlɔɔgai niina. <verse eid="MAT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/>Kɛlɛ ɗɔun, ɗa ɠɛna faaɓɔɠɔ nɔpɛ kɛa, è-ɠɔʋɛi mina faa ɠwɛɛ naa zu, nii è-yeezai kɛɛzu. <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/>Ɗa-vaaɓɔɠɔi ɠɛ dɔɔɠuzu. È-Ɠɛɛ nii é wozaɠaazu dɔɔɠui zu, naa ɠa kulanuma ve è ya.<verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kalagi é ʋilɛ GALA falii ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luke 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>«Siɛgi zu wo GALA falizu la, à mina ʋokɔɠɔ woovele nuiti ma, niiti ta ɗa ɠaalɔ GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu, ti ɗa GALA fali, ɓaa pele zaɠalaʋɛti, wɔin ɠa ɗa ɠɛ ti ma ga ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɗa ti ʋɛtɛ. Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, ta-ɠulanumai ɠana ti sɔlɔɔgai niina. <verse eid="MAT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/>Kɛlɛ ɗɔun, ɗa ɠɛna GALA falia, li è laa ʋɛlɛi wu, è pɛlɛi ʋilisu ɓɔɠɔ ma, è ɗa-ƓALA falii laazeeli è-Ɠɛɛ ma, nii é dɔɔɠuzuʋɛ. È-Ɠɛɛ nii é wozaɠaazu dɔɔɠuzuʋɛ, naa ɠa ɗa-ɠulanumai ve è ʋɛ.<verse eid="MAT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/>«Wa-ƓALA faliiti su, à mina ɗa ga wooi wola mɔin su, ga zii ɠiligiti kɛʋele, naati ta ɗa ɠisiɛ ga ta wola ɓɔɛna, naa ɠa a kɛ GALA ge ti woomɛni. <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/>À mina ʋokɔɠɔ ti ma, tɔɔzei wo-Ɠɛɛ kwɛɛ nii wo ɓɛdɛai ma, wo ʋa ɠɛ wo laa zeɠe ma, wo fali ma.<verse eid="MAT 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/>«Wɛlɛ ʋele ɠa wo maanɛai wo GALA fali la:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">Gi-Ɠɛɛ, ɗɛi è geeɠɔlɔgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">è-laaseigi ɲade.<verse eid="MAT 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/>Ɗa-masadai ʋaana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">è-yiimai ɠɛ zooi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">eɠɛʋelei é ɠɛɛzu la geeɠɔlɔgi zu.<verse eid="MAT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/>Za ɠɔnɔgi ve gi ʋɛ.<verse eid="MAT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/>Gi zuvaayɛ ga è wanama vaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">ʋelei gá ɓalaa gi nuiti suvaayɛsu la ga gi wanama vaiti.<verse eid="MAT 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/>Mina va bu, gi ʋa loo tɛgai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">kɛlɛ gi ɠizo faa ɲɔi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">[Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠa è-ʋo ge ga masadai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">ta zobogi, naa ʋɛɛ lɛbiyai ʋa, eyɛsu ɠɔ. Amina.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/>«Tɔɔzei ni wa zɔiti suvaayɛna ga ta-vaa ɲɔiti, wo-Ɠɛɛ, nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu, naa ɠa wa ɓalaa wo zuvaayɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/>Kɛlɛ ni wo la zɔiti suvaayɛni, wo-Ɠɛɛ ɓalaa ge la wo zuvaayɛga ga wa-vaa ɲɔiti.<verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kalagi é ʋilɛ zugi ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>«Siɛgi zu wo ɠɛɛzu zugi zosu da, à mina ɠaazuɠili ga woovele nuiti kɛʋele, ti ɠaazuɠilizu kɔlɔbɔbɔ, nii a kɛ ɛsɛ pɛ ge kwɛɛ ga ta zugi zu. Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, ta-ɠulanumai ɠana ti sɔlɔɔgai niina. <verse eid="MAT 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/>Kɛlɛ ɗɔun, siɛgi zu è zugi zosu da, ɠaazugba fo, è gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi ziɛ ɗɔungi ma, <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/>nii a kɛ è mina dɛɛ ga nuiti ga ɗa zugi zu. Kɛni è-Ɠɛɛ ɠila kpe nɔ, nii é è ɠoba dɔɔɠuzuʋɛ, tama è-Ɠɛɛ nii é wozaɠaazu dɔɔɠuzuʋɛ, naa ɠa kulanuma ve è ya.<verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Naavoloi makɛ vai geeɠɔlɔgi zu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luke 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>«À mina naavolo ɠaalɛ ba ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ zooi ma, ʋɛ ɓaɠaɓaɠaiti ta koikoigi ti aniiti koloɠolosu ná, ta ʋɛ unma nuiti ti pɛlɛiti daaɠalezu ná, ti unmai wo. <verse eid="MAT 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/>Kɛlɛ à naavoloi ɠaalɛ ba ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ geeɠɔlɔgi zu, ʋɛ ɓaɠaɓaɠaiti ta koikoigi ti la ani nɔpɛ koloɠolosu ná, ta ʋɛ unma nuiti ti la pɛlɛiti daaɠalezu ná, ti ʋa unmai wo. <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ʋɛ ɗa-naavoloi ná, miná ɠa è-yii ná ɓalaa.<verse eid="MAT 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kpusɛi ná-wozakalagi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luke 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>«Nu ɠaazuɠɛzɛiti ta ga eɠɛ lanboi kpusɛi ʋɛ. Naa ɠa é ba, ni è-ɠaazuɠɛzɛiti kɛdɛgɛ, è-ɓusɛi pɛ daa ɠa ve ga wozakalagi. <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/>Kɛlɛ ni è-ɠaazuɠɛzɛiti ti la ɠɛdɛni, è-ɓusɛi pɛ daa ɠa ve ga kpidii. Ni wozakalagi nii é è-ɠɔlɔ su, naa ɠa valibona ga kpidii, naama ɓidii è su, daawɔɔlɔʋɛ ɗɛ!<verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ɓaa naavoloi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luke 16:13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>«Nu nɔpɛ ge la zooga botii ɠɛɛzu maliɠi felegɔ ʋɛ ʋɔɔma. Kɛni nɔ é gila wɔinzeɠe, é zɔi nɛɛ ʋɛ, ɓaa é ɠili zɔi ʋa kpaan, é zɔi ʋɛlɛlala. Wo la zooga botii ɠɛɛzu GALA ta naavoloi ʋɛ ʋɔɔma.<verse eid="MAT 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nu la GALA da</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Luke 12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>«Naa ɠa é ba, nà bosu wo ma ga: À mina yiizoolɛ ga ɠɔnɔgi ma vaa ɓaa wo ɓɔɔle anii ma vaa, niiti wo ɓɛdɛi ti ʋa wo ʋa zɛnvui wo, ɓaa maaɠili zɔɔlaiti wo-ɓusɛi vaa zu. Nu yɛnvui la leʋeni ɠɔnɔgi ʋa ɓaa? Nu ɓusɛi la leʋeni maaɠili zɔɔlaiti ba ɓaa? <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/>À wɔniiti pɛtɛ dɛɛ. Ti la molo vazasu, ti la molo leʋezu, ti la ti-ɠɔnɔ gaalɛɛzu ba kota zu. Tama wo-Ɠɛɛ nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu, naa ɠa ti ɠɔnɔkulazu. Wo la vizɔni wɔniiti ba ɓaa? <verse eid="MAT 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/>Tɔun vɔlɔ wo zaama, ɓɛ ɠa a zoo ná-ziizoolɛi zu, é ta ɓɔ sii ma voloiti ba?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">é ta ɓɔ sii ma voloiti ba</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">é ta lo sɔligi la ga zeelo gila kɛɠala</char></note><verse eid="MAT 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/>«Lee vaa zu wo yiizoolɛzu ga maaɠili zɔɔlaiti fai? À pɛtɛ ʋelei tufa ʋuaiti ti wɔɔlɔzu la. Ti la botii ɠɛɛzu, ti la ɓalaa seɠe vɛlɛzu. <verse eid="MAT 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/>Tama nà bosu wo ma ga: Anɛɛ Salomɔn ɓɔɠɔi yɛgɛ ná-lɛbiyai pɛ su, kɛlɛ é la ɓɔɠɔ maaɠilini pɛ, é ʋa zeeli ti ɠila kpalaa su. <verse eid="MAT 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/>Ni GALA ka dɔɓɔzu lufai maaɠilizu ɠana, nii é ná za, lina é ʋaazu ʋilisu abui zu, é la wo maaɠilia, é ʋa leʋe tufai ʋa ɓaa? Ee, wa-ɠidaaleʋei lɔiʋɛ dɛ ɗɛ! <verse eid="MAT 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/>À mina yiizoolɛ mu, wo ʋa ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Lee ɠa ada mi?› ɓaa ‹Lee ɠa ada kpɔle?› ɓaa ‹Lee ɠa ada ɓɔɠɔ maaɠili la?› <verse eid="MAT 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/>Tɔɔzei, GALA kwɛɛtala nuiti ka ta ɗa naama aniiti pɛ gaiziɛ. Wo-Ɠɛɛ nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu, naa kwɛni ga wo ɓɛdɛi ɠa naati pɛ ba. <verse eid="MAT 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/>Kɛlɛ, à GALA ná-masadai ta ná-telebodai ɠaiziɛ mɔunpa, naa ʋoluma naa pɛ ka la maazu, é ve wo ya. <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/>À mina yiizoolɛ mu ga lina, lina ɠa yiizoolɛ ga ɓɔɠɔ. Folo ɠilagilagi ná-kpɔlɔi ɠa kula ɠɛ la.<verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s">Mina è-wɔɔlai lukpɔɠaaleʋe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luke 6:37-38</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>«À mina nu lukpɔɠaaleʋe, naa ɠa a kɛ GALA ge mina wo lukpɔɠaaleʋe. <verse eid="MAT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/>Tɔɔzei ʋelei wo zɔiti tukpɔɠaaleʋezu la, zenɔ ɠana GALA ka wo lukpɔɠaaleʋe la. Mazɔlɔɔ kɔɠɔ ganii nii nɔ wo kɔɠɔgi wosu su, GALA ka kɔɠɔgi wo ɓalaa naa zu wo ʋɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/>Lee vaa zu è ɠaazulosu kaʋa goi ʋa è-ɠɛɛloin ɠaazuʋɛ, ɗa ma, è la gulu ɠoozagi ɠaazu, kpadɔai ɗɔnɔi ma? <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/>È leʋe ɠale, è ɗa ɠɛ è-ɠɛɛloin ma: ‹Ɓɛ gè kaʋa goi ɠula è-ɠaazuɠɛzɛi ma,› ɗa ma, gulu ɠoozagi ɓadɔni ɗɔnɔ ma ɠaazuɠɛzɛi ma? <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/>Koo, woovele nui! Gulu ɠoozagi ɠula dɛ è-ɠaazuɠɛzɛi ma, naazu ɗa zoo wozaɠaazu ga pagɔ, è kaʋa goi ɠula è-ɠɛɛloin ɠaazuɠɛzɛi ma.<verse eid="MAT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>«À mina ani ɲadegaiti fe gilɛiti zea, naa ʋoluma à mina wa-ɠɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaagiti pili boigiti bu, ti ʋa ɠɔɠɔziɛ ti zu, ta gilɛiti ti ʋa ɠale ma wo ma, wo ʋaliʋali vai ma.<verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɔi é falii wosu, naa ɠa sɔlɔɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luke 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>«À falii wo, wa sɔlɔɔ. À gaiziɛ, wa ka. À pɛlɛi laaloɠa, daa ɠa lao wo ʋɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zɔi é falii wosu, naa ɠa sɔlɔɔ. Zɔi é gaiziɛi wosu, naa ɠa ka. Zɔi é pɛlɛi laaloɠazu, daa ɠa lao naa ʋɛ.<verse eid="MAT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/>«Wo zaama, ɓɛ ɠa a kɔtui ve ná-doun zunui ya, ni naa a ɓului valina ma? <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/>Ɓaa é kaalii ve ná-doun zunui ya, ni naa a kalei valina ma? <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/>Wɔigi wo wola ɲɔuɗai, ni wo ani ʋagɔi vee ʋelei ɠwɛɛ wo-lointi zea, wo-Ɠɛɛ nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu, naa la kɛa, é ʋa ɓudɛ wɔnɔi maazu ɓaa, é ʋa ani ʋagɔiti fe naati zea, niiti ti falizu ma.<verse eid="MAT 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/>«Nii nɔpɛ wo pɔ ga zɔiti ti kɛ wo ʋɛ, à naa ɠɛɠalai ɓalaa kɛ ti ʋɛ, tɔɔzei naama ɠalagi ɠa Moize ná-tɔ sɛʋɛi ta GALA goo wo nuiti ta-zɛʋɛiti ti bosu.<verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">À lɛ ga daa lɔizu ʋelei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luke 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>«À lɛ ga daa lɔizu ʋelei, tɔɔzei pelei nii é liizu undaaʋiligi zu, naama laaʋɛ wɔɔlɔʋɛ, ma ʋelei ɓalaa ziɛ vai la ɓaani, tama miná ʋele ɠa nu mɔinmɔingi liizu ná. <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/>Kɛlɛ pelei nii é liizu ga nu zɛnvui ʋɔ bɛ, naama laaʋɛ lɔiʋɛ, ma ʋelei ziɛ vai ɓaaʋɛ, kaa nui ɓalaa la mɔinni.<verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gului ta gaawaai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luke 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>«À dama ga zɛɛ ɠala goo wo nuiti. Ta ɠɛna ʋaa wo ʋɔ, ɗa ɠɛ nɔ baalagiti be, kɛlɛ zuluɓuiti be, ti vilaai. <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/>Wa ʋaazu ti ɠwɛɛsu ga ti-zɔgiti. Nu la ɗa ga leezɛn waai ɠula ɠain gului ɠa, nu la ɓalaa kooleɠoole gwaai ɠula ɠain ba wului ɠa. <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/>Gulu ʋagɔi ɠa ɗa gwaa ʋagɔi wo, gulu ɲɔi ɓalaa ka ɗa gwaa ɲɔi wo. <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/>Gulu ʋagɔi la zooga gwaa ɲɔu wosu, ʋele ɠana é la ga gulu ɲɔi, é la zooga gwaa ʋagɔ wosu. <verse eid="MAT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/>Gului nɔpɛ é la gwaa ʋagɔ wosu, naa ɠa leʋe ga, é ʋili abui zu. <verse eid="MAT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/>Naa ɠa é ba, wa ʋaazu zɛɛ ɠala goo wo nuiti kwɛɛsu ga ti-zɔgiti.<verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kaladopo ɠiteiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luke 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>«Nii pɛgi é ɠɛɛzu mà: ‹Màliɠii, Màliɠii,› naati pɛ tɛi ti ʋa ɠɛ lɔɔzu geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai zu, kɛlɛ, Kɛ̀ɛ nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu, zɔiti nɔpɛ ti naa yiima vai ɠɛɛzu, naati ka ta lɔ su. <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/>Naama volo ná, nu mɔinmɔin ka ɠɛ mà: ‹Màliɠii, Màliɠii! Kɛbɛ gá ɠa gi ɠɛni GALA gooi wosu è-laaseigi zu? Kɛbɛ gá ɠa gi ɠɛni inɛgiti kpɛɛzu è-laaseigi zu? Kɛbɛ gá ɠa gi ɠɛni laavɔɔ vaa mɔinmɔingiti kɛɛzu è-laaseigi zu?› <verse eid="MAT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/>Naazu nà ti wooɠaaʋote, gè ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Gè la wo ɠwɛɛ kaipa. À maaɠooza bà, wɔi wo ga tɔ koloɠolo nuiti!›<verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɛlɛ lo nu felegɔiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luke 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>«Naa ɠa é ba, zɔi nɔpɛ é gòoi niiti mɛnisu, é ti ɠɛ, naama nui ɠɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ ɠima nui, nii é ná-pɛlɛi logai fasai ma. <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/>Tonai ʋaani, ziɛiti ti ve, fiilɛ wolai lokoleʋe, é loɠa pɛlɛi naa zu, kɛlɛ pɛlɛi naa la ɠoloni pɛ, tɔɔzei tɔɔɓadɔgɛ fasai ma. <verse eid="MAT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/>Kɛlɛ zɔi nɔpɛ é gòoi niiti mɛnisu, é la ti ɠɛɛni, naama nui ɠɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ ɠimalala nui, nii é ná-pɛlɛi logai ɲaɠaegi zu. <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/>Tonai ʋaani, ziɛiti ti ve, fiilɛ wolai lokoleʋe, é loɠa pɛlɛi naa zu, pɛlɛi naa ɠolo, é ɠoloɠolo mɛtu.»<verse eid="MAT 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28"/>Yesu ɓegai ma ga kalagi naati bo, bɛbɛi wola laavɔɔni ga ná-kalabo pelei, <verse eid="MAT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29"/>tɔɔzei é la ɠɛni kalagi wosu ga ta-lɔ kalamɔinti kɛʋele, kɛlɛ é ɠɛni bosu ga zobogi.<verse eid="MAT 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu gee nui ɠɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maleke 1:40-45</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luke 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>Yesu zeɠeai ma gizei ma, é yei, bɛbɛ wolai ʋilɛni polu. <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>Gee nui ta maaɓuɠani ba, é nɔkɔ kɔɠɔwu, é ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, ni ɗa vaana bu, ɗa zoo è ɲàde.»<verse eid="MAT 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>Yesu yeemaaleni, é vɔɔɠu ba, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè vaa bu, ɲade!» Gaamago nɔ, zunui naa ɲadeni, é ɠula ná-gee zeeɓɛi zu. <verse eid="MAT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Dama, nii kɛai ga ɗe ʋɛ, è mina bo nu nɔpɛ ma. Kɛlɛ li, è ɓɔɠɔ lɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nui, é è ɠɛʋele ʋɛtɛ, naa ʋoluma è zalaɠai ɠula, eɠɛʋelei Moize ma levei veeni la. Naa ɠa ɠɛ ga zeele woo, nuiti bɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu salaʋusu ɠundiɠii <optbreak/> ná-botiɠɛ nui ɠɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luke 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>Yesu lɛɛzuʋɛ Kapɛɛlɛnawume taazuʋɛ, Wɔlɔme zalaʋusu ɠundiɠi gila ge daaɠomini, é maanɛɛnɛ, <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>é ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, nà-botiɠɛ nui ɠa laani nà-pɛlɛi wu, kɔlɔgi zaai ma, toɠa zoolɛzu ga ʋe gola.» <verse eid="MAT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Nà liizu, gè kɛdɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>Salaʋusu ɠundiɠii ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, gè la kula ɠɛɛni su ga è ʋa lɛ nà-pɛlɛi wu. Kɛlɛ woo ɲɛ gila bo nɔ, nà-botiɠɛ nui ɠa ɠɛdɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>Tɔɔzei nà ɓɔɠɔi nà nà-kundiɠiiti ta-zobogi wu, salaʋusuiti ɓalaa ta nà-devei wu. Nà ɠɛɛna gila ma: ‹Li!›, toɠa liizu. Nà ɠɛɛna taɠili ma: ‹Ʋa!›, toɠa ʋaazu. Nà ɠɛɛna ɓalaa nà-duɔi ma: ‹Nii ɠɛ!›, naa ɠa é kɛɛzu.»<verse eid="MAT 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>Yesu naama wooi mɛnigai ma, gola laavɔɔni. É ɓɔɛni nuiti pɔ, ti ɠɛni polu, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, gè la dɛ nii ɠɛɠala ɠidaaleʋei ta ɠaani, anɛɛ Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti saama. <verse eid="MAT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/>Gè bo wo ma, nu mɔinmɔin ka zeɠe folo ɠulazu ʋelei ta folo liizu ʋelei, ti ʋa, ti zei fɛti laamii wo taɓalii ɠakala ta Abalaame, ta Izaake, naa ʋɛɛ Zakɔɓe ʋa, geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai zu. <verse eid="MAT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/>Kɛlɛ zɔiti mu maanɛɛni ga ti geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai zɔlɔɔ ga tɔnɔ, naati ta ʋili ya etea ʋelei kpidii zu. Miná ɠa gɔlɔi ta ɲiiga ziɛgai ɠa ɠɛ ná.»<verse eid="MAT 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>Naa ʋoluma, Yesu ɠɛni salaʋusu ɠundiɠii ma: «Li ɗa-ɠoizu, é ɠɛ è ʋɛ, eɠɛʋelei soloogai la ɗa-ɠidaaleʋei ma.» Naama yeeɠɛɠalai nɔ, ná-botiɠɛ nui ɠɛdɛni.<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu seeɓɛ nu mɔinmɔin kɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maleke 1:29-34</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luke 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>Naa ʋoluma, Yesu liini Piyɛlɛ ná-pɛlɛi wu. É naa mɔɛin ɠaani laani ga kɔlɔkpadimai. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>É naa zoni zeei ʋa, kɔlɔkpadimai ɠaayei. Anzanui wuzeɠeni, é tɔɔzei ga é ɗa maaleʋebo.<verse eid="MAT 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Kpɔkɔi zeeliai ma, ti ʋaani pɔ ga inɛ su nu mɔinmɔin. É zɛnvu ɲɔi naati kpɛɛni ga daawooi nɔ. É seeɓɛ nuiti pɛ kɛdɛni ɓalaa. <verse eid="MAT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/>Ʋele ɠana GALA goo wo nui Ezayi laawooi ʋilɛni la su, nii é boni ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">«Ada-maalɛɠɛfɛgiti ka é ti zeɠeni ga ɠasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">é ada-zeeɓɛ ɠasɔiti daani ɓɔɠɔ unma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Eza 53:4</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nu fai pɛ zɛ ná, è ʋilɛ Yesu ʋolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luke 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>Siɛgi zu Yesu kaani la ga bɛbɛi ɠakugɛ ma, é devei veeni ná-kaladopoiti zea ga ti leʋe ziɛ ʋoluʋelei. <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>Tɔ kalamɔin ɠila ge maaɓuɠani ba, é ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn, ʋɛ nɔpɛ è liizu ná, nà ʋilɛsu è ʋolu.» <verse eid="MAT 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Zeɠei ɠa zazagoiti bɛ, daɠagi ɠɛ wɔniiti bɛ, kɛlɛ ada la Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋɛ, ʋɛ a ungi la ná.»<verse eid="MAT 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>Kaladopoi taɠili ge ɠɛni ma: «Màliɠii, va bu, gè li dɛ, gè kɛ̀ɛ maaɠulu.» <verse eid="MAT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗɔun, ʋilɛ nɔ pòlu, gɔvɛiti zɛ ná, ti ta-ʋoomaiti maaɠulu.»<verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu fiilɛ wolai ɠaayei vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maleke 4:35-41</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luke 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>É lɛɛni keingi zu ta ná-kaladopoiti. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Gaamago fiilɛ wolai lokoleʋeni ziɛi ɠa, ziɛ lakpatakpagiti ti keingi maaɓɔle, ti ɗa ɓudɛ maazu. Naama ziɛgi zu Yesu ɠɛni laani, é ɗa ɲi. <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>Kaladopoiti ti maaɓuɠani ba, ti maaloɠa, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, gi ɠizo, gi undaa ɠana ʋili!» <verse eid="MAT 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Lee vaa zu wo luazu? Ee, wa-ɠidaaleʋei lɔiʋɛ gola!» É wuzeɠeni, é devei ve fiilɛi ta ziɛi ya ga sɛbɛi, woza ɠaalɛi tɔɔntɔɔn. <verse eid="MAT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>Ti pɛ ti laavɔɔni, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Nui ma zii ɓɛgele ɠa ga zunui tɛi, nii fiilɛi ta ziɛi ti ɠolozu gooi ʋɛ?»<verse eid="MAT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu inɛ su nu felegɔiti balo vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maleke 5:1-20</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luke 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>Seeliai ma ziɛi ʋoluʋelei, Gadala nuiti ta-yooi zu, inɛ su zunu felegɔ ɠulani kabama ʋelei, ti ʋa, ti daaɠomi. Ti ɲɔu ʋelei ma, nu nɔpɛ ge la ɓena zoo, é ʋa leʋe ga naama ʋelei. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/>Ti tɔɔzeini ga ɓainga, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «GALA Doun Zunui, lee ɠa è pɔ ga è sei gi ma? È ʋaaʋɛ gi ɓɔlɔzu ma yeeluɠɔ ɓaa?»<verse eid="MAT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Ná ɠobaʋɛ, boi kpulu gola ɠɛni ná, ti ɗa daamii wo. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Inɛgiti ti Yesu maanɛɛnɛni ga gola, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ni ɗa ʋaazu gi ɓɛɛzu, gi leʋe, gi lɔ boi kpulugi nuu zu.» <verse eid="MAT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «À li!» Inɛgiti ti ɠulani zunu felegɔi naati su, ti lɔ boigiti su. Gaamago, boi kpulugi pɛ ge yeini ga kpizɛ gize ɠakazuʋɛ, ti ʋu ziɛi wu, ti pɛ ti undaaʋili ziɛi wu. <verse eid="MAT 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Boi makɛ nuiti ti ʋelani, ti li taazuʋɛ, ti naa pɛ suɠula, nii é ɠɛɛni ga inɛ su zunu felegɔiti. <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Naazu, taazuʋɛ nuiti pɛ ti ɠulani, ti Yesu laaɠomi. Ti kaai ma, ti maanɛɛnɛni ga é zeɠe ta-yooi ɠa.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kɔlɔsama nui ɠɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maleke 2:1-12</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luke 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>Yesu lɛɛni keingi ta zu, é ziɛi ɓudɛ, é li ná-taazu. <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>Ti ʋaani pɔ ga kɔlɔsama nui ta, é laani betei zu. Yesu ta-ɠidaaleʋei ɠaai ma, é ɠɛni kɔlɔsama nui ma: «Dòun, zɛbɛzeɠe! Ɗa-ɠotoiti suvaayɛga.»<verse eid="MAT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Tama, tɔ kalamɔin tanigaa niiti ti ɠɛni ná, ti ɠisiɛni, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma ɠisu: «Zunui nii ɠa woo ɲɔiti bosu GALA daalɔɠɔma!» <verse eid="MAT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>Yesu ta-ɠisiɛi ɠwɛɛni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Lee vaa zu wo kisiɛ ɲɔi naa wosu wo-yiimaʋɛti? <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/>Ɓɛgele ɠa boda nɛai, nu ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɗa-ɠotoiti suvaayɛga,› ɓaa nu ɠɛ ma: ‹Wuzeɠe, è ziɛ›? <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/>Wa ma, wa kwɛɛ ga nii maaʋele ga zobogi ɠa Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋɛ zooi ma ga é kotoiti suvaayɛ.» É zɛba é ɠɛ kɔlɔsama nui ma: «Wuzeɠe, è ɗa-ʋetei zeɠe, è li ɗa-ɠoizu.» <verse eid="MAT 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>Zunui naa wuzeɠeni, é li ná-koizu. <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>Bɛbɛi miná ɠaai ma, ti wola luani, ti ɗa lɛbiyai ve GALA bɛ, nii é nii ɠɛɠala zobogi veai nuiti bɛ.<verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Matiyo loli fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maleke 2:13-17</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luke 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Yesu zeɠeni ná, é ɗa li. Siɛgi zu é ɠɛni leʋesu la, é zunui ta ɠaani, é zeini mulu zo nuiti ta-wotii ɠɛɛzuʋɛ, daaseigi ɠɛni ga Matiyo. Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Ʋilɛ pòlu!» Matiyo wuzeɠeni, é ʋilɛ polu.<verse eid="MAT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>Tɛi Yesu ɠɛni laamiizu pɛlɛi wu, mulu zo nu mɔinmɔin ta kotoba nu mɔinmɔin ti ʋaani, ti ɗa laami, ta Yesu ta ná-kaladopoiti. <verse eid="MAT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/>Faliziɛinti ti miná ɠaai ma, ti Yesu ná-kaladopoiti gaazaɠani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Lee vaa zu wa-ɠalamɔin daamii wosu ta mulu zo nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kotoba nuiti ba?»<verse eid="MAT 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>Kɛlɛ tɛi Yesu ti woomɛnini, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Zɔiti ti ɠɛdɛgai, naati kpɛdɛ la ɗɔɠɔtɔlɔi ʋa, kɛni seeɓɛ nuiti. <verse eid="MAT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/>À li mu, wo niima wooi ʋoluʋɛ ɠaaɠa, nii GALA ge boni ga: ‹Wɔ̀inʋɛ ga gaazumaawɔinɠai, é leʋe zalaɠaiti ba.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Woz 6:6</ref></char>.</char></note> Tɔɔzei nɔ̀un gè la ʋaani ga gè telebo nuiti toli, kɛni kotoba nuiti.»<verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zu so fai ma ɠaazaɠagi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maleke 2:18-22</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luke 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>Zan ná-kaladopoiti ti zɛba ti maaɓuɠa Yesu ʋa, ti gaazaɠa, ti ɠɛ ma: «Lee vaa zu gɔun gá Faliziɛinti, gi ɗa zugi zo, tama ɗa-ɠaladopoiti ti la ɗa ga so?» <verse eid="MAT 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nuiti ti loligai vulu ɠɛɛzuʋɛ, ta zoo ɓaa ti ɠɛ gaazuɠilii zu, siɛgi zu anzazini niinɛi ti ʋa la dɛ? Ɓa-o! Kɛlɛ yeeɠɛɠalai ta ɠa ʋaazu, siɛgi zu ta anzazini niinɛi zeɠe la ti ʋa. Názu ta zugi zo niina. <verse eid="MAT 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/>Nu nɔpɛ ge la ɗa ga seɠe zaɠaiti seiɗa ta seɠe ɓuɠa niinɛi. Naa ɠa ɠɛɛna, seɠe ɓuɠa niinɛi ɠa seɠe zaɠai ʋali ga, naama ʋaligai zu ɠa ɗa ɓaɠo ma mɔungi ʋa. <verse eid="MAT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/>Nu la ɗa ga dɔɔ niinɛi ʋu ɓalaa kɔlɔ woole wɔlɔmaiti su. Naa ɠa ɠɛɛna, kɔlɔ woole wɔlɔmaiti ta vuka, dɔɔi ɠa ʋu ya, gooleiti ta ɠoloɠolo. Maanɛɛʋɛ ga dɔɔ niinɛi ʋu kɔlɔ woole niinɛiti su, naazu ti felegɔ ti makɛgɛ ga pagɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zayiluse ná-doun anzanui <optbreak/> ta ɲama ɠula koozu anzanui</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maleke 5:21-43</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luke 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>Siɛgi zu Yesu ɠɛni naa wosu la ti ma, Zuifu ɠundiɠii ta ʋaani, é ʋilɛ ɲiibiɠa kɔɠɔwu, é ɠɛ ma: «Dòun anzanui zaa ɠani nɔ feya, kɛlɛ ʋa, è yeela ma, toɠa vulu ʋolu.» <verse eid="MAT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>Yesu ta ná-kaladopoiti ti ʋilɛni polu, ti ɗa li.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20"/>Anzanui ta ʋaani, nii é kɛɛni ɲama ɠula koozu zeeɓɛi zu ga kona puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). É maaɓuɠani Yesu ʋa ga poluʋelei, é yeevɔɔɠu ná-seɠei laamaʋɛ ʋa. <verse eid="MAT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21"/>Tɔɔzei é ɠɛni bosu ɠisu ga: «Ni nà zoona nɔ gè yeevɔɔɠu ná-seɠei ʋa, nà ʋalo.» <verse eid="MAT 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>Yesu latini, tɛi é kaani, é ɠɛni ma: «Dòun anzanu, zɛbɛzeɠe, tɛi è laa dà, è ʋaloa.» Gaamago nɔ, anzanui ʋaloni.<verse eid="MAT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>Siɛgi zu Yesu zeelini la Zuifu ɠundiɠii ná-pɛlɛi wu, é koole vɛɛ nuiti kaani ta bɛbɛi, ti ɗa zɔngɔi wo. <verse eid="MAT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «À zeɠe ʋɛ, tɔɔzei anzanu loungoi la zaani, toɠa ɲiizu nɔ.» Kɛlɛ nuiti ti ɠɛni ɲɛɛɠulazu su. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Ti nuiti kulaai ma eteaʋɛ, é lɛɛni pɛlɛi wu, é anzanu loungoi zoni zeei ʋa, naa wuzeɠe. <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Naama vai ma wooi vazani ná maaɠoolii zu ná pɛ.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu gaazuɠole nu felegɔ ɠɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>Tɛi Yesu ɠɛni liizu, gaazuɠole nu felegɔ ʋilɛni polu, ti ɗa kpeei loo, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Davide ná-Doun Zunui, gi ɠaazumaawɔinɠa!» <verse eid="MAT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>Siɛgi zu é lɛɛni la pɛlɛi wu, gaazuɠole nu felegɔiti ti maaɓuɠani ba. Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Wo laaʋɛ da nɛi ga nà zoo gè naa ɠɛ wo ʋɛ?» Ti ɠɛni ma: «Gi laaʋɛ naa la, Màliɠii.» <verse eid="MAT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>É zɛba é yeevɔɔɠu ti-ɠaazuʋɛti ba, é ɠɛ ti ma: «É ɠɛ wo ʋɛ eɠɛʋelei wa-ɠidaaleʋei la.» <verse eid="MAT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>Tama ti-ɠaazuʋɛti ti zeɠeni ma gaamanɔ. Yesu ti laa maaɓakpani kpaan, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Nu nɔpɛ ge mina faaɠwɛ niima vai zu pa.» <verse eid="MAT 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Kɛlɛ ti liini, ti ɗa Yesu ná-fai wo naama yooi zu ná pɛ.<verse eid="MAT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɓoɓoi ɠɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>Ti ɠula ziɛgi zu pɛlɛi wu, nui tanigaa ti ʋaani pɔ ga inɛ su nu ɠila, é ga ɓoɓoi. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Tɛi Yesu inɛgi ɓɛɛni nɔ feya, ɓoɓoi tɔɔzeini ga é ɗa ɓɔɛ. Bɛbɛi wola laavɔɔni, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Kaipa nii ɠɛɠala vai ta la dɛ ɠɛɛni Izilayɛle yooi zu.» <verse eid="MAT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/>Kɛlɛ Faliziɛinti ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: «Inɛ kundiɠii ná-zobogi ɠa é inɛgiti kpɛɛzu la.»<verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛbɛi maawɔin Yesu zo fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>Yesu ɠɛni leʋeteʋesu taa goiti ta taa wolaiti pɛ su, é ɗa kalagi wo ta-ƓALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu, é ɗa GALA ná-masadai ma Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli, ta é ɗa seeɓɛi ta maalɛɠɛfɛgi ma zii pɛ kɛdɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/>É bɛbɛi ɠaai ma, ti maawɔin soni, tɔɔzei ti ɓɔlɔni, ti iɲɔteʋeai eɠɛ baalagi niiti makɛ nu la ti ʋɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/>Yesu zɛba é ɠɛ ná-kaladopoiti ma: «Molo mɔɔi wola zuwɔɔlɔʋɛ, kɛlɛ botiɠɛ nuiti ti la mɔinni. <verse eid="MAT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/>À kpala kɛɛ nui maanɛɛnɛ mu, é botiɠɛ nuiti teʋe ná-molo leʋezuʋɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu yiimazeɠe vai ga <optbreak/> keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maleke 3:13-19</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luke 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>Yesu ná-keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) tolini, é zobogi ve ti ya ga ti ɗa kɔzɔba yɛnvuiti kpɛ, ti ɗa seeɓɛ nuiti ta maalɛɠɛfɛ nuiti kɛdɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) daaseigiti kaa: ma mɔungi Simon, nii é lolisu ga Piyɛlɛ, ta kɛɛɠɛloin Andelé, Zeɓedé ná-doun zunuiti Zake, ta kɛɛɠɛloin Zan, <verse eid="MAT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>Filipe ta Ɓaatelemi, Tomase ta Matiyo mulu zo nui, Alefé ná-doun zunui Zake, ta Tadé, <verse eid="MAT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>Simon nii é ɠɛni ga Zou Maalobo Nui ta, naa ʋɛɛ Zudase Isekaliyɔte ʋa, nii é Yesu yaavani.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) teʋe fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maleke 6:7-13</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luke 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>Nu puugɔ maazu felegɔi (12) naati ka Yesu ti leʋeni, siɛgi zu é ɓeni la ga falii niiti bo ti ma ga: «À mina li zii ɠiligiti pɔ pelei. À mina lɛ Samali laai tanɔpɛ su. <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/>Kɛlɛ tɔun à li Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ pelei ti ɠɛai eɠɛ baalagiti ti loai ya. <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/>Ʋɛ nɔpɛ wa leʋe ná, à Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi nii laazeeli, ga geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai maaɓuɠaa. <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/>À seeɓɛ nuiti kɛdɛ, wo gɔvɛiti buzeɠe, wo gee nuiti ɲade, wo inɛgiti kpɛ. Wo sɔlɔɔgɛ ga vebɛi, wa ɓalaagi à teʋe ga vebɛi. <verse eid="MAT 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/>À mina zanu seɠe ɓaa wali, ɓaa wali ɠae ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛgi. <verse eid="MAT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/>À mina ɓɔlɔ zeɠe siɛi wo fai zu, ɓaa seɠewuzeɠe felegɔ, ɓaa saʋala, ɓaa tukpɔ, mazɔlɔɔ botiɠɛ nui maanɛɛʋɛ é ɠɔnɔ sɔlɔɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/>«Siɛgi zu wo zeelizu la taa wolai ta zu ɓaa taa goi ta zu, à nu ɠaiziɛ, nii a yeezei wo wu. À yɛ naama nui ʋɔ bɛ, eyɛsu wo zeɠena yeeɠɛɠalai zeeli. <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/>Wa ɠɛna kpofalagi ɓudɛa, à laali pɛlɛi wu nuiti ma. <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/>Ni ta yeezeina wo wu, wa-yiilɛigi ɠa yei ti ma. Kɛlɛ ni ti la yeezeini wo wu, wa-yiilɛigi ɠa ɠaaɠale ma wo ʋɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/>Taai nɔpɛ wa lɛ su, ɓaa pɛlɛi nɔpɛ wa lɛ bu, ni nuiti ti la pɔ ga ti ʋa yeezei wo wu, ɓaa ti ʋa woilo wo-wooi ma, à ɠula ná ʋa, wo fufiligi ɓukpunɛ, é ɠula wo-ɠɔɠɔiti ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Naama vai ɠa dɛɛzu ga kaladopoiti maavaa la mɔ taai naa zu nuiti ba, ti ɓɛdɛ la mɔ vɔlɔ fufiligi ʋa pɛai ti-ɠɔɠɔiti ma.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, tukpɔɠaaleʋe voloi, naama laai ná-tukpɔi ɠa ɓaa, é leʋe Sɔdɔme ta Gomɔɔl laaiti tɔnɔi ʋa.»<verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faaɓaagiti ti siɛi zu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Maleke 13:9-13</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luke 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>«Wɛlɛ, nà wo leʋesu eɠɛ baalagiti, zuluɓuiti saama. Naa ɠa é ba, à ɠeleɠele eɠɛ kaalii, wa-vai ɠaanɛ eɠɛ poopogiti. <verse eid="MAT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/>À dama, tɔɔzei ta ʋaazu liizu ga woye tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛti. Ta wo loɠa ta-ƓALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu. <verse eid="MAT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/>Ta wo zo ga maaɓa, ti li ga woye kundiɠiiti ta masagiti kakala nɔ̀un maaʋele ma, nii a kɛ wo zeele wooi wo Zuifuiti ta zii ɠiligiti ma. <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/>Kɛlɛ siɛgi zu ti liizu la ga woye tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ, à mina yiizoolɛ ga ʋelei wa ɓɔɛ la, ɓaa nii wa bo, tɔɔzei naa ɠa ve wo ya ma yeeɠɛɠalai nɔ zu. <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/>Mazɔlɔɔ wa lɛi wo ʋa ɠɛ ɓɔɛzu, kɛlɛ wo-Ɠɛɛ ná-Zɛnvui ɠa é ʋaazu ɓɔɛzu ga wo-laaʋɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/>«Ɠɛɛɠɛloin ɠa kɛɛɠɛloin leʋe ga ti paa, doun kɛɛɠɛi ɠa ná-doin leʋe ga ti paa. Dointi ta wuzeɠe ti zɔlɔɔ nuiti daalɔɠɔma, ti ti lɔ saai zu. <verse eid="MAT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/>Ɛsɛ pɛ ka wo wɔinzeɠe nɔ̀un maaʋele ma. Kɛlɛ zɔi a lo kpaan eyɛsu gaaɓelasuʋɛ zeeli, naa ɠa ɠizo. <verse eid="MAT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/>Ni ta wo wɔinzeɠena taai ta zu, à ʋela, wo li taa ɠili su. Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, wo la ɓega ga Izilayɛle laaiti pɛ suɓizɛ, eyɛsu Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋa.»<verse eid="MAT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/>«Kaladopoi la leʋeni ná-kalamɔin ʋa, ɓaa botiɠɛ nui ʋa leʋe maliɠii ʋa. <verse eid="MAT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/>Nii soloogai kaladopoi ma, naa ɠa ga é ɠɛ ga ná-kalamɔin ɠɛʋele, botiɠɛ nui ɓalaa ɠɛ ga maliɠii ɠɛʋele. Ni ti pɛlɛ kɛɛɠɛi levea ga Ɓeelezeɓule,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ɓeelezeɓule</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Daaseigi feai inɛgi ya, é dɛɛzu ga tɔ ɠa é ga zɛnvu ɲɔiti ta-ɠundiɠii.</char></note> ti la pɛlɛ wu nuiti poomuga, é ʋa leʋe naa ʋa ɓaa?<verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɔi maanɛai nu lua ba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luke 12:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>«Naa ɠa é ba, à mina lua naama nuiti ba pa. Tɔɔzei maalɔɔɠu vaa nɔpɛ ge la ná, nii é la ɠulaa kɛlɛma. Dɔɔɠuzu vaa nɔpɛ ge la ná, nii é la ɠwɛɛga. <verse eid="MAT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/>Nii gè bosu wo ma dɔɔɠuzu, à naa wo kɛlɛmaʋɛ. Nii ti laaʋɛɛzu wo-woiyeɠei la, ti bo, à wooɠula ga naa, é wo pɛlɛ ɠɔmaʋɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/>À mina lua naati ba, niiti ta zoo nui ɓusɛi nɔ ʋaazu, kɛlɛ zobo ge la ti ʋɛ, ti ʋa zɛnvui ʋa. Kɛlɛ à lua GALA ba, nii zobogi bɛ é kpusɛi ta zɛnvui undaaʋili abui zu. <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/>Nu la ɗa ga soolo felegɔi ʋɔdia ga wali ɠae ɠila ɓaa? Tama ti ɠila kpalaa ge la ɗa ga loa zooi ma, ni wo-Ɠɛɛ GALA ge la vaani bu. <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/>Kɛlɛ wɔun vɔlɔ, wɔundeɠai pɛ gaalugɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/>À mina lua mu, wo vizɔgɛ soolo kpulugiti ba.»<verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nu ɠeke suziɠa vai ga Kilista ná-faa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luke 12:8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>«Zɔi nɔpɛ a ɠeke suziɠa ga nà-faa nuiti gaazu, nà ɓalaa nà ɠeke suziɠa ga naama nui ná-faa Kɛ̀ɛ ɠaazu, nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu. <verse eid="MAT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/>Kɛlɛ zɔi nɔpɛ é ɠɛlɛzu bà nuiti gaazu, nà ɓalaa nà ɠɛlɛ naama nui ʋa Kɛ̀ɛ ɠaazu, nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu.»<verse eid="MAT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ziilɛigi laade, kɛlɛ boɠa zɔkpɔi ʋe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luke 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>«À mina ɠisiɛ ga nɔ̀un paaʋɛ ga gè ziilɛi fe eteai ʋɛ. Gè la ʋaani ziilɛi feezu, kɛlɛ boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠa pàai feezu. <verse eid="MAT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/>Pàaʋɛ gè kpɔɛi lɔ doun zunui ta kɛɛɠɛ yɔɠɔzu, anzanu loin ta dee yɔɠɔzu, loun anzai ta deemɔɔn yɔɠɔzu. <verse eid="MAT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/>Nui zili nuiti ta ɠɛ ga ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nuiti nɔ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:35-36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mis 7:6</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/>«Zɔi nɔpɛ é dee ɓaa kɛɛɠɛ nɛɛzu ʋɛ, é leʋe nɔ̀un ba, naama nui la vizɔni ga nà-kaladopo. Zɔi nɔpɛ é ná-doun zunu ɓaa ná-doun anzanui nɛɛzu ʋɛ, é leʋe bà, naama nui la vizɔni ga nà-kaladopo. <verse eid="MAT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/>Zɔi ɓalaa é la zaa wului zeɠeni, é ʋa ʋilɛ pòlu, naama nui la vizɔni ga nà-kaladopo. <verse eid="MAT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/>Zɔi é pɔ é zɛnvui ɠizo, naama nui ɠa ʋala ma. Kɛlɛ zɔi a ʋala zɛnvui ma nà-faa zu, naama nui ɠa sɔlɔɔ ʋolu.»<verse eid="MAT 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulanumaiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Maleke 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/>«Zɔi é yeezeizu wo wu, naama nui yeezeiɗa bù. Zɔi é yeezeizu bù, naama nui yeezeiɗa tèʋe nui wu. <verse eid="MAT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/>Zɔi é yeezeizu GALA goo wo nui ta wu, tɔɔzei naa ɠa ga GALA goo wo nui, naama nui ɠa GALA goo wo nui ná-kulanumai ɠɛɠalai zɔlɔɔ. Zɔi é yeezeizu telebo nui ta wu, tɔɔzei naa ɠa ga telebo nui, naama nui ɠa telebo nui ná-kulanumai ɠɛɠalai zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/>Zɔi nɔpɛ é ziɛ lɛi ɠɔɠɔ ɲɛ gila feezu doungoi niiti gila zea, tɔɔzei toɠa ga nà-kaladopoi, gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, naama nui la ʋalaga ná-kulanumai ma.»<verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓɛɛni ka ga Yesu ta Zan Ɓatisete?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luke 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>Yesu ɓegai ma ga naama leveiti fe keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) zea, é zeɠeni ná, é li, é ɗa kalagi wo, ta é ɗa GALA daawooi laazeeli taaiti su ná maaɠoolii zu. <verse eid="MAT 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>Zan yɛni kasoi ɠa, é Kilista ná-kɛɛwotiiti ma wooi mɛni. É ná-kaladopoi tanigaa leʋeni, ti gaazaɠa, ti ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>«Ɗa ɠa è ga naama nui, nii maanɛai ga é ʋa, ɓaa gi taɠili maaɓɔun?»<verse eid="MAT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À li, wo naa zuɠula Zan ma, nii wo mɛnisu, ta wo kaazu: <verse eid="MAT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/>Gaazuɠole nuiti gaazu ɠa zeɠezu ma, mɛɠɛlɛ nuiti ti ɗa ziɛ ga pagɔ, gee nuiti ti ɗa ɲade, goizuɓɔlɔ nuiti ti ɗa faa mɛni, gɔvɛiti ti ɗa wuzeɠe, woo niinɛ ʋagɔi laa ɠa zeelizu bala nuiti ma. <verse eid="MAT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naama nui, nii é la loa kakagi zu ga nɔ̀un maaʋele.»<verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>Tɛi Zan ná-keelaiti ti ɠɛni liizu, Yesu tɔɔzeini ga ɓɔɛa bɛbɛi ʋɔ, é ʋilɛ Zan ʋa, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Ɓɛgele ɠa wo liini kaazu teʋebai zu? Seeligi nii fiilɛi ɲiikpisu ɓaa? <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/>Leeni ɠa mu wo liini kaazu? Nui nii maaɠiliai ga seɠe ʋapagiti ɓaa? Niiti ti maaɠiliai ga seɠe ʋapagiti, naati ta masa pɛlɛiti bu. <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/>Ɓɛgele ɠa mu wo liini kaazu? GALA goo wo nu? Gaama ɠana, nɔ̀un nà bosu wo ma ga teʋegɛ GALA goo wo nu ʋa. <verse eid="MAT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/>Tɔ ɠa sɛʋɛai ná-faa zu GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:10">‹Nà nà-keelai leʋesu è luɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:10">é ɗa-ʋelei ɓɛtɛ è luɠɔ.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, nui kpein nii anzanu sɔlɔɔgai, tanɔpɛ ge la dɛ ɠulani, nii bɔɔlɔai é leʋe Zan Ɓatisete ʋa. Tama zɔi dɔiɗai geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai zu, naa wɔɔlɔʋɛ ba. <verse eid="MAT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/>É zo Zan Ɓatisete ná-yeeɠɛɠalaiti ma, é zeeli za ma, geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai ɠa zeeɠaaɓaai laawu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai ɠa zeeɠaaɓaai laawu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai ɠa leʋe pelei ɠaiziɛzu ga maaɓaai</char></note> zeeɠaaɓaa nuiti ka ti pɔ ti seɠe ga tɔnɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">zeeɠaaɓaa nuiti ka ti pɔ ti seɠe ga tɔnɔ</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">zeeɠaaɓaa nuiti ta valazu ba</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/>Tɔɔzei GALA goo wo nuiti pɛ ta tɔ sɛʋɛi, ti GALA gooi wogɛ eyɛsu é zeeli Zan ma. <verse eid="MAT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/>Ni wa pɔ ga wo la da, tɔ ɠa é ga Eli, nii ná-fai wogai ga toɠa ʋaazu. <verse eid="MAT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/>Zɔi faa mɛni goiyeɠe ba, naama nui nii mɛni.<verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>«Ɓɛ ɠa mu nà niizuʋɛ nuɓusɛiti pokɔɠɔ ma? Ti ɠulaʋɛ ga doungoiti ti zeini dɔɔɠɔ ɓalagi zu, ti ɗa wooɠula ti-wɔɔlaiti ma, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="MAT 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/>‹Gi koolei vɛa, wo la kuai woni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:17">gi saa zu wuyei loa, wo la ɓɔɠɔ maawɔinni.›<verse eid="MAT 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/>Tɔɔzei Zan ʋaani, é ɗa zugi zo, é la dɔɔ ɓɔlezu, ti ɠɛ ma: ‹Inɛgi ɠa su!› <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/>Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋaa, é ɗa daamii ta kpɔɔlei wo, ti ɠɛ ma mɔnɔ: ‹Zunui nii ɠa ga ɠulukpu nu ta dɔɔ ɓɔle nu wolai. Toɠa ga mulu zo nuiti ta kotoba nuiti ti-wɔɔlai.› Kɛlɛ ɠimalai ná-kɛɛwotiiti ta dɛɛzu ga telebogɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kidaaleʋelala laaiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luke 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Yesu zɛba é ɗa zeli ɓaaɓaagi lo taaiti ma, ʋɛti é ná-laavɔɔ vai bɔɔlɔzu ɠɛɛni náti, mazɔlɔɔ taai naati su nuɓusɛiti ti la ɠɛni ti-ziɛ ʋelei maavaliboni. <verse eid="MAT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/>«Maanɔɠɔi ɠa è ʋɛ, Kolazɛn, maanɔɠɔi ɠɛ è ʋɛ, Ɓɛtesayida! Mazɔlɔɔ laavɔɔ vai niiti ti ɠɛai wo ʋɔ bɛ, ni naa ɠɛɠalai ɠɛɛni Tiil ta Sidɔn laaiti su, eɠɛ kaite ti zu nuɓusɛiti ti ti-ziɛ ʋelei maavaliboga, ti saa wɔlɔ wo seɠeiti too ɠɔba, ti zuʋui ʋu tɔungiti su. <verse eid="MAT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nà bosu wo ma ga: Tukpɔɠaaleʋe voloi, wa-lukpɔi ɠa ɓaa, é leʋe Tiil ta Sidɔn laaiti tɔnɔi ʋa. <verse eid="MAT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/>Ɗɔun, Kapɛɛlɛnawume, ɗa kaazu ga è-lɔɠɔi ɠa wɔɔlɔzu, è zeeli geeɠɔlɔgi zu ɓaa? Naa li poun! Ta è yei gɔvɛalaazu. Mazɔlɔɔ laavɔɔ vai niiti ti ɠɛai è ʋɔ bɛ, ni naa ɠɛɠalai ɠɛɛni Sɔdɔme taai zu, eɠɛ é ná dɛ zaaɠaza. <verse eid="MAT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nà bosu wo ma ga: Tukpɔɠaaleʋe voloi, wa-lukpɔi ɠa ɓaa, é leʋe Sɔdɔme yooi nɔnɔi ʋa.»<verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">À ʋa pɔ̀, nà dooɠo fe wo ʋɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luke 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>Naama yeeɠɛɠalai zu, Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Ee, Kɛ̀ɛ, geeɠɔlɔgi ta zooi Maliɠii, nà è mamasu, tɔɔzei è niima vaiti dɔɔɠua ɠima nuiti ta keleɠele nuiti ba, è ti lɛ ga naati, niiti ti yeemalɔigai. <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/>Gaamazu, Kɛ̀ɛ, ʋele ɠana nɛai la è ʋɛ. <verse eid="MAT 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/>Kɛ̀ɛ fai pɛ puuʋɛ zèezu. Nu nɔpɛ ge la Doun Zunui ɠwɛɛ, é ɠula Ɠɛɛɠɛi ʋolu, tama nu nɔpɛ ge la ɓalaa Ɠɛɛɠɛi ɠwɛɛ, é ɠula Doun Zunui ʋolu, ta naama nui nii Doun Zunui a ɠɛna pɔ é dɛɛ la. <verse eid="MAT 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>À ʋa pɔ̀, wɔi pɛ wo ɓɔlɔai, kasɔi laani wo unma, nà dooɠo fe wo ʋɛ. <verse eid="MAT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/>À nà-unbawului zeɠe, wo da unma, wo lɔ pɔ̀ bɛ kala pelei zu, mazɔlɔɔ nà-fai ɠaanɛɛʋɛ, gè ɠɛ ga ɓɔɠɔmaayei nu zìimaʋɛ, wa dooɠogi zɔlɔɔ ɓɔɠɔ vaa ma. <verse eid="MAT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/>Nà-unbawului zeɠezu la ɓaani, kasɔi ɓalaa gè daazu wo unma, feɠagɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠa ga dooɠo foloi Maliɠii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maleke 2:23-28</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luke 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, Yesu ɠɛni leʋesu yeeta molo ɓalagiti su, dooɠo foloi. Tɛi pului ɠɛni ná-kaladopoiti ma, ti tɔɔzeini ga ti ɗa molo ɠɔpɔgiti gaaʋolososo, ti ɗa mi. <verse eid="MAT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Faliziɛinti ti miná ɠaai ma, ti ɠɛni Yesu ma: «Wɛlɛna ɗa-ɠaladopoiti ba! Ta naa ɠɛɛzu, nii tɔgi la vaani bu ga nu kɛ dooɠo foloi.»<verse eid="MAT 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wo la dɛ naa ɠalani mu ɓaa, nii Davide kɛɛni, siɛgi zu pului soni da ta siɛɲɔɠɔiti? <verse eid="MAT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/>É lɛɛni GALA ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai wu, é ɓuluiti seɠe, ti veai GALA bɛ, é ta mi. Tama, tɔgi la ɠɛni vaani bu ga ta siɛɲɔɠɔiti, ti ʋa ɓului naa ta mi, makɛga ɠɛni de zalaɠa ɠula nuiti nɔ ʋɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/>Wo la dɛ kalani ɓalaa tɔ sɛʋɛi zu ga dooɠo foloi, zalaɠa ɠula nuiti niiti ti botii ɠɛɛzu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, ta ɗa dooɠo foloi ma lɔgi ɠoloɠolo, naama ge la ɠɛa ti ʋa ga koto? <verse eid="MAT 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/>Tama nà bosu wo ma ga: Nii é ʋɛ, naa wɔɔlɔʋɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ʋa. <verse eid="MAT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/>Ee, ni wo ɠɛni niima wooi ʋoluɠwɛɛ, nii é ɠɛɛzu ma: ‹Wɔ̀inʋɛ ga gaazumaawɔinɠai, é leʋe zalaɠaiti ba,›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Woz 6:6</ref></char>.</char></note> wo la ɓena sɔbalala nui niiti peelala. <verse eid="MAT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa é ga dooɠo foloi Maliɠii.»<verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zeezaama zunui ɠɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maleke 3:1-6</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luke 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>Seɠeai ma miná, é lɛɛni Zuifuiti ta-ƓALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>Zunui ta ɠɛni ná, nii zeei zaani ma. Ti Yesu ɠaazaɠani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Tɔgi vaaʋɛ nɛi bu ga nu nui ta ɠɛdɛ dooɠo foloi?» Ti ɠɛni pɔ ga ti peelalazu zɔlɔɔ ba. <verse eid="MAT 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa é wo zaama, ni baala gila kana zea, naa zɛba é loo zeɠezaɠa wolai zu dooɠo foloi, é la mɛɛnga, é ʋa kula su? <verse eid="MAT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/>Nuɓusɛi ma fizɔgɛ baalagi ʋa pounpoun! Naa ɠa é ba, tɔgi vaaʋɛ bu ga nu faa ʋagɔi ɠɛ dooɠo foloi.» <verse eid="MAT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>É zɛba é ɠɛ zunui ma: «Yeemaale!» Naa yeei maaleni, é ɠɛdɛ, é ɠɛ ga zɔɔma yeei ɠɛʋele. <verse eid="MAT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>Faliziɛinti ti ɠulani, ti li, ti ɠi fe ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ ga ʋelei ta zoo ti Yesu ʋaa la.<verse eid="MAT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠa ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-botiɠɛ nui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>Yesu kwɛɛgai ma ga ta ɠɛɛzu ti paa, é zeɠeni ná. Bɛbɛ wolai ʋilɛni polu, tama é seeɓɛ nuiti pɛ kɛdɛni. <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>É ɠɛni ti laa maaɓakpasu ga naati ti mina kula kɛlɛma. <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>Ʋele ɠana GALA goo wo nui Ezayi wooi ʋilɛni la su, nii é boni ga:<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>«Wɛlɛ nà-botiɠɛ nui ʋa, gè yiimazeɠeai la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui, nii é gòla ɠoozunɛɛzu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Nà nà-Zɛnvui yei ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Toɠa telebodai ma wooi laazeeli zii ɠiligiti ma.<verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>É la kpɔɛba vaa nɔpɛ kɛa, é la woo ɠaaɓainga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">nu la goomɛniga kpɔɛzuɠula wola wosu koi yɔɠɔzuʋɛti.<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>É la seeli kpaku ɠalea ga, nii golowoloai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">é la sɔmɔgi ʋaa, nii gaayeizu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">Ʋele ɠana eyɛsu kɛɛzu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">eyɛsu é pilɛ sɔlɔɔ fai ve telebodai ya.<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>Zii ɠiligiti pɛ ta tɔun kɛ ga ta-ɠitogi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:18-21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 42:1-4">Eza 42:1-4</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ɓaa Setana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Maleke 3:20-30</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luke 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, ti ʋaani Yesu ʋɔ ga inɛ su nu ɠila nii gaazuɠoleni, é ga ɓoɓoi mɔnɔ. É naa ɠɛdɛni, naa tɔɔzeini ga é ɗa ɓɔɛ, é ɗa wozaɠa. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Bɛbɛi laavɔɔni, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Davide ná-Doun Zunui la ga nii mu ɓaa?»<verse eid="MAT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>Faliziɛinti ti naa mɛnigai ma, ti ɠɛni ma: «Inɛ kundiɠii Ɓeelezeɓule ná-zobogi nɔ ɠa zunui nii inɛgiti kpɛɛzu la.» <verse eid="MAT 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>Kɛlɛ tɛi Yesu ɠɛni ta-ɠisiɛi ɠwɛɛni, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Masadai nɔpɛ su nuɓusɛiti ti ɠaaɠwɛɛzu su ɓɔɠɔ laalɔɠɔma, naa ɠa ɗa ɠoloɠolo. Taa wola nɔpɛ, ɓaa pɛlɛyeɠe nɔpɛ gaaɠwɛɛzu su ɓɔɠɔ laalɔɠɔma, naa la zooga yɛsu ná. <verse eid="MAT 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/>Ni Setanai a Setana ɓɛɛna, ná-masadai ɠaaɠwɛa su mu ɓɔɠɔ laalɔɠɔma. Naama masadai ɠa zoo yɛsu ná ɠale? <verse eid="MAT 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/>Ni nɔ̀un, nà inɛgiti kpɛɛzu ga Ɓeelezeɓule ná-zobogi, wa-ɠaladopoiti ta ti ɓɛɛzu ga ɓɛ ná-zobo? Naa ɠa é ba, tiya ɓɔɠɔgo ɠa ti ʋaazu wa-lukpɔi ɠaaleʋezu. <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/>Kɛlɛ ni GALA Zɛnvui ná-zobogi ɠa gè inɛgiti kpɛɛzu la, deɠɛmu GALA ná-masadai ʋaa, é zeeli wo ma.<verse eid="MAT 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/>«Ɓaa ɓɛ ɠa a ɗa zoo é lɛ zɛbɛsu nui ná-pɛlɛi wu, é naa ɠɔligiti seɠe, ni é la tɔɔzeini dɛ ga é ʋa naa ɠili ga galui? Toɠa naa ɠili pɛ, é ʋa leɠa naa ná-pɛlɛi wuuvoo. <verse eid="MAT 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/>Zɔi nɔpɛ é la nɔ̀un ba, naa ɠa dàalɔɠɔma. Zɔi é la ɓɔsu bà, gi ʋa gaalɛbai wo, naa ɠa suvazagi wosu.<verse eid="MAT 12:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/>«Naa ɠa é ba, gè bo wo ma, nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠotoiti pɛ, ta woo ɲɔiti pɛ ta ti wo GALA daalɔɠɔma, naati suvaa ɠa yɛ ti ʋɛ, kɛlɛ zɔi nɔpɛ é woo ɲɔu wosu Zɛnvu Ɲadegai laalɔɠɔma, suvaa la yɛga naama nui ʋɛ pɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/>Zɔi nɔpɛ é kpɔɛ wosu Nu ná-Doun Zunui laalɔɠɔma, naama nui zuvaa ɠa yɛ, kɛlɛ zɔi nɔpɛ é kpɔɛ wosu Zɛnvu Ɲadegai laalɔɠɔma, naama nui zuvaa la yɛga pɛ, niima eteai zu, ta eteai niinɛi zu é ʋaazu.»<verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gului ta gaawaai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luke 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>«À kwɛɛ ga ni gului ʋagɛ, gaawaai ɓalaa pagɛ, ni ɲɔuʋɛ, gaawaai ɓalaa ɲɔuʋɛ, tɔɔzei gului ɠa ɠwɛɛsu ga gaawaai. <verse eid="MAT 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/>Pɛɛɠaali zuwuzuiti, wa zoo ɠale kpɔɛ ʋagɔ wosu, wɔi wo ɲɔuɗai? Mazɔlɔɔ nii é ʋooʋazu nui yiimaʋɛ, naa ɠa daaʋɛ, a ɗa bo. <verse eid="MAT 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/>Nu ʋagɔi ɠa ɗa ani ʋagɔiti kula ná-ani makɛsu ʋagɔi, nu ɲɔi ɓalaa ka ɗa ani ɲɔiti kula ná-ani makɛsu ɲɔi. <verse eid="MAT 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/>Gè bo wo ma, tukpɔɠaaleʋe voloi, nuiti ta ʋoluvaawo ga ta-ɓɔɛ ɲakaiti pɛ ta ɠɛ ti woni. <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/>Mazɔlɔɔ è ɓɔɛ wooi maaʋele ma, ta è ʋɛtɛ ga sɔbalala nu, è ɓɔɛ wooi nɔ ɠa ta è ʋeelala la.»<verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Laavɔɔ vaa maaɠaazaɠabo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Maleke 8:11-12</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luke 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>Tɔ kalamɔin tanigaa ta Faliziɛinti ti ɠɛni Yesu ma: «Kalamɔn, gá pɔ gi è ɠa, è ɗa laavɔɔ vai ta ɠula kɛlɛma.» <verse eid="MAT 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Niizuʋɛ nuɓusɛ ɲɔiti, niiti ti ga wooʋalada nuiti GALA bɛ, naati ka ti laavɔɔ vaa maaɠaazaɠabosu! Tama poo kili nɔpɛ ge la vea ti ya, kɛni GALA goo wo nui Zonase ná-poogi. <verse eid="MAT 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ʋelei Zonase kɛɛni la ga folo saʋagɔ kpidi saʋagɔ kalei ɠoozu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɛlɛ ʋɛ: <char style="xt"><ref loc="JON 2:1">Zon 2:1</ref></char>.</char></note> ʋele nɔ ɠana Nu ná-Doun Zunui a kɛɛ la ga folo saʋagɔ kpidi saʋagɔ zooi ɠoozu. <verse eid="MAT 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/>Tukpɔɠaaleʋe voloi, Ninive nuiti ta wuzeɠe, ti niizuʋɛ nuɓusɛiti peelala, tɔɔzei tiya mu Zonase ná-GALA goo wogai maaʋele ma, ti ti-ziɛ ʋeleiti maavaliboni. Tama zɔi é ʋɛ, naa wɔɔlɔʋɛ Zonase ʋa. <verse eid="MAT 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/>Tukpɔɠaaleʋe voloi, lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazu ʋelei ma masa anzanui ɠa wuzeɠe, é niizuʋɛ nuɓusɛiti peelala, tɔɔzei tɔun é zeɠeni kenein zou ɓela ga, é ʋa woilosu Salomɔn ná-ɠima ɓɔɛiti ma. Tama zɔi é ʋɛ, naa wɔɔlɔʋɛ Salomɔn ʋa.»<verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɛnvu ɲɔi ɠalema vai ʋolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luke 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>«Siɛgi zu kɔzɔba yɛnvui ɠulazu la zunui ta zu, toɠa ɗa li, é leʋeteʋe teʋebai zu, é ɗa zeizu ɠaiziɛ, kɛlɛ é la ná ta ɠaani. <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/>Naazu, toɠa ɠɛɛzu ɓɔɠɔ ma: ‹Nà ɠalesu ma nà-pɛlɛi wu, ʋɛ kùlaai ná.› Siɛgi zu é ɠalesu da ma, é ná ɠa, ani la ná, ná ɓalegai, fai pɛ seiɗai kpasu ná ga pagɔ, <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/>toɠa ɗa li naazu, é zɛnvu lɔfela ɠiligaa zeɠe, niiti ti ɲɔuɗai ti leʋe ba, ti ʋa ʋɔɔma, ti zei ná. Zunui naa ná-fai ɠaaɓelagi ɠa ɲɔu, é leʋe ma mɔungi ʋa. Naama zii ɠa é ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu ga niizuʋɛ nuɓusɛ ɲɔi niiti.»<verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ná-pɛlɛyeɠe ɠitei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maleke 3:31-35</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luke 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>Siɛgi zu Yesu ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu la dɛ bɛbɛi ʋɔ, dee ta deɠeiti ti ʋaani, ti lo eteaʋɛ, ti ɠɛni pɔ ga ti ɓɔɛ pɔ. <verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>[Nui ta ʋaani, é ɠɛ ma: «È-lee ta è-leɠeiti ta loni eteaʋɛ, ta pɔ ga ti ɓɔɛ è ʋɔ.»]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa é ga dèe? Ɓɛɛni ka ti ga dèɠeiti?» <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>É zɛba é yeelete ná-kaladopoiti ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Wɛlɛ, niiti ka ti ga dèe ta dèɠeiti. <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/>Tɔɔzei zɔi nɔpɛ é Kɛ̀ɛ yiimai ɠɛɛzu, nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu, naama nui ɠa é ga dèɠe zunui, ta dèɠe anzanui, ta dèe.»<verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> molo zuwu vaza nui ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maleke 4:1-9</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luke 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Naama voloi nɔ, Yesu ɠulani pɛlɛi wu, é li, é zei ziɛ wolai laaʋɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/>Bɛbɛ wolai ɠaalɛɛni ba koba. Kɛni é lɛɛni keingi ta zu vɔlɔ, é zei ná. Bɛbɛi pɛ ge ɠɛni loni ziɛlaʋɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ɠalasu ga faa mɔinmɔin, faalaaliiti su. É ɠɛni ti ma: «Molo zuwu vaza nui ta ɠulani ga é molo zuwui vaza. <verse eid="MAT 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/>Kɛai ma moloi vazasu, molo ɠaei tanigaa ti looni pele ɠɛzɛi zu, wɔniiti ti ʋa, ti mi. <verse eid="MAT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/>Taɠiligaa ti looni fasa lutui zu, pɔlɔi tago nɔ ɠa é ɠɛni ná. Ti ʋɔnɔni fala, tɔɔzei zooi ɓoma la ɠɛni ɠoozani. <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/>Kɛlɛ foloi kpaai ma kpekpe, é molo ʋɔnɔ koiti galani ma fala. Ti vɔɔni, tɔɔzei sape la ɠɛni ti ʋa sɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/>Taɠiligaa ti looni ɠaingiti saama. Naati ti lɛɛni, ti molo ʋɔnɔ koiti maaɓɔle. <verse eid="MAT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/>Taɠiligaa ti looni mɔnɔ zou ʋagɔi zu. Ti ɓɛtɛni, ti waa, tanigaa ti-ɠaawaai ɠɛ ga ungilagila (100), tanigaa puulɔzitalɔzita (60), tanigaa puuzaʋasaʋa (30). <verse eid="MAT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/>Zɔi faa mɛni goiyeɠe ba, naama nui nii mɛni.»<verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ná-faalaaliiti bo ungi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maleke 4:10-12</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luke 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Ná-kaladopoiti ti maaɓuɠani ba, ti ɠɛ ma: «Lee vaa zu è ɓɔɛzu ti ʋɔ faalaaliiti su?» <verse eid="MAT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wɔun, feeʋɛ wo ʋɛ ga wo geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai ma lɔɔɠuzu vaiti kwɛɛ. Tiya ma, naama zobogi la veeni ti ʋɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zɔi ani zea, ta ɠa ve naa ya ʋolu, eyɛsu é ʋooʋa zea. Kɛlɛ zɔi ani la zea, anɛɛ zɔɔgoi é zea, naa ɠa ɠula zea. <verse eid="MAT 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/>Nà ɓɔɛzu ti ʋɔ faalaaliiti su, mazɔlɔɔ ti ɠɛ ʋa wɛlɛzu, ti la wozaɠaa, ti ɗa woilo, ti la faa mɛniga ta ti mina gaaɠa. <verse eid="MAT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/>Wooi GALA goo wo nui Ezayi boni, naa ɠa ʋilɛsu ti ʋɛ ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">‹Wa la woilo nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">kɛlɛ wo la faa ɠaaɠaa pɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">Wa la wɛlɛ nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">kɛlɛ wo la wozaɠaa pɛ.<verse eid="MAT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/>Tɔɔzei niima nuɓusɛiti ti ɠɛa ga kigaaza nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ti ɓɔɠɔ woizuɓɔlɔa, ti yeeʋɛɛ ɠaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">naa ɠa a kɛ ti ɠaazu mina wozaɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ti-woiyeɠeiti ti mina faa mɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ti-yii mina faa ɠaaɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ti ʋa ɠale ma pɔ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">nii a kɛ gè ʋa ti ɠɛdɛ.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:14-15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Eza 6:9-10</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>Kɛlɛ wɔun wo undaanɛɛʋɛ, wo-ɠaazuʋɛti ta wozaɠaazu, wo-woiiti ti ɗa faa mɛni. <verse eid="MAT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, GALA goo wo nu mɔinmɔin ta telebo nu mɔinmɔingaa ti ɠɛni pɔ ga ti naa ɠa, nii wo kaazu, kɛlɛ ti la kaani, ti naa mɛni, nii wo mɛnisu, kɛlɛ ti la mɛnini.<verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii pilɛgai molo zuwu vaza nui ʋa <optbreak/> naa zuɠulazuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maleke 4:13-20</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luke 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>«Faalaalii pilɛgai molo zuwu vaza nui ʋa, wɛlɛ poluʋɛ ʋa. <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/>Siɛgi zu nui GALA ná-masadai ma wooi mɛnisu da, é la gaaɠaani, Inɛgi ɠa ɗa ʋa, é naa ɠula ziimaʋɛ, nii fazagai ná. Naama nui ɠa é molo zuwui zɔlɔɔgai pele ɠɛzɛi zu. <verse eid="MAT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/>Zɔi é molo zuwui zɔlɔɔgai fasa lutui zu, naa ɠa é wooi mɛnisu nɔ feya, é yeezei bu ga koozunɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/>Kɛlɛ é la naa yɛsu ná, é ʋa zapelɔ ziimaʋɛ, é la ɗa ga so kpaan. Siɛgi zu kpɔlɔi ɓaa wɔinzeɠemai ʋaazu la wooi maaʋele ma, gaamanɔ toɠa ɠalesu ma. <verse eid="MAT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/>Zɔi é molo zuwui zɔlɔɔgai ɠaingiti saama, naa ɠa é wooi mɛnisu, kɛlɛ naa maa ɠa ɓɔɔlezu ga eteai ma yiizoolɛi, ta naavolo wɔin, é la ɗa ga waa. <verse eid="MAT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/>Zɔi é molo zuwui zɔlɔɔgai zou ʋagɔi zu, naa ɠa é wooi mɛnisu, é gaaɠa. Tama toɠa waazu, ma ɠae ɠilagilagi tanigaa ti-ɠaawaai ɠɛ ga ungilagila (100), tanigaa puulɔzitalɔzita (60), tanigaa puuzaʋasaʋa (30).»<verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gui ɲɔi ma vaalaalii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>Yesu faalaalii taɠili boni ti ma, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai ɠulaʋɛ ga zunui nii é molo zuwu ʋagɔi vazani ná-kpalagi zu. <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/>Kɛlɛ yeeta kpidii, siɛgi zu ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɠɛni ɲiizu la, sili nui liini, é gui ɠae ɲɔi vaza ná-moloi zaama, é zeɠe ná. <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/>Siɛgi zu moloi ʋɔnɔni da, é ɠula su, gui ɲɔi ɓalaa ɠulani kɛlɛma. <verse eid="MAT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/>Pɛlɛ kɛɛɠɛi naa ná-botiɠɛ nuiti ti ʋaani, ti ɠɛ ma: ‹Màliɠii, è la molo zuwu ʋagɔ vazani ɗa-ɓalagi zu mu ɓaa? Mini ɠa mu gui ɲɔi nuu zeɠeai ná?› <verse eid="MAT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/>É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Sìli nui ta ɠa é naama vai ɠɛai.› Ná-botiɠɛ nuiti ti ɠɛni ma: ‹Ɗa pɔ ga gi li, gi gui ɲɔi ɠula mu ɓaa?› <verse eid="MAT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: ‹Ɓa-o, wo mina ʋa yɛsu gui ɲɔi ɠulazu, wo ʋa moloi ɓalaa lɔɔɠula. <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/>À ti felegɔ pɛ zɛ ná, ti ɗa ɓɛtɛ eyɛsu molo leʋei zeeli, naama ziɛgi zu nà ɠɛ molo leʋe nuiti ma: À gui ɲɔi mɔunpa kula, wo gili ba, é ɠala ga abui, kɛlɛ à moloi ɠaalɛ ba nà-molo ɠotai zu.› »<verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> mutaalede kaei ta lɛʋɛi ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maleke 4:30-32</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 13:18-21">Luke 13:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>Yesu faalaalii taɠili boni ti ma, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai ɠulaʋɛ ga mutaalede kae ɠilagi, nii zunui ta seɠeni, é sin ná-kpalagi zu. <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/>Ma ɠaei ɠa gola lɔiɗai ani zuwuiti pɛ su. Kɛlɛ siɛgi zu é ʋɔnɔni la, é ɓaɠoni, gaaɠooza kpelei zu ziinziin ganigiti pɛ ba, é ɠɛ ga gulu, wɔniiti ti ɗa ʋa, ti ɗa laɠagi lo ma ɓekegiti su.»<verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>É faalaalii taɠili boni ti ma, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai ɠulaʋɛ ga lɛʋɛi, nii anzanui ta seɠeni, é ti ɠaayɔ ta ɓulu vukɔ mɔinmɔingi. Gaaɓelagi, ɓulu vukɔ ɠaayɔgai naa pɛ ge ɓokoloni.»<verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lee vaa zu Yesu ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu faalaaliiti su</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Maleke 4:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>Yesu ɠɛni niima vaiti pɛ bosu bɛbɛi ma faalaaliiti su, é la ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu ti ʋɔ, ni faalaali la ba. <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/>É ɠɛni naa ɠɛɛzu, nii a kɛ GALA goo wo nui laawooi ʋilɛsu, nii é boni ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">«Nà ɓɔɛzu faalaaliiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">gè faiti dɛɛ, niiti ti ɠɛa lɔɔɠuni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">kaite eteai ɓɛtɛ yee ma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Guy 78:2</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii zuɠulazuʋɛ <optbreak/> pilɛgai gui ɲɔi ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>É bɛbɛi yɛni ná, é ɠale ma pɛlɛi wu. Ná-kaladopoiti ti maaɓuɠani ba, ti ɠɛ ma: «Faalaalii nii è bogai, é ʋilɛ gui ɲɔi ʋa kpalagi zu, poluʋɛ lɛ ga giye.» <verse eid="MAT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Zɔi é molo zuwu ʋagɔi vazasu, naa ɠa é ga Nu ná-Doun Zunui. <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/>Kpalagi ɠa é ga eteai, molo zuwu ʋagɔi ɠa é ga niiti kpein ti ga masadai zu nuiti, gui ɲɔi ɠa é ga zɔiti kpein ti ga Inɛgi ná-nuɓusɛiti. <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/>Sili nui nii é gui ɠae ɲɔi vazagai, naa ɠa é ga Inɛgi. Molo leʋei ɠa é ga etea ɠaaɓela voloi. Molo leʋe nuiti ta ga geezuɠeelaiti. <verse eid="MAT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/>Tama ʋelei ta ɗa gui ɲɔi lɔɔɠula la, é ʋili abui zu, ʋele nɔ ɠana é ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu la etea ɠaaɓela voloi. <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/>Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa ná-geezuɠeelaiti teʋe, ti kaka faiti ta faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti kula ná-masadai zu. <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/>Ta ti ʋili abuzulugi zu, ʋɛ gɔlɔi ta ɲiiga ziɛgai ná. <verse eid="MAT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, telebo nuiti ta volo ga foloi ɠɛʋele, ti-Ɠɛɛ ná-masadai zu. Zɔi faa mɛni goiyeɠe ba, naama nui nii mɛni!»<verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ naavoloi nii dɔɔɠuai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>«Geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai ɠulaʋɛ ga naavoloi, nii dɔɔɠua ɠɛni de kpalagi ta zu. Zunui nii é kaani, naa dɔɔɠuni ʋolu. Koozunɛ ʋele ma, é liini, é kɔligiti pɛ pɔdi, é naama ɓalagi ɠeya.»<verse eid="MAT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaaɓaagi ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>«Geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai ɠulaʋɛ mɔnɔ ga yaaɠoi, nii é kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaaɓa pagɔiti gaiziɛzu. <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/>Tɛi é gila kaani, nii sɔngɔi wola ɓaɠoai, é liini, é kɔligiti pɛ pɔdi, é naa ɠeya.»<verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ tumɔi ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>«Geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai ɠulaʋɛ mɔnɔ ga tumɔi, nii kale ɓɛɛ nuiti ti pilini kpoloɗɛi wu, é kalei ma zii pɛ gaalɛ ba. <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/>Siɛgi zu daavesu da, ta ɗa mɛɛn kakei ma, naa ʋoluma ta ɗa zei, ti suwɛɛn ga kale ʋagɔiti, zɔiti ti la ʋani, ti naati pili ya. <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/>Ʋele ɠana é ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu la etea ɠaaɓela voloi. Geezuɠeelaiti ta ʋa, ti nu ɲɔiti zeeɠaaɠwɛ ta telebo nuiti. <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/>Ta nu ɲɔiti pili abuzulugi zu, ʋɛ gɔlɔi ta ɲiiga ziɛgai ná.»<verse eid="MAT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woo unseizuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Wo niima vaalaaliiti pɛ gaaɠaaʋɛ nɛi?» Ti ɠɛni ma: «Eyei, gi gaaɠaaʋɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>Yesu woo unseini, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Naa ɠa é ba, tɔ kalamɔin nɔpɛgi é kalagi zɔlɔɔgai, é ʋilɛ geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai zu vaiti ba, kulaʋɛ eɠɛ pɛlɛ kɛɛɠɛi, nii é ani niinɛiti ta ani wɔlɔmaiti kulazu, niiti ti ná-naavolo makɛsuʋɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nazalɛte nuiti ti ɠɛlɛ vai Yesu ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maleke 6:1-6</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luke 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>Yesu ɓegai ma ga naama vaalaaliiti bo, é zeɠeni ná. <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>É ɠaleni ma taai naa zu, ʋɛ é kulasui woni ná. É ɠɛni ná-taazu nuiti kalasu, naati ta-ƓALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu. Ná-kalabo pelei ti wola laavɔɔni, ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠa ga: «Mini ɠa é niima ɠimalai zɔlɔɔgai ná, ta zobogi nii é laavɔɔ vai niiti kɛɛzu la? <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>Gulu zaɠa nui ná-doun zunui laade ɓaa? Mali ná-doun zunui la ga nii, Zake ta Zozɛfe, Simon ta Zudeni ti-liɛi? <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>Baazeelaiti tɛi ti ʋa ɠɛ ade zaama? Mini ɠa é niima vaiti pɛ sɔlɔɔgai ná?» <verse eid="MAT 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/>Naa ɠa é ɠɛɛni ga zaɓui ti la ɠɛni laani da. Yesu zɛba é ɠɛ ti ma: «GALA goo wo nui ɓɔɠɔ yooi, ta ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nɔ ɠa, é la ɗa ga unfema zɔlɔɔ ná.» <verse eid="MAT 13:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>É la ɠɛni laavɔɔ vaa mɔinmɔin kɛɛni ná, tɔɔzei ta-ɠidaaleʋelalai ʋa.<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s">Zan Ɓatisete zaa vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maleke 6:14-29</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luke 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, Galilé masagi Elɔde Yesu maawooi mɛnini. <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>É ɠɛni ná-botiɠɛ nuiti ma: «Zan Ɓatisete ɠa buzeɠeai, é ɠula saai ya. Naa ɠa é kɛɛzu, é laavɔɔ vaiti kɛɛzu la.»<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>Tɔɔzei kaite Elɔde devei veeni ga ti Zan zo, ti gili, ti pili kasoi ɠa, kɛɛɠɛloin Filipe anzai Elɔdiade ná-fai zu. <verse eid="MAT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Zan ɓena ɠɛ ma: «Tɔgi la vaani bu ga è ʋa nii zeɠe ga è-anza.» <verse eid="MAT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>Elɔde ɠɛni keleɠele gaiziɛzu ga é Zan ʋaa. Kɛlɛ é ɠɛni luazu bɛbɛi ʋa, tɔɔzei bɛbɛi Zan zeɠeni ga toɠa ga GALA goo wo nu.<verse eid="MAT 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Kɛlɛ yeei ti ɠɛni Elɔde zɔlɔɔ foloi ma ɠona pilɛdai ma vɛtii ɠulazu la, Elɔdiade ná-doun anzanui kuai woni naati gaazu, niiti ti lolini fɛtii ɠulazuʋɛ. É Elɔde wola ɠoozunɛɛni. <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>É zɛba é minazeɠe anzalopoi ʋɛ, é ɠona vɔlɔ, é ɠɛ toɠa naa ve anzalopoi ya, nii nɔpɛ naa a falina ma.<verse eid="MAT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>Anzalopoi dee ná-diimai maaʋele ma, é ɠɛni Elɔde ma: «Nà pɔ Zan Ɓatisete nɔungi zeeli mà ʋɛ, aniɲakai zu.» <verse eid="MAT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>Naa masagi yiiɓɔlɔni. Kɛlɛ ná-konai maaʋele ma é boni, ta nui niiti é ti lolini fɛti ɠula vai ma, é devei veeni ga nii é faliai, ti fe zea. <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>É nui ta leʋeni ga ti Zan nɔungi leʋe ba kasoi ɠa. <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>Zan nɔungi yɛni aniɲakai zu, ti ʋaa la, ti fe anzalopoi ya, é lii la, é fe dee ya. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>Zan ná-kaladopoiti ti ʋaani, ti ma ʋoomai zeɠe, ti maaɠulu. Naa ʋolu, ti liini, ti naama vai wo Yesu ma.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zunu waadɔɔlugɔi (5.000) ɠɔnɔkula vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maleke 6:30-44</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luke 9:10-17</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Zan 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>Yesu naama wooi mɛnigai ma, é lɛɛni keingi zu. É zeɠeni ná, é li teʋebai ta zu. Kɛlɛ bɛbɛi mɛnigai ma, ti ɠulani taaiti su, ti ʋilɛ polu ɠɔɠɔa. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Yesu ɠulaai ma keingi zu, é bɛbɛ wolai ɠaani. Naati maawɔin soni, é seeɓɛ nuiti kɛdɛ.<verse eid="MAT 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Kpɔkɔi zeeliai ma, kaladopoiti ti maaɓuɠani ba, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ʋɛ ɠa ga teʋebai zu, foloi lia. Bɛbɛi ɠaaɠale ma, ti li ʋɛ ɠoba laa goiti su, ti ɠɔnɔ geya ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Ti ɓɛdɛ la ba ga ti li, wa ɓɔɠɔi à ɠɔnɔ fe ti ya.» <verse eid="MAT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>Kɛlɛ ti ɠɛni ma: «Ɓulu lɔɔlugɔ ta kale felegɔ nɔ ɠa é gi ya ʋɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>Yesu ɠɛ ti ma: «À ʋa ga tiye pɔ̀.»<verse eid="MAT 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>É devei veeni ga ti bɛbɛi zei tufai zu. É ɓulu lɔɔlugɔi ta kale felegɔiti seɠeni, é ɠaazulɛ geezu, é mama fee ƓALA falii wo. Naa ʋolu é ɓuluiti kpulukpuluni, é ma ɓuɠaiti fe kaladopoiti zea, naati ti gaaɠwɛ bɛbɛi ʋa. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Ɛsɛ pɛ ge daamii woni, ti yiɠo. Kaladopoiti ti ɓulu ɓulukpulugi mɔtai ɠaalɛɛni ba, é ɠɛ ga kpɔlɔ puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="MAT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Zɔiti ti daamii woni, naati ti ɠɛni ga zunu waadɔɔlugɔ (5.000) ɠɛɠala, anzanuiti ta doungoiti ti ɠaa la vɔlɔ luni.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ziɛ vai ziɛi ɠa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maleke 6:45-52</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 6:16-21">Zan 6:16-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Naama vai ɓeni nɔ feya, Yesu ɓɔini kaladopoiti da ga ti lɛ keingi zu, ti to da tuɠɔ, ti li ga ziɛ ʋoluʋelei, naama ziɛ su, é ɗa bɛbɛi ɠaaɠale ma. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>É bɛbɛi ɠaaɠalegai ma ma, é lɛɛni gizei ma tɔ ɠila ga é GALA fali. Kpidii ʋɛai ma, tɔ ɠila nɔ ɠa niina é ɠɛni ná. <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>Naama ziɛgi zu keingi maaɠoozani niina kakei ʋa ga gola, ziɛ lakpatakpagiti ti ɠɛni kpɔlɔzu ga gola, tɔɔzei fiilɛi ɠɛni daaɠomisu.<verse eid="MAT 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>Gosu yeeɠɛɠalai, Yesu ʋaani ga kaladopoiti pɔ pelei, é ɗa ziɛ ziɛi ɠa. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>Ti kaai ma, é ɗa ziɛ ziɛi ɠa, ti luani ga gola, ti ɗa ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma: «Gɔvɛ mɔtai ta ʋe-o!» Ti ɠɛni dua ɓeei loozu. <verse eid="MAT 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Kɛlɛ gaamago Yesu ɓɔɛni ti ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À zɛbɛzeɠe, nà ʋe de. À mina lua!»<verse eid="MAT 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>Piyɛlɛ zɛba é ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, ni ɗa ʋe, devei ve zèa, gè ʋa è ʋɔ bɛ ziɛi ɠa.» <verse eid="MAT 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>Yesu ɠɛ ma: «Ʋa!» Gaamago Piyɛlɛ ɠulani keingi zu, é ʋilɛ ziɛi ɠa, é ɗa li Yesu ʋɔ pelei. <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>Kɛlɛ é kaai ma ga fiilɛi zɛbɛi wɔɔlɔʋɛ, é luani. Tɛi é tɔɔzeini ga yeiɗa ziɛi wu, é ɓainni, é ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii! Kìzo!»<verse eid="MAT 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>Yesu yeemaaleni gaama, é so zeei ʋa, é ɠɛ ma: «Ee, ɗa-ɠidaaleʋei lɔiʋɛ! Lee vaa zu è inɛinɛgai?» <verse eid="MAT 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>Naa ʋoluma ti felegɔ ti lɛɛni ʋɔɔma keingi zu, fiilɛi zuleʋe kpe. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Niiti ti ɠɛni keingi zu, naati ti ʋilɛni ɲiibiɠa, ti nɔkɔ bu, ti ɠɛ ma: «Gaamazu, ɗa ga GALA Doun Zunui.»<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu seeɓɛ nuiti balo vai Zenezalɛte ɠoʋii ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Maleke 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>Ti ziɛi ɓudɛai ma, ti zeelini Zenezalɛte yooi ma. <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>Ná ʋele nuiti ti ɠwɛɛsu ɠaani Yesu ʋa, ti wooleʋeni naama yooi zu ná pɛ. Ti ʋaani pɔ ga seeɓɛ nuiti pɛ. <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>Ti maanɛɛnɛni ga ti vɔɔɠu nɔ ná-seɠei laamaʋɛ ʋa. Tama zɔiti pɛ ti ɠɛni vɔɔɠuzu ba, ti ɠɛni ʋalozu.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ta kalagi <optbreak/> nii Zuifuiti ti-mɛmɛwolaiti ti zɛgai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Maleke 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, Faliziɛin tanigaa ti zeɠeni Zeluzalɛme ta tɔ kalamɔin tanigaa, ti maaɓuɠa Yesu ʋa, ti gaazaɠa, ti ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>«Lee vaa zu ɗa-ɠaladopoiti ti la ɠolozu kɛwolaiti kɛɛ vaa wɔlɔmaiti bɛ? Tɔɔzei ta ɠɛna daami woga, ti la ɗa ga yeagba, eɠɛʋelei maanɛai é ɠɛ la.» <verse eid="MAT 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wɔun, lee vaa zu wo kololalai ɠɛɛzu ga GALA ná-devei, nii a kɛ wo ɗa ʋilɛ wa-vaa wɔlɔmaiti nɔ ʋolu? <verse eid="MAT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge ɠɛni ma: ‹È-ɠɛɛ lɛbi ta è-lee,›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Ɛgz 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">TSV 5:16</ref></char>.</char></note> é ɠɛ mɔnɔ: ‹Zɔi nɔpɛ é kɛɛɠɛ ɓaa dee ɠotozu, ta naama nui ʋaa.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 21:17">Ɛgz 21:17</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/>Kɛlɛ wɔun, wa ɠɛɛzu ma: ‹Ni nui ta a ɠɛɛna kɛɛɠɛ ɓaa dee ma: Nii nà la kɛ ga ɗa-ɓɔbai, naa ɠɛa ga vebɛani GALA bɛ,› <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/>kuye la mɔ naama nui ma ga é kɛɛɠɛ ɓaa dee lɛbi. Ʋele ɠana wo GALA daawooi zeɠezu la ma, wo ɗa ʋilɛ wa-vaa wɔlɔmaiti nɔ ʋolu. <verse eid="MAT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/>Wɔi wo ga woovele nuiti! Wa ɠa GALA goo wo nui Ezayi ɠɛni vaazu wo ma, siɛgi zu é ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu la ma:<verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>‹Niima nuɓusɛiti ta dɛ̀bizu ga ti-lakɔlɔgiti nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">kɛlɛ ti-yiimaʋɛ wola maaɠoozaʋɛ bà.<verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>Wafuun lɛbiya nɔ ɠa ti feezu bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">tɔɔzei kalagi niiti ti bosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">naa pɛ ka nɔ ga nuiti ta-leveiti.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:8-9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Eza 29:13</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Anii niiti ti nu ɠɔzɔzu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Maleke 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>Naa ʋoluma Yesu bɛbɛi lolini, é ɠɛ ma: «À woilo gòoi ma, wo gaaɠa ga pagɔ. <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/>Nii é lɔɔzu nui laaʋɛ, naa lɛi a ɗa kɔzɔ, kɛlɛ nii mu é ɠulazu, naa ɠa a ɗa kɔzɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Kaladopoiti ti maaɓuɠani ba, ti ɠɛ ma: «È kwɛni nɛi ga è ɓaaɠogɛ Faliziɛinti ma ga è ɓɔɛ wooi?» <verse eid="MAT 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Gulu nɔpɛ, nii Kɛ̀ɛ é geeɠɔlɔgi zu, é la siinni, naama wului lɔɔ ɠa ɠula. <verse eid="MAT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/>À ti yɛ ná. Gaazuɠole nuiti be, ti losu gaazuɠole nu ɠiligiti tuɠɔ! Tama ni gaazuɠole nui a lona bɔɔla gaazuɠole nui luɠɔ, ti felegɔ pɛ ta loo zeɠei zu.»<verse eid="MAT 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>Piyɛlɛ ɠɛ ma: «Faalaalii nii é bogai feya, poluʋɛ lɛ ga giye.» <verse eid="MAT 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Koo, wɔun, wa ɓalaa wo la faa ɠaaɠaazu ɓaa? <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/>Wo la gaaɠaazu ga nii kpein é lɔɔzu nui laaʋɛ, naa ɠa liizu kogi zu, naa ʋoluma é ʋili ya dɔɔɠuzuʋɛ? <verse eid="MAT 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/>Kɛlɛ nii é ɠulazu nui laaʋɛ, naa ɠa zeɠezu ziimaʋɛ, naa ma ka a ɗa nui ɠɔzɔ. <verse eid="MAT 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/>Tɔɔzei nui yiimaʋɛ ɠa kisiɛ ɲɔiti ta ɗa zeɠe ná, ti nui liizu nu ʋaa vai ta wɛɛnziɛgi ma, naa ʋɛɛ koloɠologi ta unmai ʋa, ta zɛɛ zeele wooiti, naa ʋɛɛ tɔɠɔ ɠoloɠolo faiti ba. <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/>Naama vaiti ka ta ɗa nui ɠɔzɔ. Kɛlɛ nu laamii ʋa, é la yeagbani, naa la zooga nui ɠɔzɔzu.»<verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kidaaleʋei é ɠɛni anzanui ya, é la ga Zuifui ta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Maleke 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>Yesu zeɠeni miná, é li Tiil ta Sidɔn yooi zu. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Kanaan anzanui ta ɠɛni miná seii zu, é ʋaani, é tɔɔzei ga ɓainga, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, Davide ná-Doun Zunui, gàazumaawɔinɠa! Inɛgi ɠa dòun anzanui zu, é ɗa kpɔlɔ ga gola.» <verse eid="MAT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu la ɠɛni gooɠaaʋote gila kpalaa feeni zea. Ná-kaladopoiti ti maaɓuɠani ba, ti ɠɛ ma: «Kpɛ, é li, tɔɔzei é la zeɠezu ade ʋolu ga kpeei.» <verse eid="MAT 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>Yesu ɠɛ ma: «Tèʋegɛ Izilayɛle ʋɛlɛyeɠei ma ʋaalagiti nɔ ma, niiti ti loai ya.»<verse eid="MAT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>Kɛlɛ anzanui ʋaani, é nɔkɔ bu, é ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, ɓɔ bà kae!» <verse eid="MAT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>É naa wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Maa la nɛɛni ga nu doungoiti kɔnɔgi ɠula ti ya, é pili gilɛ goiti bu.» <verse eid="MAT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>Anzanui ɠɛni ma: «Gaama ʋe, Màliɠii, kɛlɛ gilɛ goiti ta ɗa daamiani kpulukpulu koiti mi, niiti ti ɠulazu ti-maliɠiiti zeewu, ti loo zooi ma.» <verse eid="MAT 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Yesu zɛba é gooɠaaʋote, é ɠɛ ma: «Ee, anzanu, ɗa-ɠidaaleʋe ɓaɠoʋɛ ɗɛ! É ɠɛ è ʋɛ eɠɛʋelei è pɔ la.» Tama naama yeeɠɛɠalai nɔ, ná-doun anzanui ɠɛdɛni.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu seeɓɛ nu mɔinmɔin kɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>Yesu zeɠeni naama yooi zu, é leʋe Galilé ɗɛ wolai laaʋɛ. É lɛɛni gizei ta ma, é zei ná. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Bɛbɛ mɔinmɔin golai ʋaani pɔ. Ti ʋaani ga dɛkpu nuiti, gaazuɠole nuiti, ɓoɓoiti, maalɛɠɛfɛ nuiti, ta seeɓɛ nu mɔinmɔin kiligaa. Ti ʋaani ga tiye Yesu ɠɔɠɔwu. É ti pɛ kɛdɛni. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Bɛbɛi wola laavɔɔni ga ti ɗa ɓoɓoiti ka, ti ɗa ɓɔɛ, maalɛɠɛfɛ nuiti ti ɗa ɠɛdɛ, dɛkpu nuiti ti ɗa ziɛ, gaazuɠole nuiti ti ɗa wozaɠa. Ti pɛ ti tɔɔzeini ga ti ɗa lɛbiyai ve Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nu waanaanigɔi (4.000) ɠɔnɔkula vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maleke 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Yesu ná-kaladopoiti tolini, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Bɛbɛi nii maawɔin sòga, mazɔlɔɔ folo saʋagɔ ɠa ti kòba, daamiani nɔpɛ ge la ti ya. Gè la pɔ ga pului yɛ ti ma, gè ʋa ti ɠaaɠale ma, zɛbɛi mina ʋa ɠulazu ti ya pelei zu.» <verse eid="MAT 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>Kaladopoiti ti ɠɛni ma: «Mini ɠa gá ɓulu zɔlɔɔ ná, teʋebai nii zu, é ʋa kula ɠɛ bɛbɛi nii ʋa?» <verse eid="MAT 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Ɓulu lielegɔ ɠa é wo ya?» Ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɓulu lɔfela, naa ʋɛɛ kale goi tago ʋa.» <verse eid="MAT 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>É zɛba é bɛbɛi leve ga ti zei zooi ma. <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ɓulu lɔfelai ta kaleiti seɠeni. Kpegai ma ga mamagi ve GALA bɛ, é ti ɠaleɠaleni, é ti ve kaladopoiti zea. Naati ti gaaɠwɛɛni bɛbɛi ʋa. <verse eid="MAT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>Ti pɛ ti daamii woni, ti yiɠo. Kaladopoiti ti ma ɓulukpulugi mɔtai ɠaalɛɛni ba, é ɠɛ ga kpɔlɔ dɔfela. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Zɔiti ti daamii naa woni, ti ɠɛni ga zunu waanaanigɔ (4.000), anzanuiti ta doungoiti ti ɠaa la vɔlɔ luni. <verse eid="MAT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Yesu bɛbɛi ɠaaɠalegai ma ma, é lɛɛni keingi zu, é li Magadan yooi zu.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s">Laavɔɔ vaa maaɠaazaɠabo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Maleke 8:11-13</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luke 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>Faliziɛin tanigaa ta Saduseyɛinti ti ʋaani Yesu ʋɔ, nii a kɛ ti suɠɔɠɔ. Ti gaazaɠani ga é laavɔɔ vai ta ɠula kɛlɛma, é ɠulazu geeɠɔlɔgi zu. <verse eid="MAT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: [«Folo ɠae a kpɔina, wa ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Lina woza ɠa ʋasu, tɔɔzei geei ɠaaɓɔiʋɛ.› <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/>Ɓaa wozai ɠa seɠena ma, wo ɠɛ ma: ‹Za tonai ɠa ʋuuzu, tɔɔzei tonaɓiin kpɔigi ɠa geei ɠa.› Wo zoogɛ geeɠɔlɔgi ɠaa vaiti gaaɠaazu, kɛlɛ wo la zoosu wo ʋa niima yeeɠɛɠalai ma ʋoogiti gaaɠa.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:2-3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/>Niizuʋɛ nuɓusɛ ɲɔiti, niiti ti ga wooʋalada nuiti GALA bɛ, naati ka ti laavɔɔ vaa maaɠaazaɠabosu! Tama poo kili nɔpɛ ge la vea ti ya, kɛni Zonase ná-poogi.» Naa ʋoluma é ti yɛni ná, é li.<verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faliziɛinti ta Saduseyɛinti ta-lɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Maleke 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>Ti ɠɛai ma ziɛi ɓudɛzu, kaladopoiti ti yeemani, ti la ɓulua zeɠeni. <verse eid="MAT 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «À ɓɔɠɔ zo, wo dama ga Faliziɛinti ta Saduseyɛinti ta-lɛʋɛi.»<verse eid="MAT 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Kaladopoiti ti zɛba ti ɗa ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma: «Tɛi ade la ɓulu zeɠeni, naa ɠa é nuuma wooi wosu da.»<verse eid="MAT 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>Tɛi Yesu ti ɠisu vai ɠwɛɛni, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Lee vaa zu wo kpɔɛi zuɠulazu ga tɛi wo la ɓulu zeɠeni? Ee, wa-ɠidaaleʋei lɔiʋɛ dɛ ɗɛ! <verse eid="MAT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/>Wo la dɛ gaaɠaani? Wo-ɠi ge la looni ɓulu lɔɔlugɔi zu, nii gaaɠwɛɛni nu waadɔɔlugɔi (5.000) ʋa, kpɔlɔ dielegɔ ɠa é yɛni, wo gaalɛɛni ba? <verse eid="MAT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/>Ɓulu lɔfelai ɓalaa, nii gaaɠwɛɛni nu waanaanigɔi (4.000) ʋa, kpɔlɔ dielegɔ ɠa é yɛni, wo gaalɛɛni ba? <verse eid="MAT 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/>É leʋe ɠale, wo la naa ɠaaɠaazu ga ɓului lɛi, gè ʋa ɠɛ vaazu ma, siɛgi zu gè ɠɛɛzu la wo ma: ‹À dama ga Faliziɛinti ta Saduseyɛinti ta-lɛʋɛi›?» <verse eid="MAT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>Ti gaaɠaani niina ga lɛʋɛ ɓɔɠɔi lɛi, é ʋa ɠɛ ɠɛɛzu ti ma: «À dama la.» Kɛlɛ toɠa ɠɛɛzu ti ma: «À dama ga Faliziɛinti ta Saduseyɛinti ta-ɠalagi.»<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛlɛ Yesu ɠwɛɛ fai ga Kilista</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Maleke 8:27-30</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luke 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>Yesu liini Sezalé Filipe ɠoʋii zu. É ná-kaladopoiti gaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Nuiti ta ɠɛɛzu Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa ga ɓɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Tanigaa ti ɠɛ, ɗa ga Zan Ɓatisete, zɔiti ti ɠɛ Eli, taɠiligaa ti ɠɛ Zelemi ɓaa GALA goo wo nui ta.»<verse eid="MAT 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/>É zɛba é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wɔun, wa ma, wo ɠɛ nà ga ɓɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>Simon Piyɛlɛ gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɠa è ga Mesi, zɛnvu su ƓALAGI ná-Doun Zunui.»<verse eid="MAT 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>Yesu zɛba é ɠɛ ma: «È undaanɛɛʋɛ, Simon, Zonase ná-doun zunui, tɔɔzei nuɓusɛi lɛi é ʋa naa lɛɛ ga ɗe, kɛlɛ Kɛ̀ɛ nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu, naa ɠa é dɛa ga ɗe. <verse eid="MAT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/>Nɔ̀un nà ɠɛɛzu è ma, ɗa ga Piyɛlɛ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Piyɛlɛ</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Daaseigi nii poluʋɛ ga «kɔtui».</char></note> tama kɔtui naa ɠa gè nà-Egilisii losu ma, nii saai ɓɔɠɔi mu ge la zobo nɔpɛ sɔlɔɔga ma. <verse eid="MAT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/>Nà geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai ma ɓaɠuiti feezu è ya. Nii nɔpɛ ɗa pele leʋe tuɠɔ zooi ma, pele ɠa leʋe naa luɠɔ geeɠɔlɔgi zu. Nii ma è pele viesu tuɠɔ zooi ma, pele ɠa vie naa luɠɔ geeɠɔlɔgi zu.» <verse eid="MAT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>Naa ʋoluma é kaladopoiti daa maaɓakpani ga ti mina ɠɛ nu nɔpɛ ma, tɔ ɠa é ga Kilista.<verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu saa vai ta buzeɠe vai wo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-33">Maleke 8:31-33</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 9:21-22">Luke 9:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>É zo naama yee ma, Yesu tɔɔzeini ga é ɗa ɠɛ ná-kaladopoiti ma, kɛni é li Zeluzalɛme, é kpɔlɔ mɔinmɔin sɔlɔɔ totuɠɔiti ta zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti zea, naa ʋɛɛ tɔ kalamɔinti ba. Kɛni ti paa, naa ʋolu é wuzeɠe, é ɠula saai ya foloi zaʋasiɛi.<verse eid="MAT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>Piyɛlɛ zɛba é seɠe, é lii la yɛ, é tɔɔzei ga é ɗa zelii lo ma, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «GALA mina kɛ, Màliɠii! Naa la ɠɛa ga ɗe pɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu latini, é ɠɛ Piyɛlɛ ma: «Maaɠooza bà, Setana! Ɗa nà-pelei zu ga kɔɠɔziɠa zaɓu, mazɔlɔɔ ɗa-ɠisiɛiti ti la ga GALA nɔnɔ, kɛlɛ ta ga nuɓusɛ ɠisiɛiti.»<verse eid="MAT 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nu ʋilɛ pelei Yesu ʋolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:34-9:1">Maleke 8:34—9:1</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 9:23-27">Luke 9:23-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>Naa ʋoluma, Yesu ɠɛni ná-kaladopoiti ma: «Zɔi é pɔ ga é ʋilɛ pòlu, kɛni é ɠikula ɓɔɠɔ zu, é zaa wului zeɠe, é ʋilɛ pòlu. <verse eid="MAT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/>Tɔɔzei zɔi é pɔ é zɛnvui ɠizo, naama nui ɠa ʋala ma. Kɛlɛ zɔi a ʋala zɛnvui ma nà-faa zu, naama nui ɠa sɔlɔɔ ʋolu. <verse eid="MAT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/>Ni nui ta a etea zɔlɔɔ ganii pɛ sɔlɔɔna, kɛlɛ é ʋala zɛnvui ma, kulanuma ɓɛgele ɠa é bɛ? Ɓɛgele ɓɔɠɔɓɔɠɔ ka nu a zoo feezu ga zɛnvui unmɔɔ ganii? <verse eid="MAT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa ʋaazu ta ná-geezuɠeelai, Kɛɛɠɛ ná-lɛbiyai zu, é ɛsɛ pɛ mɛɛin ve, é zoloo ma nu ɠɛɛwotiiti ma. <verse eid="MAT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, tanigaa ta ʋɛ, ti la zaa, eyɛsu ti Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa, é ga masagi, é ɗa ʋa.»<verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠaazuʋɛ valibo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Maleke 9:2-13</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luke 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>Folo lɔzita leʋegai ma naama vaiti poluma, Yesu Piyɛlɛ ta Zake zeɠeni, é ʋɛɛ naa kɛɛɠɛloin Zan ʋa, é li ga tiye yɛ gize ɠaaɠooza golai ta ma. <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>É valiboni ti ɠaazu. Gaazuʋɛ ɠɛni volozu eɠɛ foloi, kɔba zeɠeiti ti ɗa ɠole pepe, eɠɛ wozakala gola. <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>Gaamago Moize ta Eli ti ɠulani kɛlɛma kaladopoiti bɛ, ti ɗa yɛpɛ Yesu ʋɔ.<verse eid="MAT 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Piyɛlɛ ɓɔɛni Yesu ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, soloogɛ ga ade yɛ ʋɛ. Ni ɗa vaana bu, nà kota saʋagɔ lo ʋɛ, gilagi ɠɛ ga ɗɔnɔi, gilagi ɠɛ ga Moize nɔnɔi, zɔi ɠɛ ga Eli nɔnɔi.» <verse eid="MAT 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>É yɛni nɔ ɓɔɛzu ɠana, tonaɓiingi zeɠe geezuʋɛ, é ɗa volo lɛngɛlɛngɛ, é ti maaɓidi. Wooi ta ɠulani naa zu, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Nii ɠa é ga nɛ̀ɛbɛ Loun Zunui, nii é gòla yiilaazu. À woilo goo ma ɗɛ!»<verse eid="MAT 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>Kaladopoiti ti naama wooi mɛnigai ma, ti wola luani, ti laaʋɛɛ zooi ma, ti ɠaazulɔɔɠu. <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu maaɓuɠani ti ʋa, é yeevɔɔɠu ti ʋa, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À mina lua, à wuzeɠe.» <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>Kaladopoiti ti ɠaazuwuzeɠeai ma, ti wɛlɛni, ti la nu ɠili nɔpɛ kaani, kɛni Yesu ɠila nɔ.<verse eid="MAT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>Ti ɠɛai ma gizei yeizu, Yesu ti laa maaɓakpani, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Aisa Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋa wuzeɠe, é ɠula saai ya, nii wo kaai ʋɛ, à mina naa wo nu nɔpɛ ma.»<verse eid="MAT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>Kaladopoiti ti niima ɠaazaɠagi woni da, ti ɠɛ ma: «Lee vaa zu mu tɔ kalamɔinti ti ɠɛɛzu ma, kɛni mɔunpa Eli a ʋaana dɛ ʋolu?» <verse eid="MAT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Gaama ʋe, Eli maanɛɛʋɛ ga é ʋa, é fai pɛ sei kpasu ga pagɔ. <verse eid="MAT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/>Kɛlɛ nɔ̀un, nà bosu wo ma ga: Eli mu paaʋɛ niina, kɛlɛ ti la naa ɠwɛɛni, ti naa zo ga ʋelei ti ɠɛni pɔ la. Tama ʋele nɔ ɠana ti ʋaazu Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɓɔlɔzu la.» <verse eid="MAT 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>Kaladopoiti ti gaaɠaani ga Zan Ɓatisete ɠa, é ɠɛni vaazu ma.<verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fɔlivɔli loungoi ɠɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Maleke 9:14-29</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luke 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>Ti maaɓuɠaai ma bɛbɛi ʋa, zunui ta ʋaani Yesu ʋɔ bɛ, é ʋilɛ ɲiibiɠa kakala, é maanɛɛnɛ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>«Màliɠii, dòun zunui maawɔinɠa kae, fɔlivɔlii ɠa é ba, toɠa wola zoolɛzu ga ʋe. Yeeɠɛɠalai tanigaa zu, toɠa loo abui ɠa, ɓaa ziɛi wu. <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>Gè ʋaa la ɗa-ɠaladopoiti pɔ, kɛlɛ ti la zooni ti ʋa kɛdɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Ee, kidaaleʋelala nuɓusɛiti, ti ga yaava nuiti, nà yɛsu wo ʋa dɛ, eyɛsu yeelɛ? Nà yeezei wo wu, eyɛsu yeelɛ? À ʋa pɔ̀ ga doungoi.» <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Yesu devei veeni inɛgi ya ga sɛbɛi. Tama inɛgi ɠulani doungoi zu, naa ɠɛdɛ gaamago nɔ.<verse eid="MAT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>Ti maaɠelesa teʋeai ma, kaladopoiti ti Yesu ɠaazaɠani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Lee vaa zu gi la zooni gi ʋa niima inɛgi ɓɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Wo la zooni wo ʋa kpɛ, tɔɔzei wa-ɠidaaleʋei lɔiʋɛ. Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, ni wa-ɠidaaleʋei ɠɛni ga mutaalede kaei ɠɛʋele, wa la zoo ɠɛɛzu gizei nii ma: ‹Zeɠe ʋɛ, è li munu,› a la naa ɠɛ. Faa tanɔpɛ ge la ɓena ɓaa wo ya. <verse eid="MAT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21"/>[Kɛlɛ nii ɠɛɠala inɛgi la zooga ɠulazu GALA fali ta zu sogai ʋolu.»]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu saa vai wo fai ʋolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maleke 9:30-32</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luke 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>Yeeta Yesu ta ná-kaladopoiti ti ɠɛni leʋesu Galilé yooi zu, é ɠɛni naati ma: «Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa ʋaazu lɔɔzu nuiti zeezu, <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/>ti paa. Kɛlɛ foloi zaʋasiɛi, toɠa wuzeɠe, é ɠula saai ya.» Naama wooi ná-kaladopoiti ziiɓɔlɔni ga gola.<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ta Piyɛlɛ ti mulu ɠula vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>Ti lɛai ma Kapɛɛlɛnawume, zɔiti ti ɠɛni mului zosu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma vaa ma, naati ti maaɓuɠani Piyɛlɛ ʋa, ti ɠɛ ma: «Wa-ɠalamɔin la GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu mului ta ɠulazu ɓaa?» <verse eid="MAT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>Piyɛlɛ ɠɛ ti ma: «Ɓa-o, toɠa ɗa kula.» Siɛgi zu é lɛɛni la pɛlɛi wu, Yesu mɔunpa ge kpɔɛi zeɠeni, é ɠɛ ma: «Simon, ɗa ɠisiɛzu ɠale? Eteai zu masagiti, ɓɛ ɠa ta ɗa mului ɠula zea? Zou lointi ɓaa wɛɛinti?» <verse eid="MAT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni ma: «Wɛɛinti.» Yesu ɠɛni ma mɔnɔ: «Naa ɠa é dɛɛzu ga, zou lointi pɔ ge la ta zu. <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/>Kɛlɛ anɛɛ naa ʋe, de mina ɠɛ ga niima nuiti kaka saɓu. Tɔ ɠa é ba, yei ziɛ wolai laaʋɛ, è kalagi ʋili ziɛi wu. Kale mɔunpagi è kulazu, daalao, ɗa wali ɠaei ɠaazu su. Seɠe, è fe tiya ga de felegɔ dɔnɔi.»<verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓɛ ɠa bɔɔlɔai ɛsɛ pɛ ba?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maleke 9:33-37</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luke 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>Naama ziɛgi zu kaladopoiti ti maaɓuɠani Yesu ʋa, ti gaazaɠa, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa mu bɔɔlɔai geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai zu?»<verse eid="MAT 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>Yesu zɛba é doungoi ta loli, é pilɛ ti zaama. <verse eid="MAT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, ni wo la wo-ziɛ ʋelei maavaliboni, wo ʋa ɠɛ ga doungoiti kɛʋele, wo la lɔa geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai zu. <verse eid="MAT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/>Naa ɠa é ba, zɔi nɔpɛ a ɓɔɠɔmaayeina eɠɛ doungoi nii, naama nui ɠa wɔɔlɔ geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai zu. <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/>Zɔi nɔpɛ a yeezei doungoi ta wu eɠɛ nii, nɔ̀un maaʋele ma, naama nui yeezeiɗa bù, nà ɓɔɠɔi.»<verse eid="MAT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nu loo vai kotoi zu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Maleke 9:42-48</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luke 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>«Kɛlɛ doungoi niiti kpein ti laai nɔ̀un da, zɔi nɔpɛ a ti ɠila kpalaa toona kotoi zu, a la vizɔ naama nui ma ga kɔtu wolai ɠili kɔgi ʋa, ti pili, é yɛ kpoloɗɛi wu. <verse eid="MAT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/>Maanɔɠɔ vaa ʋe eteai ʋɛ ga kaka faiti ti ʋa, niiti ti nuiti toozu kotoi zu. Kɛɛɠeleɠele kili ge la ná, kɛni naa ɠɛɠala vaiti ti ʋa, kɛlɛ maanɔɠɔ wola ɠa naama nui ʋɛ, nii ti ʋaazu ga maaʋele. <verse eid="MAT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/>Ni è-yeei ɓaa è-ɠɔɠɔi ɠa é è loozu kotoi zu, ti leʋe ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, è ti ʋili ya poun. Tɔɔzei fizɔgɛ è ma è lɔ ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui zu ga è maalɛɠɛfɛgai, kɛlɛ è-yee felegɔi ɓaa è-ɠɔɠɔ felegɔi mina yɛ è ʋa, è ʋa ʋili ɠɔoɠɔ abui zu. <verse eid="MAT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/>Ni è-ɠaazuɠɛzɛi ɠa é è loozu kotoi zu, kula su, è pili ya poun. Tɔɔzei fizɔgɛ è ma ga è lɔ ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui zu ga è-ɠaazu ɠila kpe nɔ, è-ɠaazuɠɛzɛ felegɔiti gaavɔnigai ʋa yɛ è ya, ɗa ma è ʋili undaaʋili abui zu.»<verse eid="MAT 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ baalagi ʋa nii toai ya, <optbreak/> é ɠa ʋolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luke 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>«À dama, wo mina doungoi niiti gila kpalaa bɛlɛlala, tɔɔzei gè bo wo ma, ta-ɠeezuɠeelaiti ta wɛlɛzu siɛnɔpɛ su Kɛ̀ɛ ɠaazu, nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu. <verse eid="MAT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/>[Tɔɔzei Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋaaʋɛ naati kizosu, niiti ti loai ya.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>«Wa ɠisiɛzu ɠale? Ni baala ungila (100) ka ɠɛna zunui ta ya, gilagi loo ya, ni é la puutaaʋuugɔ maazu taaʋuugɔiti (99) zɛga ná gizeiti ma, é ʋa li zɔ ɠilagi ɠaiziɛzu, nii toai ya? <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, ni a kaana, baala gilagi naa ɠa gola ɠoozunɛ, é leʋe zɔ ʋuutaaʋuugɔ maazu taaʋuugɔiti (99) ba, niiti ti la ɠɛa looni ya. <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/>Zekana ɓalaa wo-Ɠɛɛ la, nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu, é la pɔ ga niima loungoi ɠila kpalaa ge loo ya.»<verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Suvaayɛgi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>«Ni è-ɠɛɛloin a koto ɠɛɛna è laalɔɠɔma, li, è bo ma wo felegɔ wo yɔɠɔzu. Ni a woilona è-woo ma, naazu è è-ɠɛɛloin zɔlɔɔga. <verse eid="MAT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/>Kɛlɛ ni é la kɛɛni é ʋa woilo è-woo ma, nu ɠila ɓaa nu felegɔ ʋɛɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, naa ɠa a kɛ nii nɔpɛ a ɠɛ wosu, ‹ti pɛ gaaɠula ba ga zeele felegɔ ɓaa zeele saʋagɔ ná-zeele wooi maaʋele.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">TSV 19:15</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/>Ni é la kɛɛni é ʋa woilo naati goo ma, bo Egilisii ma. Ni é la woiloni Egilisii woo ma, pɛtɛ ga kidaaleʋelala nui, ɓaa mulu zo nui è letema.<verse eid="MAT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>«Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, nii nɔpɛ wa pele leʋe tuɠɔ zooi ma, pele ɠa leʋe naa luɠɔ geeɠɔlɔgi zu. Nii ma wo pele viesu tuɠɔ zooi ma, pele ɠa vie naa luɠɔ geeɠɔlɔgi zu.<verse eid="MAT 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/>«Nà bosu wo ma ɓalaa ga: Ni nu felegɔ wo zaama, ta zoloona faa ɠila ma zooi ma ga ti fali, Kɛ̀ɛ nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu, naa ɠa kɛ ti ʋɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/>Tɔɔzei, ʋɛ nɔpɛ nu felegɔ ɓaa nu saʋagɔ ta ɠaalɛ ba ná dàaseigi zu, nà ti zaama.»<verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ botiɠɛ nui ʋa nii é la maavaayɛ bosu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>Naama ziɛgi zu Piyɛlɛ maaɓuɠani Yesu ʋa, é gaazaɠa, é ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, nii kɛ̀ɛloin ɠa ba nɔ, é ɗa kotoi ɠɛ dàalɔɠɔma, nà suvaayɛ ga seizu lielegɔ? Gè suvaayɛ ga seizu lɔfela mu ɓaa?» <verse eid="MAT 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Ɓa-o, gè la ɠɛɛzu è ma seizu lɔfela, kɛlɛ seizu ʋuulɔfela (70) zeizu lɔfela.<verse eid="MAT 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/>«Tɔ ɠa é ba, geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai ɠulaʋɛ eɠɛ masagi nii é ná-botiɠɛ nuiti tolini ga ti ʋoluvaawo ma, é lo ná-naavoloi ʋa. <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/>Siɛgi zu é gaalugi lɔɔzeini la, ti ʋaani pɔ ga nu ɠila, nii maaɠuyei wola mɔinni ga walii. <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/>Kuyei naa ɠula zobo nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni zunui naa ʋɛ. Ná-kundiɠii devei veeni ga ti tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ʋɔdi, ta anzai, naa ʋɛɛ ná-dointi ta kɔligiti pɛ ba, nii a kɛ maaɠuyei ɠula. <verse eid="MAT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/>Botiɠɛ nui ʋilɛni ɲiibiɠa zooi ma ná-kundiɠii ɠɔɠɔwu, é maanɛɛnɛ, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Yiilɔɔ kae, nà ɗa-ɠuyei pɛ kulazu.› <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/>Zunui naa maawɔin ná-kundiɠii zoni gola, é suvaayɛ ga naama ɠuyei, nii é ɠɛni ma, é ɓe naa ʋa, é li.<verse eid="MAT 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/>«Siɛgi zu zunui naa ɠulani la ná-kundiɠii ʋɔ bɛ, ti ɠomini ta ná-botiɠɛɲɔɠɔi gila, tɔ ɓalaa ná-kuye ɠɛni naa ma ga wali go. É naa zoni kɔda, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Nà-kuyei é è ma, kulana!› <verse eid="MAT 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/>Botiɠɛɲɔɠɔi maanɛɛnɛni, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Yiilɔɔ kae, nà ɗa-ɠuyei pɛ kulazu.› <verse eid="MAT 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/>Kɛlɛ é la kɛɛni é ʋa naa zuvaayɛ. É liini, é pili kasoi ɠa, eyɛsu naa ɓe ga ná-kuyei ɠula.<verse eid="MAT 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/>«Ná-botiɠɛɲɔɠɔiti ti naama vaiti pɛ kaai ma niiti ti ɠɛɛni, ti yiiɓɔlɔni gola, ti liini, ti ti pɛ bo ta-ɠundiɠii ma. <verse eid="MAT 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/>Naa zɛba é ma botiɠɛ nui loli, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɗa ga botiɠɛ nu ɲɔu, è màanɛɛnɛʋɛ, gè è zuvaayɛ ga è-maaɠuyei pɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/>Ɗa ɓalaa, lee vaa zu è la ɗa-wotiɠɛɲɔɠɔi maawɔinɠaani ga ʋelei gè kɛa la è ʋɛ?› <verse eid="MAT 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/>Ná-kundiɠii yiiɠaawana ʋelei ma, é pilini kasoi ɠa tɔ ɓalaa, ga ti maanɔɠɔ, eyɛsu é ɓe ga maaɠuyei pɛ kula.<verse eid="MAT 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/>«Kɛ̀ɛ nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu, ʋele ɠana é ʋaazu kɛɛzu la ga wo ɠilagilagiti pɛ, ni wo la ɠɛ kɛɛni, wo ʋa wo-ɠɛɛlointi suvaayɛ ga yiimaʋɛ pɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s">Kalagi Yesu boni <optbreak/> é ʋilɛ vulu zaa vai ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-13">Maleke 10:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>Yesu ɓegai ma ga kalagi naati bo, é zeɠeni Galilé yooi zu, é li Zudé yooi zu, ʋɛ ná Zuludɛn ʋoluʋelei. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>Bɛbɛ wolai ʋilɛni polu. É seeɓɛ nuiti kɛdɛni náʋɛ.<verse eid="MAT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>Faliziɛin tanigaa ti maaɓuɠani ba, nii a kɛ ti suɠɔɠɔ ga gaazaɠagi, ti ɠɛni ma: «Tɔgi vaaʋɛ nɛi bu ga zunui ɠɛlɛ anzai ʋa, fai ma zii tanɔpɛ su?» <verse eid="MAT 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wo la dɛ kalani mu GALA sɛʋɛiti su ga tɔɔzeizu mɔunpa Ani Ɓɛtɛ ƓALAGI nuɓusɛi ɓɛtɛni, zunui ta anzanui,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Zen 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5:2</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/>é zɛba é ɠɛ ma: ‹Naa ɠa é ba, zunui ɠa zeɠe kɛɛɠɛ ta dee ʋa, é ɠili anzai ʋa, ti felegɔ ta ɠɛ ga kpusɛ ɠila›?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Zen 2:24</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/>Naazu ti la mɔ ga nu felegɔ, ta niina ga kpusɛ ɠila kpe. Naa ɠa é ba, nu nɔpɛ ge mina naa ɠaaɠwɛ, nii GALA ge kpɔgai su.»<verse eid="MAT 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>Kɛlɛ Faliziɛinti ti ɠɛni ma: «Lee vaa zu mu Moize devei veai ga zunui ɠa zoo vulu zaa zɛʋɛi veezu anzai ya, ti bali ma ta naa?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 24:1">TSV 24:1</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wa-ɠikpaai maaʋele ɠa é kɛɛni, Moize ɗa va bu ga wo ɗa ɠɛlɛ wo-anzaiti ba. Kɛlɛ mɔungi é la ɠɛni ɠana. <verse eid="MAT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/>Naa ʋoluma, nɔ̀un, nà bosu wo ma ga: Zɔi nɔpɛ é ɠɛlɛzu anzai ʋa, é taɠili sei, é wɛɛnziɛgi ɠɛa, kɛni ni anzai koloɠolo kɛɛʋɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>Ná-kaladopoiti ti ɠɛni ma: «Ni ʋele ɠana zunui ɠɛʋelei la ti yɔɠɔzu ta anzai, é la vizɔni mu ga nu ʋa anza vulu.» <verse eid="MAT 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɛsɛ pɛ ge la zoosu yeezeizu naama wooi wu, kɛni zɔiti nɔ niiti GALA ge ma zobogi veai ti ʋɛ. <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/>Tɔɔzei tanigaa ta ná ti la zooga anza zeizu mazɔlɔɔ ti zɔlɔɔgɛ ɠana, tanigaa ti ná niiti ti sɔlɔɔgai ga nuiti saɓui, taɠiligaa ti ɠɛlɛʋɛ anza zei vai ʋa geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai maaʋele zu. Zɔi nɔpɛ a zoo yeezeizu faa wu, naama nui yeezei nii wu.»<verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yeezei vai doungoiti bu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maleke 10:13-16</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luke 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Nuiti ti ʋaani ga doungoiti Yesu ʋɔ, nii a kɛ é yeela ti ma, é GALA fali ti ʋɛ. Kaladopoiti ti ɠɛni zelii losu naama nuiti ma. <verse eid="MAT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «À ɓe doungoiti ba, ti ʋa pɔ̀. À mina pele leʋe ti luɠɔ, tɔɔzei geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai ɠa ga naati tɔnɔ, niiti ti ga ti ɠɛʋele.» <verse eid="MAT 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>Naa ʋoluma é yeelaani ti ma, é zɛba é zeɠe miná, é ɗa li.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Naavolo nuiti ta GALA ná-masadai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maleke 10:17-31</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luke 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Zinipoi ta maaɓuɠani ba, é ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn, faa ʋagɔi ɓɛgele ɠa maanɛai ga gè kɛ, gè ʋa ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui zɔlɔɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Lee vaa zu è gàazaɠasu naa ma, nii pagai? Gila kpe nɔ ɠa pagai. Ni ɗa pɔ ga è lɔ ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui zu, deveiti so.» <verse eid="MAT 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>Zunui ɠɛ ma: «Devei naati ta ga ɓɛgeleni?» Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Mina nu ʋaa, mina wɛɛnziɛ bo, mina unma wo, mina zɛɛ zeele woo wo, <verse eid="MAT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/>è-ɠɛɛ lɛbi ta è-lee,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:18-19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Ɛgz 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">TSV 5:16-20</ref></char>.</char></note> è-zeiɲɔɠɔi nɛɛ ʋɛ, eɠɛ ɗa ɓɔɠɔi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>Zinipoi ɠɛ ma: «Gè naama leveiti pɛ soga. Ɓɛgele ɠa niina é ʋoluzu, gè la dɛ kɛɛni?» <verse eid="MAT 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Ni ɗa pɔ ga è laazeeli, li, è è-ɠɔligiti pɛ pɔdi, è ma naavoloi ve bala nuiti bɛ, naazu ɗa naavolo zɔlɔɔ geeɠɔlɔgi zu. Naa ʋoluma, ʋa, è ʋilɛ pòlu.» <verse eid="MAT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Zinipoi naama wooi mɛnigai ma, é li ga ziiɓɔlɔi, tɔɔzei kɔligi wola mɔinni.<verse eid="MAT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>Yesu zɛba é ɠɛ ná-kaladopoiti ma: «Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, kpɛtɛ nui lɔɔ vai wola ɓaaʋɛ geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai zu. <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/>Nà bosu wo ma ɓalaa ga ɲɔmɛi leʋe fai la ɓaani sɛɠilɛ zeɠei zu, é ʋa zeeli kpɛtɛ nui lɔɔ vai zu geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai zu.»<verse eid="MAT 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>Kaladopoiti ti naa mɛnigai ma, ti wola laavɔɔni, ti gaazaɠa, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa mu a zoo ɠizosu?» <verse eid="MAT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>Yesu wɛlɛni ti ʋa, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Naa la zooga é ʋa ɠɛ nuɓusɛiti zea, kɛlɛ fai pɛ ka zoo ɠɛɛzu GALA zea.»<verse eid="MAT 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Piyɛlɛ zɛba é kpɔɛi zeɠe, é ɠɛ ma: «Gá ma? Gi fai pɛ zɛga ná, gi ʋilɛ è ʋolu. Gɔnɔi ɠa ɠɛɛzu ɠale?» <verse eid="MAT 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, siɛgi zu etea niinɛi ɠulazu la, Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa ʋaana, é zei ná-lɛbiya masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa, naazu wɔigiti kpein wo ʋilɛgai pòlu, wa ɠɛ zeini masa kpɔkpɔ puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12) ɠa, wo ɗa Izilayɛle woloda puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) tukpɔɠaaleʋe. <verse eid="MAT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/>Zɔiti nɔpɛ ti zeɠezu ta-ʋɛlɛiti ba, ti-ɠɛɛlointi ɓaa ti-ʋaazeelaiti ba, ti-ɠɛɛni ɓaa ti-leeni ba, ti-lointi ba, ɓaa ta-lii ɠɛɛzuʋɛti ba nɔ̀un maaʋele ma, ta ʋaazu naati ma ʋɛɛda ungilagilagi zɔlɔɔsu, naa ʋoluma ta tɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui zu. <verse eid="MAT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/>Kɛlɛ nu mɔungiti ma mɔinmɔin ka ɠɛ ga ma ɠaaɓelagiti, tama ma ɠaaɓelagiti ma mɔinmɔin ge ɠɛ ga ma mɔungiti.<verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s">Botiɠɛ nui niiti ti zeɠeai kpɔkɔmaʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>«Mazɔlɔɔ geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai ɠulaʋɛ ga pɛlɛ kɛɛɠɛi nii é ɠulani ga sobuzobui, nii a kɛ é botiɠɛ nuiti gaiziɛ, é ti leʋe ná-leezɛn ɓelei zu. <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/>É tanigaa ɠaani, ta naati ti suvaawogi wo, ti zoloo wali ɠae gila ma foloi zu, é naati teʋe ná-leezɛn ɓelei zu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/>Naa ʋoluma é ɠulani ʋolu sobu lɛlɛi laaʋuusiɛi ma, é taɠiligaa ʋɛtɛ, ti loni dɔɔɠɔ ɓalagi zu, botii la ti ya. <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: ‹À li nà-kpelei zu, wo-zalai nii maanɛai ga gè fe wo ya, nà naa ve.› <verse eid="MAT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/>Naati ti liini kpelei zu. Pɛlɛ kɛɛɠɛi ɠulani mɔnɔ folo gaalɔgai ma, naa ʋolu é ɠula lɛlɛi zaʋasiɛi ma kpɔkɔ voloi, é taɠiligaa leʋe mɔnɔ ɠana nɔ. <verse eid="MAT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/>Kpɔkɔi lɛlɛi lɔɔlusiɛi ma, é ɠulani ʋolu, é zunui taɠiligaa ʋɛtɛ, ti loni ete zaamaʋɛ. É ti ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Toɠa ɠale wo luʋa kpain loni ʋɛ, wo la boti ɠɛɛzu?› <verse eid="MAT 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/>Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: ‹Nu nɔpɛ ge la botii veeni gi ya, gi ʋa kɛ.› É ɠɛni ti ma: ‹Wa ɓalaa, à li nà-kpelei zu.›<verse eid="MAT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>«Kpɔkɔi zeeliai ma, é ɠɛni ná naavolo makɛ nui ma: ‹Botiɠɛ nuiti toli, è ti-zalaiti fe ti ya, ɗa tɔɔzei nu ɠaaɓelagiti ma, é li ma mɔungiti pɔ.› <verse eid="MAT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/>Zɔiti ti botii lɔɔzeini lɛlɛi lɔɔlusiɛi ma, naati ti ʋaani, ɛsɛ pɛ ge sɔlɔɔ ga wali ɠae ɠilagila. <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/>Naa ʋoluma nu mɔungiti ti ʋaani, ti ɗa ɠisiɛ ga ta sɔlɔɔsu ga mɔinga, kɛlɛ tiya ɓalaa ti pɛ ti sɔlɔɔni ga wali ɠae ɠilagila. <verse eid="MAT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/>Siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni wali zosu da, ti ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu unsu ga pɛlɛ kɛɛɠɛi, <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/>ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Wɛlɛ botiɠɛ nu ɠaaɓelagi niiti è ti zeɠeai, naati lɛlɛi ɠila boti nɔ ɠa ti kɛa, tama, è ɗa gi-zalaiti gaa ɠɛ sɔli ga tiye, gɛiti gi luʋa folo ɠelegi wu kpain.› <verse eid="MAT 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/>É ti ɠila gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Bɔɛ, gè la telebotala vai ɠɛɛni ga ɗe, kɛbɛ de zoloogɛ folo luʋa wotii ma zalai ma ga wali ɠae ɠila, kɛlɛ? <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/>Ɗa-walii zeɠe, è li. Nà pɔ ga gè nu ɠaaɓelagi zala ga è ɠɛʋele. <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/>Ɓaa màa la nɛɛni mu gè ʋa yiimaɠɛ ga zèaɠɔligi mu ɓaa? Ɓaa tɛi gè faaɓɔɠɔi ɠɛɛzu, naama loloi ɠa è kulazu mu ɓaa?› » <verse eid="MAT 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>Yesu wooɠaaɓelani, é ɠɛ ma: «Ʋele ɠana é la, nu mɔungiti ta ɠɛ ga ma ɠaaɓelagiti, nu ɠaaɓelagiti ti ɠɛ ga ma mɔungiti.»<verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu saa vai ta buzeɠe vai wo fai ʋolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maleke 10:32-34</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luke 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>Siɛgi zu é ɠɛni lɛɛzu la Zeluzalɛme, Yesu keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) seɠeni yɛ pelei zu, ti maaɠelesa ge leʋe, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/>«À woilo, ada lɛɛzu Zeluzalɛme. Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa ʋaazu lɔɔzu zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti zeezu ta tɔ kalamɔinti. Ta ná-tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe ga é za. <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/>Ta dɔ zii ɠiligiti zeezu ga naati ti ɲɛɛɠula su, ti doɠa ga kpakɔi, naa ʋolu ti kpadɔ saa wului ma. Naa pɛ poluma, toɠa wuzeɠe, é ɠula saai ya foloi zaʋasiɛi.»<verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maanɛɛnɛi nii Zeɓedé ná-doun zunu felegɔiti ti-lee boni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Maleke 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Názuʋɛ, Zeɓedé anzai, ta ná-doun zunu felegɔiti, ti maaɓuɠani Yesu ʋa. É nɔkɔni Yesu ɠɔɠɔwu, nii a kɛ é faaɓɔɠɔ vali ma. <verse eid="MAT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Ɓɛgele ɠa è pɔ?» É gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Wɛlɛ dòun zunu felegɔiti ba. Ɗa ɠɛna ɗa-masadai zu, va bu kae ga ti zei è ɠoba, gilagi ɠɛ è yeezazuʋɛ, zɔi ɠɛ è ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Wo la kwɛɛ nii wo falizu ɠana. Wa zoo nɛi wo ɓɔɔle ga soolɛi ma ɗaawɔi nii gè ɓɔɔlezu la?» Ti ɠɛni ma: «Eyei, gá zoo naa la.» <verse eid="MAT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>Yesu zɛba é ɠɛ ti ma: «Gaama ʋe, wa ɓɔɔle ga nà-ziawɔi. Kɛlɛ nii é ga sei wo fai kòba zèezazuʋɛ ta kɔ̀ʋɛzuʋɛ, naama zobo ge la veeni zèa ga gè fe. Naama zeizuʋɛti ta ga naama nuiti tɔnɔ, niiti Kɛ̀ɛ ti makɛgai ti ʋɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>Kaladopo puugɔi zɔiti ti naama wooi mɛnigai ma, nii ɠɛɛɠɛloun felegɔiti ti boni, é wanani ti ma. <verse eid="MAT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/>Yesu zɛba é ti pɛ toli ɠoba, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wo kwɛni nii a ɗa ɠɛ zooiti su: Zou ɠundiɠiiti ta ɗa zei nuɓusɛiti unga, nu ɓiigiti ti ɗa zei ti unga ga ta-zobogi. <verse eid="MAT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/>Wɔun, naa ta mina ɠɛ wo zaama. Kɛlɛ tɔun ni nui ta ɠa pɔ é ɠɛ ga nu ɓii gola wo zaama, kɛni é ɠɛ ga wo pɛ wa-wotiɠɛ nui. <verse eid="MAT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/>Zɔi é pɔ é ɠɛ ga nu mɔungi wo zaama, kɛni naa ɠɛ ga wa-luɔi. <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/>Mazɔlɔɔ, anɛɛ Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋe, é la ʋaani ga nu ʋa botii ɠɛ bɛ, kɛlɛ tɔ ɓɔɠɔi mu paaʋɛ ga é botii ɠɛɛ nuiti bɛ, é zɛnvui ve ga nu mɔinmɔin unmɔɔ saɓui.»<verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gaazuɠole nu felegɔi ʋalo vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maleke 10:46-52</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luke 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>Siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni ɠulazu la Zeliko ʋa, bɛbɛ wolai ʋilɛni Yesu ʋolu. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Gaazuɠole nu felegɔ ɠɛni zeini pele ɠobaʋɛ. Ti mɛnigai ma ga Yesu ɠa é leʋesu ná ʋelei, ti tɔɔzeini ga kpeei loa, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, Davide ná-Doun Zunui, gi ɠaazumaawɔinɠa!» <verse eid="MAT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Bɛbɛi zelii loni ti ma ga ti maaɠɛ kpɔ, kɛlɛ tɔun ti wooɠula sɛsɛ, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, Davide ná-Doun Zunui, gi ɠaazumaawɔinɠa!»<verse eid="MAT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>Yesu loni, é ti loli, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Lee ɠa wo pɔ ga gè kɛ wo ʋɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, gi-ɠaazuʋɛti ti zeɠe ma.» <verse eid="MAT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Ti maawɔin Yesu zoni, é yeevɔɔɠu ti-ɠaazuʋɛti ba. Gaamago nɔ, ti wozaɠaani, ti ʋilɛ polu.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lɛɛ vai Zeluzalɛme</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maleke 11:1-11</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luke 19:28-40</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Zan 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>Siɛgi zu ti maaɓuɠani la Zeluzalɛme ʋa, ti zeelini Ɓɛtefazé taa goi ɠobaʋɛ, Wolive wulu ɓelei ma ɠizei ɠobaʋɛ. Yesu ná-kaladopo felegɔ leʋeni, <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/>é ɠɛ ti ma: «À li taa goi nii zu, é wo luɠɔ. Wa lɛɛna nɔ feya, wa soovale saai ta ɠaazu, giliai, ma yiʋoi loni koba. À ti vie, wo ʋa ga tiye pɔ̀. <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/>Ni nu a faa wona wo ma, à ɠɛ ma nɔ: ‹Màliɠii ɓɛdɛi ɠa ti ʋa.› Gaamanɔ toɠa ti yɛna, ti li.»<verse eid="MAT 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>Nii ɠɛɛni, naa ɠa a kɛ, nii GALA goo wo nui boni ma yeeluɠɔ, naa laazeeli ga:<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>«À ɠɛ Siyɔn nuɓusɛi ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Wɛlɛ ɗa-masagi ʋa, é ʋaazu è ʋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">é ga ɓɔɠɔmaayei nu, é zeini soovale saai ɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">soovale saai ma yiʋoi ɠɔma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 62:11">Eza 62:11</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zkl 9:9</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>Kaladopoiti ti liini, ti ziɛ ga naa nɔ, nii Yesu boni ti ma. <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>Ti ʋaani ga soovale saai ta ná-ziʋoi, ti ta-zeɠe wolaiti pɛɛni ti ɠɔma, Yesu lɛ, é zei kɔma. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>Bɛbɛi zaama nu mɔinmɔin ge ɠɛni ta-zeɠe wolaiti pɛɛzu pelei zu, tanigaa ti ɗa gulu ɓekegiti teʋe, ti ɗa ti ʋɛɛ pelei zu. <verse eid="MAT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/>Bɛbɛi nii pɛ é ɠɛni ziɛzu Yesu luɠɔʋelei, ta poluʋelei, ti ɠɛni wooɠulazu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">«Ozana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ozana</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Maamusɛ wooi nii poluʋɛ ga «kizo fai ve».</char></note> Davide ná-Doun Zunui ʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Maliɠii tuya loo naama nui ʋɛ, nii é ʋaazu daaseigi zu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Ozana GALA bɛ geeɠɔlɔgi ungaʋɛ!»<verse eid="MAT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>Siɛgi zu Yesu lɛɛni la Zeluzalɛme, taa nuiti pɛ ti ɠɛni wuulee, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa ga nii?» <verse eid="MAT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>Bɛbɛi nii é ɠɛni polu, naati ti ɠɛni ti wooɠaaʋotesu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Galilé yooi zu Nazalɛte ƓALA goo wo nui Yesu ʋe.»<verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pɔdi loo nuiti kpɛɛ vai <optbreak/> GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maleke 11:15-19</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luke 19:45-48</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Zan 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Yesu lɛɛni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ, é pɔdi loo nuiti pɛ kpɛ ná. É wali valibo nuiti ta-laɓaliiti tokani, naa ʋɛɛ poopo pɔdi nuiti ta-ɓɔkpɔgiti ba. <verse eid="MAT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: ‹Nà-pɛlɛi ɠa loli ga GALA fali ʋɛlɛi.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Eza 56:7</ref></char>.</char></note> Kɛlɛ wɔun, wo ná ɠɛa ga toosu nuiti dɔɔɠuzuʋɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 7:11">Zel 7:11</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>Gaazuɠole nuiti ta mɛɠɛlɛ nuiti ti maaɓuɠani ba, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ, tama é ti ɠɛdɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta tɔ kalamɔinti ti laavɔɔ vaiti kaai ma, niiti é ti ɠɛɛni, ta ti doungoiti goomɛnigai ma GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ozana Davide ná-Doun zunui ʋɛ,» ti yiiɠaawanani ga gola. <verse eid="MAT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/>Ti ɠɛni Yesu ma: «Ɗa nuu mɛnisu nɛi, nii doungoiti ti bosu?» Yesu ɠɛ ti ma: «Eyei. Wɔun kaipa wo la dɛ niima wooi ɠalani mu ɓaa, nii é ɠɛɛzu ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:16">‹Doungoiti ta ɲiimiɓɔlegiti daaʋɛ ɠa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:16">è ɗa-lɛbiyai zɔlɔɔsu ná›?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 8:3">Guy 8:3</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ti yɛni ná, é ɠula taai ʋa, é li Ɓetani, é kpidi ɠila kɛ ná.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kooleɠoole gului ɠoto vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Maleke 11:12-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Sobuzobui, siɛgi zu é ɠɛni ɠalesu la ma taazuʋɛ, pului soni. <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>É kooleɠoole gului ta ɠaani pele ɠobaʋɛ. É maaɓuɠani ba. Kɛlɛ é la ma waa nɔpɛ kaani ga, kɛni gaalaagiti nɔ. É zɛba é ɠɛ gului ma: «Eyɛsu pɛ è la mɔ gwaa ɠila kpalaa boga!» Gaamago nɔ, gului naa vɔɔni. <verse eid="MAT 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>Kaladopoiti ti miná ɠaai ma, ti laavɔɔni ga gola, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Gului nii vɔɔʋɛ ɠale gaamago nɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, ni kidaaleʋei ɠa wo ya, wo la inɛinɛni, nii ɠani gè kɛai ga kooleɠoole gului nii, wa zoo wo kɛɠalai ɠɛ, kɛlɛ é ɓudɛ naa maazu, wa vɔlɔ wa ɠɛ gizei nii ma: ‹Wuzeɠe miná, è ʋili kpoloɗɛi wu,› tama naama vai ɠa ɠɛ nɔ ti. <verse eid="MAT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/>Ni wa GALA falina ga kidaaleʋei, nii nɔpɛ wo falizu, wa sɔlɔɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mini ɠa Yesu ná-zobogi zeɠezu ná?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maleke 11:27-33</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luke 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>Yesu liini GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ, é tɔɔzei ga kalagi woga. Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta nuɓusɛiti ta-lotuɠɔiti ti maaɓuɠani ba naama ziɛgi zu, ti ɠɛ ma: «Zobo kpɛgele ɠa è niima vaiti kɛɛzu la? Ɓɛ ɠa é ma zobogi vea è ya?» <verse eid="MAT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Nà ɓalaa, gaazaɠa gila ka bɛ̀ ga gè bo wo ma. Ni wa gòoɠaaʋotena, nà ɓalaa, zobogi nii gè niima vaiti kɛɛzu bu, nà naa zeɠezuʋɛ lɛ ga woye niina. <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/>Ɓɛ ɠa é zobogi veeni Zan ʋɛ ga é ɗa ɓatizei wo? GALA ge ɠɛni de, ɓaa nuiti kɛni de?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Ti yɛni sulatilatisu yɔɠɔzu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ni ada ɠɛɛna ma: ‹GALA ge ɠɛni de,› toɠa ɠɛ ade ma: ‹Lee vaa zu mu wo la ɠɛni laani Zan la?› <verse eid="MAT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>Kɛlɛ ada ɠɛɛna ma mɔnɔ: ‹Nuiti kɛni de,› kɛni ade lua bɛbɛi ná-ziiɠulai ʋa, tɔɔzei ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɠɛni devezu ga Zan ɠɛni ga GALA goo wo nu.» <verse eid="MAT 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Ti zɛba ti Yesu wooɠaaʋote, ti ɠɛ ma: «Gi la kwɛni.» Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Nɔ̀un nà ɓalaa gè la zobogi nii zeɠezu lɛa ga woye pɛ, nii gè niima vaiti kɛɛzu la.»<verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> zunu loun felegɔiti ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Wa ɠisiɛzu ɠale? Zunu ɠila ge ɠɛni ná, nii doun zunu felegɔ ɠɛni zea. É ɠɛni ma mɔungi ma: ‹Dòun zunu, li za, è botii ɠɛ bɛ̀ leezɛn ɓelei zu.› <verse eid="MAT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/>Naa ɠɛni ma: ‹Gè la liizu.› Naa ʋoluma zunu loungoi naa ɠigi valiboni, é li kpelei zu. <verse eid="MAT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/>Doun kɛɛɠɛi ɓɔɛni ná-doun zunui velesiɛi ʋɔ, é deve ɠilagi naa nɔ ve zea, naa ɠɛ ma: ‹Kɛ̀ɛ, zèe ɠa bu, nà liizu,› kɛlɛ é la kɛɛni é ʋa li. <verse eid="MAT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/>Doun zunu felegɔi naati saama, ɓɛ ɠa é kɛɛɠɛ yiima vai ɠɛai?» Ti Yesu wooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Doun mɔungi.» Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, mulu zo nuiti ta koloɠolo anzanuiti ta leʋesu wo ʋa, ti li GALA ná-masadai zu. <verse eid="MAT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/>Tɔɔzei Zan ʋaani wo ʋɔ, é telebo pelei lɛ ga woye, wo la laani da. Kɛlɛ mulu zo nuiti ta koloɠolo anzanuiti ti laani da. Anɛɛ ɓalaa wo ɠaazulaani miná ma, wo la valiboni wo-yiimaʋɛ, wo ʋa la da.»<verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> kpele makɛ nu ɲɔiti ba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maleke 12:1-12</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luke 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>«À woilo faalaali taɠili ma: Zou kɛɛ nu ɠila ge leezɛn ɓelei laani, é maaɠaku ga sasai, é kɔɠɛi lo ná dɔɔi ɠula vai zu, é pɛlɛ ɠaaɠooza golai lo ná maaɓɛɛ vai zu. Naa pɛ poluma, é kpelei ɠalivaani kpele makɛ nua ma, é li zou ɠili su. <verse eid="MAT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/>Naama waai ɠula yeeɠɛɠalai maaɓuɠazuʋɛ, é ná-botiɠɛ nuiti teʋeni kpele makɛ nuiti ma, ga ti daamiizuʋɛ ve kpele ɠaawaai zu. <verse eid="MAT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/>Kɛlɛ kpele makɛ nuiti ti looni ná-botiɠɛ nuiti su, ti gilagi loɠa, ti zɔi ʋa, ti saʋasiɛi zɔɔ ga kɔtuiti. <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/>Kpele kɛɛ nui botiɠɛ nui taɠiligaa leʋeni ʋolu, niiti ti mɔinni, é leʋe ma mɔungiti ba. Kɛlɛ nii nɔ é zeelini nu mɔungiti ma, naa nɔ ɠa tiya ɓalaa kpele makɛ nuiti ti seini ti ma. <verse eid="MAT 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/>Gaaɓelagi, é doun zunui leʋeni ti ma, é ɗa ɠisiɛ ga: ‹Ta unfe dòun zunui ma.› <verse eid="MAT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/>Kɛlɛ tɛi kpele makɛ nuiti ti ná-doun zunui ɠaani nɔ feya, ti ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔ ma: ‹Pogani zeɠe nui ɠa. Ade paa, de ná-poganii zeɠe ga adɔnɔ.› <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/>Ti soni, ti kula kpelei ʋa, ti paa.<verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>«Siɛgi zu kpele kɛɛ nui ʋaazu la, lee ɠa a kɛ ga kpele makɛ nui naati?»<verse eid="MAT 21:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Toɠa nu ɲɔi naati paa, maawɔinɠa nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛa ba, naa ʋoluma é kpelei ɠaliva kpele makɛ nui taɠiligaa ma, niiti ta ɠɛ daamiizuʋɛ veezu zea ma yeeɠɛɠalai ma.»<verse eid="MAT 21:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma ʋolu: «Kaipa wo la dɛ niima wooi ɠalani GALA sɛʋɛiti su:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">‹Kɔtui nii pɛlɛ lo nuiti ti ɠɛlɛni ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">naa ɠa kɛai ga sɔɓelama ɠɔtu wolai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Maliɠii ɠa é niima vai ɠɛa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">tama toɠa ga laavɔɔ vaa ade ɠaazu.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Guy 118:22-23</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nà bosu wo ma ga: GALA ná-masadai ɠa ɠula wo ya, é ve nuɓusɛ ɠiligaa ya, niiti ta ɠɛ gaawaai ɠulazu. <verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/>[Zɔi nɔpɛ é loozu kɔtui nii ma, naama nui ɠa ɓulukpulu. Zɔi nɔpɛ kɔtui nii a loo ma, ma nui wolowolo.]»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta Faliziɛinti ti naama vaalaaliiti mɛnigai ma, ti gaaɠaani ga tiya ɠa Yesu ɠɛni vaazu ti ma. <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>Ti tɔɔzeini ga so keleɠele gaiziaa, kɛlɛ ti ɠɛni luazu bɛbɛi ʋa, tɔɔzei ɛsɛ pɛ ge deveni ga Yesu ɠa ga GALA goo wo nu.<verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> vulu ɠoozunɛɛi ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luke 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>Yesu ɓɔɛni ti ʋɔ ʋolu faalaaliiti su. É ɠɛni ti ma: <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/>«Geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai ɠulaʋɛ ga masagi nii é fɛti ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni ná-doun zunui ná-vului ɠɛɛ vai zu. <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/>É ná-botiɠɛ nuiti teʋeni ga ti nuiti toli, niiti ti loliga ɠɛni de vulu ɠoozunɛ ɠulazuʋɛ. Kɛlɛ naati ti la ɠɛni kɛɛni, ti ʋa ʋa ná.<verse eid="MAT 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/>«É zɛba é ná-botiɠɛ nui taɠiligaa leʋe, ga ti naama nuiti maanɛɛnɛ, niiti ti loliga ɠɛni de. É valini ná-botiɠɛ nuiti ma, é ɠɛ ti ma: ‹À ɠɛ ti ma: Gè daamii ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛa, gè nà-nikɛ zinɛiti paa, ta nà-togani ʋagɔiti, fai pɛ kɛʋele ɓɛtɛʋɛ niina. À ʋaana daami wo fai ma.›<verse eid="MAT 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/>«Kɛlɛ niiti ti lolini, naati ti la vɔlɔ ta woni bɛ, ɛsɛ ge liini liizu, gila ge li ná-kpalaga, zɔi li ná-yaaɠo ɠɛɛzuʋɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/>Mɔtaiti ti botiɠɛ nuiti soni, ti naati poomu, ti ti ʋa. <verse eid="MAT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/>Masagi yiiɠaawana ʋele ɠana, é ná-salaʋusuiti teʋe, ti nu ʋaa nui naati undaaʋili, ti abui lo ta-laa wolai ʋa.<verse eid="MAT 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/>«Naa ʋoluma, é ɠɛni ná-botiɠɛ nuiti ma: ‹Vulu laamianigi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛʋɛ niina, kɛlɛ niiti ti loliga ɠɛa de, naati ti la ɠɛa zolooni ma. <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/>À liina mu pele zaɠalaʋɛti. Nui niiti nɔpɛ wa ti ɠa, à ti loli fɛti ɠulazuʋɛ.› <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/>Botiɠɛ nuiti ti zɛba ti li pele zaɠalaʋɛti, nui ma zii pɛ nɔ ti kaani, ti naati pɛ tolini, nu ɲɔiti ta nu ʋagɔiti, eyɛsu fɛti laamii wo pɛlɛi wuulaave kpekpe.<verse eid="MAT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>«Masagi lɛɛni ga é nuɓusɛi ʋɛtɛ. É zunui ta ɠaani, nii fɛti zeɠei ta la ɠɛni kɔba. <verse eid="MAT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/>É naa ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Bɔɛ, è leʋegɛ ɠale, è lɛ ʋɛ, tama fɛti zeɠei ta la è ɠɔba, nii soloogai vulu vai ma?› Naa la ɠɛni gooɠaaʋote nɔpɛ sɔlɔɔni. <verse eid="MAT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/>Masagi zɛba é ɠɛ ná-botiɠɛ nuiti ma: ‹À kɔɠɔiti ta zeeiti suɠili, wo pili ya etea ʋelei kpidii zu, ʋɛ gɔlɔi ta ɲiiga ziɛgai ná.› <verse eid="MAT 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>Tɔɔzei nu mɔinmɔin toligɛ, kɛlɛ tago nɔ ɠa ziimazeɠegi wogai ga tiye.»<verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mului zala vai Sezaal ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maleke 12:13-17</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luke 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>Faliziɛinti ti maaɠoozani, ti ɠi fe ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, ʋelei ta zoo ti gaazaɠa sɔlɔɔ da, ti pili Yesu ma, nii a kɛ ti so ga tɔ ɓɔɠɔi daawooi nɔ. <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Ti ta-ɠaladopoi tanigaa leʋeni ma, naa ʋɛɛ Elɔde ʋolu nui tanigaa ʋa. Naati ti ɠɛni Yesu ma: «Kalamɔn, gi kwɛni ga ɗa gaama wosu, ta ɗa kalagi wosu ga gaamai pɛ, é lo naa ʋa, ʋelei GALA ge pɔ ga nu ziɛ la. È la vaazu bu, nu ʋa è zeɠe è-ziɛ ʋele ʋa, tɔɔzei è la wɛlɛzu nuiti tosuʋɛ nɔ ʋa. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>È ɠisu vai wo dɛɛ gi ma mu: Tɔgi vaaʋɛ nɛi bu ga nu mului zala Wɔlɔme masagi Sezaal ma, ɓaa nu mina sala ma?»<verse eid="MAT 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu ɠɛni ta-ɠisiɛ ɲɔi ɠwɛɛ, é ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Ee, woovele nuiti! Lee vaa zu wo sùɠɔɠɔsu? <verse eid="MAT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/>À wali ɠae gila dɛɛ lɛɛ ga ze, nii mului zalazu la.» Ti ʋaani pɔ ga wali ɠae gila. <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>É ti ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Ɓɛ maaniini ta daasei ka é ma?» <verse eid="MAT 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Sezaal ʋe.» É ɠɛni ti ma naazu: «Deɠɛmu, nii é ga Sezaal nɔnɔi, à naa ve Sezaal ya, nii é ga GALA nɔnɔi, wo naa ve GALA zea.»<verse eid="MAT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>Ti naama wooɠaaʋotegi mɛnigai ma, ti laavɔɔni ga gola. Ti zɛni ná, ti zeɠe koba, ti li.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maaɠaalii é lo gɔvɛiti buzeɠe vai ʋa saai ya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maleke 12:18-27</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luke 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>Naama volo ɠilagi nɔ, Saduseyɛinti ti ʋaani pɔ bɛ. Naati ka ti ɠɛ gɔvɛiti ti la wuzeɠezu, ti ʋa ɠula saai ya. Ti niima ɠaazaɠagi woni da, ti ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="MAT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/>«Kalamɔn, Moize niima levei veeni, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Ni zunui ta a zaana, é la doun yɛni ga ʋoluʋelei, kɛɛɠɛloin maanɛɛʋɛ ga é ná-poanzai zei ga anza, nii a kɛ é naa ma zuwui makɛ.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">TSV 25:5</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>Tama, ɠɛɛɠɛloun lɔfela ɠɛa gi zaama. Ma mɔungi vului ɠɛɛni, é za, é la doun yɛni. É ná-poanzai yɛ polu gelei ya. <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>Nii nɔ é ɠɛɛni ga doun mɔungi, naa nɔ ɠa é ɠɛɛni ga felesiɛ, saʋasiɛ, é yɛ zeɠezeɠezu da, é zeeli doun lɔfelasiɛi ma. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>Gaaɓelasu, anzanui ɓalaa za. <verse eid="MAT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>Siɛgi zu niina gɔvɛiti ti wuzeɠezu la, ti ɠula saai ya, zunu loun lɔfelai naati su, ɓɛ ɠa anzanui a yɛ zea? Tɔɔzei seiʋɛ ti ɠilagilagi pɛ bɛ ga anza.»<verse eid="MAT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Wo ɠakagɛ, tɔɔzei wo la GALA sɛʋɛiti gaaɠaazu, wo la GALA ná-zɛbɛi ɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/>Tɔɔzei siɛgi zu buzeɠei wosu da, nu ɠula saai ya, zunuiti ti la mɔ anza zeɠea, anzanuiti ti la mɔ zeiɗa zini bɛ, ta ɠɛɛzu niina eɠɛ geezuɠeelaiti. <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/>Nii é ga gɔvɛiti buzeɠe vai, ti ɠula saai ya, kaipa wo la dɛ naama wooi ɠalani ɓaa, nii GALA ge bogai wo ma? É ɠɛni ma: <verse eid="MAT 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/>‹Nà ɠa gè ga Abalaame, Izaake, ta Zakɔɓe ta-ƓALAGI.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Ɛgz 3:6</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 3:15">15</ref></char>.</char></note> GALA ge la ga gɔvɛiti ta-ƓALA, kɛlɛ toɠa ga fulu nuiti ta-ƓALAGI.»<verse eid="MAT 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Kalagi nii é ɠɛni bosu, naa bɛbɛi pɛ ziizoni, niiti ti ɠɛni mɛnisu.<verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔgi nii kpaɠoai tɔgi pɛ ba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Maleke 12:28-34</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luke 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Faliziɛinti ti mɛnigai ma ga Yesu Saduseyɛinti daaɠulugɛ, ti ɠaalɛɛni ba. <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/>Ti zaama gila ge ɠɛni ná, é ga tɔ kalamɔin ta, naa ɠɛni pɔ ga é Yesu zuɠɔɠɔ ga gaazaɠagi. É ɠɛni ma: <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>«Kalamɔn, tɔ sɛʋɛi zu, devei ɓɛgele ɠa kpaɠoai zɔiti pɛ ba?» <verse eid="MAT 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: « ‹Ɗa Maliɠii ɗa-ƓALAGI nɛɛ ʋɛ ga è-yii pɛ, è-yɛnvui pɛ, ta ɗa-ɠisiɛi pɛ.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">TSV 6:5</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/>Naa ɠa é ga devei nii kpaɠoai ta fizɔgai zɔiti pɛ ba. <verse eid="MAT 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/>Felesiɛi ɠa ná ta nii ti ɠulaai ga ʋe, naa ɠa é ga: ‹Ɗa è-zeiɲɔɠɔi nɛɛ ʋɛ, eɠɛ ɗa ɓɔɠɔi.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/>Nii pɛgi tɔ sɛʋɛi ta GALA goo wo nuiti ta-zɛʋɛiti ti nu ɠalasu da, naati pɛ ta ʋuuni deve felegɔi niiti koozu.»<verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kilista ta Davide ti yɔɠɔzuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maleke 12:35-37</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luke 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>Tɛi Faliziɛinti gaalɛa ɠɛni de ba, Yesu ti ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/>«Wa ɠisiɛzu ɠale, é lo Kilista ʋa? Wa ɠisiɛzu ga toɠa ga ɓɛ mavofoda?» Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Davide mavofodai ʋe.» <verse eid="MAT 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Lee vaa zu mu GALA Zɛnvui puuni Davide yiimaʋɛ, é ɗa toli ga Maliɠii? Tɔɔzei é ɠɛni ma:<verse eid="MAT 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44"/>‹Maliɠii GALA ge ɠɛni Màliɠii ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">Zei zèezazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">eyɛsu gè è zili nuiti da è ɠɔɠɔwu.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Guy 110:1</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>Ni Davide ɠa tolisu ga tɔun Maliɠii, é leʋe ɠale mu, é ɗa ɠɛ ga naa mavofodai?»<verse eid="MAT 22:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>Nu ɠila kpalaa ge la ɠɛni zooni é ʋa gooɠaaʋote nɔpɛ fe Yesu ya. Tama é zo niina naama voloi ma, tanɔpɛ zii la mɔ ɠɛni lɔɔzu, é ʋa gaazaɠa.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu Faliziɛinti ta tɔ kalamɔinti peelala vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Maleke 12:38-39</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luke 11:43</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Naama ziɛgi zu Yesu ɓɔɛni bɛbɛi ta ná-kaladopoiti pɔ, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/>«Tɔ kalamɔinti ta Faliziɛinti tosuʋɛ ɠa ga ti wo ɠala ga Moize ná-tɔgi. <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/>Nii ti bosu wo ma, à naa ɠɛ. Kɛlɛ à mina ʋokɔɠɔ ti-ziɛ ʋeleiti ma. Tɔɔzei tɛnɛgi nii ti bosu, naa lɛi ti ʋa ɠɛ kɛɛzu. <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/>Ta ɗa kasɔ wuigiti gili, nii seɠezu ɓaai, ti da nuiti kɔma, kɛlɛ tiya ɓɔɠɔgoi ti la vɔlɔ kɛa, ti ʋa yeeɓeɠa goi vɔɔɠu ba, ti ʋa tago pa ɲiikpi. <verse eid="MAT 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/>Nii pɛ ti kɛɛzu, ta kɛɛzu nii a kɛ nuiti ti ʋa ɗa ti ʋɛtɛ. Naa maaʋele ma, maalaagi nii GALA daawooi ná tanigaa ti ʋu su, é zɛlɛ nui yeei ʋa ɓaa toʋalaʋɛ, tɔnɔiti kpaɠoʋɛ boani tɔnɔ ʋa, ta-zeɠe wolaiti daa ɠeze yiizayiizagiti gola ɠoozakoozagai. <verse eid="MAT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/>Ti wɔinʋɛ ga seizu ʋagɔiti fɛti laami wosuʋɛti, ta lɛbiya zeizuʋɛti GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu. <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/>Ti wɔinʋɛ ga ti ɗa ti luʋɔ kɛlɛmaʋɛti, ta ti ɗa ti loli ga ‹Kalamɔn›.<verse eid="MAT 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/>«Kɛlɛ wɔun, à mina ‹Kalamɔn› laasei pɛɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, tɔɔzei nu ɠila kpe nɔ ɠa é ga wa-ɠalamɔin, wo pɛ wa ga kɛɛɠɛloun ɠila kpegiti. <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/>À mina nu nɔpɛ toli zooi ma ga: ‹Kɛ̀ɛ›, tɔɔzei wo-Ɠɛɛ ɠa ɠila kpe, nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu. <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/>À mina ‹totuɠɔ› laasei pɛɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, tɔɔzei totuɠɔ ɠila kpe nɔ ɠa é wo ʋɛ, naa ɠa é ga Kilista. <verse eid="MAT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/>Zɔi é ga nu ɓii golai wo zaama, naa ɠa ɠɛ ga wa-wotiɠɛ nui. <verse eid="MAT 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/>Zɔi nɔpɛ é ɓɔɠɔ wokomaalɛɛzu, naa maa ɠa yei, zɔi é ɓɔɠɔmaayeizu, naa unbu ɠa zeɠe.»<verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zelii lo fai wooveledai ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Maleke 12:40</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luke 11:39-42</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:47-52">47-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>«Maanɔɠɔi ɠa wo ʋɛ, tɔ kalamɔinti wa Faliziɛinti, wo ga woovele nuiti! Tɔɔzei wa geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai laaɠulusu nuiti tuɠɔ. Wa ɓɔɠɔi wo la lɔɔzu su, wo la ɓega zɔiti ba, wɔin ti ma, ti ʋa lɔ su. <verse eid="MAT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/>[Maanɔɠɔi ɠa wo ʋɛ, tɔ kalamɔinti wa Faliziɛinti, wo ga woovele nuiti! Tɔɔzei wa poanzaiti kɔligiti kulazu ti ya, wo ɗa GALA fali zuɠoozagiti kɛ, nii a kɛ nuɓusɛiti ti ʋa ɗa wo ɠa. Wa-ʋeelalai wola ɠa ɲɔu wo ma.]»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/>«Maanɔɠɔi ɠa wo ʋɛ, tɔ kalamɔinti wa Faliziɛinti, wo ga woovele nuiti! Tɔɔzei wa leʋeteʋesu zooi ta kpoloɗɛi ɠa ná pɛ, nii a kɛ wo zii ɠiligi gila sɔlɔɔ, wo pilɛ wa-ƓALA pelei ma, tama siɛgi zu wo sɔlɔɔsu da, wa ma nu ɠɛɛzu ga undaaʋili doin, é ɲɔu é leʋe wo ʋa ga seizu felegɔ.<verse eid="MAT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>«Maanɔɠɔi ɠa wo ʋɛ, wɔi wo ga totuɠɔiti ti ɠaazuɠoleai! Wa ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Ni nu ɠonana GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma, naa la ga faa nɔpɛ, kɛlɛ ni nu a ɠonana zanugi ma, siaai GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma, toɠa ma ga kuye ga é naama vai laazeeli.› <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/>Wɔi wo ga ɠimalala nuiti, ti ɠaazuɠoleai! Ani felegɔi naati su, ɓɛgele ɠa fizɔgai bɔɔla ʋa? Zanugi ʋe, ɓaa GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ʋe, nii é zanugi ɲadesu? <verse eid="MAT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/>Wa ɗa ɠɛ ma ɓalaa: ‹Ni nu a ɠonana zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma, naa la ga faa nɔpɛ, kɛlɛ ni nu a ɠonana zalaɠai ma, nii é laani maazu, toɠa ma ga kuye ga é naama vai laazeeli.› <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/>Wɔi wo ga gaazuɠole nuiti! Ani felegɔi naati su, ɓɛgele ɠa fizɔgai bɔɔla ʋa? Zalaɠai ʋe, ɓaa zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ʋe, nii é zalaɠai ɲadesu? <verse eid="MAT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/>Zɔi é kona wosu zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma, naa ɠa ɠonazu zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma, ta zalaɠai nii é laani maazu. <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/>Zɔi é kona wosu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma, naa ɠa ɠonazu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ta GALA nii é zeizu bu. <verse eid="MAT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/>Zɔi é konai wosu geeɠɔlɔgi ma, naa ɠa ɠonazu GALA ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ma, ta zɔi é zeini su.<verse eid="MAT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>«Maanɔɠɔi ɠa wo ʋɛ, tɔ kalamɔinti wa Faliziɛinti, wo ga woovele nuiti! Tɔɔzei wa puusiɛi ɠulazu guluwulugiti ba, ʋelei tufa maku nɛɛnɛgi la ta tufa ɠonai, kɛlɛ wa naati daazu ɠoba, niiti ti ga faa ɓiigiti tɔgi zu: telebodai, gaazumaawɔinɠai, ta wooɠɛɠiladai. Tama naa ɠa maanɛɛni ga wo ɗa kɛ, wo mina fai mɔtaiti da ɠoba. <verse eid="MAT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/>Wɔi wo ga totuɠɔiti ti ɠaazuɠoleai! Wa wo ɓɔɔle ɗɛiti kpɛɓɛsu, nii a kɛ ani vulu go nɔpɛ ge mina leʋe wo-ɠɔdaʋɛ, wa ma, wo ɗa ɲɔmɛi ɓɔle.»<verse eid="MAT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>«Maanɔɠɔi ɠa wo ʋɛ, tɔ kalamɔinti wa Faliziɛinti, wo ga woovele nuiti! Tɔɔzei wa wa-ɓɔɔle aniɲakaiti ta daami aniɲakaiti maaʋɛ gbazu fo, tama ti zulaavegai ga unma wo fai ta ɓɔɠɔzotalai. <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/>Faliziɛinti wɔi wo ɠaazuɠoleai! À kpɔɔle aniɲakaiti ta daami aniɲakaiti suʋɛ ɲade mɔunpa, naa ʋoluma maaʋɛ ɓalaa ka ɲade niina.»<verse eid="MAT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>«Maanɔɠɔi ɠa wo ʋɛ, tɔ kalamɔinti wa Faliziɛinti, wo ga woovele nuiti! Tɔɔzei wo ɠɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ kabai niiti ti ɠobegai, ti ʋagai kɛlɛmaʋɛ, kɛlɛ ti zulaavegai ga gɔvɛiti ti-ma ɠaeiti ta kɔzɔba anii ma zii pɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/>Ʋele ɠana wa ɓalaa wo la, kɛlɛmaʋɛ wa ga telebo nu nuiti gaazu, kɛlɛ wo-yiimaʋɛti daavegɛ ga wooveledai ta faa ɲɔiti.»<verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>«Maanɔɠɔi ɠa wo ʋɛ, tɔ kalamɔinti wa Faliziɛinti, wo ga woovele nuiti! Tɔɔzei wa GALA goo wo nuiti ta-ɠabaiti kpɛtɛzu, wo ɗa telebo nuiti ta-ɠabaiti maanɛɛ, <verse eid="MAT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/>wo zɛba wo ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Ni gi ɠɛni ná gi-mɛmɛwolani ta-yeeɠɛɠalai zu, gi la ɠɛni ʋɔɔpɛa ti ʋa, gi ʋa ɗa GALA goo wo nuiti paa.› <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/>Naa maaʋele ma, wo ɓɔɠɔ ɠwɛɛga ga naama nuiti ti-mavofodaiti, niiti ti ɠɛni GALA goo wo nuiti paazu. <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/>Naa ɠa é ba, à wo-mɛmɛwolani zeeʋogi ɠaaɓela!»<verse eid="MAT 23:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/>«Wɔi wo ga kaaliiti, pɛɛɠaali zuwuzuiti! Wa zoo ɠizosu ɠale peelalai ma, undaaʋili abui zu? <verse eid="MAT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/>Naa ɠa é ba, wɛlɛ, nà GALA goo wo nuiti ta ɠima nuiti teʋesu wo ma, naa ʋɛɛ kalamɔinti ba. Wa tanigaa ʋaa, wo tanigaa ɓadɔ saa wului ma, wo ɗa tanigaa loɠa ga kpakɔi wa-ƓALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu, wo ʋilɛ tanigaa ʋolu ga wɔinzeɠemai taa wolai ɠilagilagiti pɛ su, <verse eid="MAT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/>naa ɠa a kɛ sɔbalala nuiti kpein ti ʋaai, ti-ma ɲamai la wo unma, é zo Aɓɛle ma, é zeeli Ɓalaki ná-doun zunui Zakali ma, nii wo paani seizu ɲadegaiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ ta zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, naa pɛ ka la niizuʋɛ nuɓusɛiti unma.<verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠɔlɔ vai Zeluzalɛme ná-faa zu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luke 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>«Ee, Zeluzalɛme, Zeluzalɛme, ɗɛi ɗa ɗa GALA goo wo nuiti paa, è ɗa yɛ naati sɔɔzu ga kɔtui eyɛsu ti za, niiti GALA ge ti leʋesu è ma! Wɔin wola ɠɛa mà ga gè è zu nuɓusɛiti gaalɛ ba kòbaʋɛ, eɠɛʋelei tɛɛ leei a ɗa ma yiʋoiti gaalɛ la ba koʋegiti bu! Kɛlɛ wo la vaani bu pɛ! <verse eid="MAT 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/>Wɛlɛ, wa-ʋɛlɛi wuuɲakai ɠana yɛ ɓɔɠɔ yeema. <verse eid="MAT 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/>Tɔɔzei gè bo wo ma, wo la mɔ ɠaazulaa mà pɛ, eyɛsu voloi wa ɠɛ la ma: ‹Maliɠii tuya loo naama nui ʋɛ, nii é ʋaazu daaseigi zu!›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Guy 118:26</ref></char>.</char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s">GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɠoloɠolo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maleke 13:1-2</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luke 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>Yesu ɠulani GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, é ɗa li. Ná-kaladopoiti ti maaɓuɠani ba, ga ti dɛɛ la, ʋelei GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo pele ʋagai la. <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>Yesu zɛba é ɠɛ ti ma: «Kɛbɛ tama wa niiti pɛ kaazu, kɛlɛ? Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, kɔtu ɠila kpalaa ge la yɛga laani bɔɔla maazu, ti pɛ ta lokasu.»<verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maanɔɠɔiti ta faaɓaagiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maleke 13:3-13</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luke 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>Tɛi é ɠɛni zeini Wolive wulu ɓelei ma ɠizei ma, ná-kaladopoiti ti maaɓuɠani ba yɛ, ti gaazaɠa, ti ɠɛ ma: «Bo dɛɛ gi ma, yeelɛ ɠa naama vai ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu la? Naa ʋoluma poogi ma ɓɛgele ɠa, nu a kwɛɛ da ga è ʋaa vai ʋolu ta etea ɠaaɓela foloi maaɓuɠaa?»<verse eid="MAT 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «À dama, nu nɔpɛ ge mina wo ɠaka. <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/>Tɔɔzei nu mɔinmɔin ka kpɛtɛ ɠisu ga ti ʋa dàaseigi zu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Nà ɠa gè ga Kilista,› ta nu mɔinmɔin kaka. <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/>Wa kɔɔiti maawoo ta kɔɔiti maalugi mɛni. À mina ɓɔɠɔ yɛ ziiɓɔlɔi zu. Mazɔlɔɔ kɛni naama vaiti ti ɠɛ, kɛlɛ naa lɛi é ʋa ɠɛ ɠɛɛzu ga gaaɓelagi. <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zii ta ɠa wuzeɠe bɔɔla zii laalɔɠɔma, masadai ta ɠa wuzeɠe bɔɔla masadai laalɔɠɔma. Pulu wolaiti ta ɗa loo, ta zou ɓaliiti ti ɗa ɠɛ ada mɔinmɔin. <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/>Kɛlɛ naa ɠa ɠɛ nɔ eɠɛ doun zɔlɔɔ koozuwanai lɔɔzeizuʋɛ.<verse eid="MAT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/>«Naazu ta wo lɔ nuiti zeezu, ti ɗa wo ɓɔlɔ ta ti ɗa wo ʋaa. Ziiti pɛ ta wo wɔinzeɠe nɔ̀un maaʋele ma. <verse eid="MAT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/>Naa maaʋele ma nu mɔinmɔin ka ɠɛlɛ kidaaleʋei ʋa. Ti ɠilagilagiti ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ yaava, ta ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ wɔinzeɠe. <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/>Zɛɛ ɠala goo wo nu mɔinmɔin ka ʋa, ti ɗa nu mɔinmɔin kaka. <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/>Faa ɲɔi ɠaawɔɔlɔ ʋelei ma, nu mɔinmɔin ná-nɛɛbɛi ɠaa ɠa lɛi tɔɔn. <verse eid="MAT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/>Kɛlɛ zɔi a lo kpaan eyɛsu gaaɓelasuʋɛ zeeli, naa ɠa ɠizo. <verse eid="MAT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/>GALA ná-masadai ma Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi nii laa ɠa zeeli eteai zu ná pɛ, nii a kɛ nuɓusɛiti pɛ ti ma zeele wooi mɛni. Naa ʋoluma fai pɛ gaaɓelasuʋɛ ɠa ʋa niina.<verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faa ɲɔu maayikiyikigi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Maleke 13:14-23</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luke 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>«Siɛgi zu wo kɔzɔba vaa wolai ɠaazu la, nii GALA goo wo nui Daniyɛle ná-fai woni, é ɗa ɠɛ ada ɲadegai»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɛlɛ ʋɛti: <char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref></char>.</char></note> (zɔi é sɛʋɛi nii ɠalasu, naama nui dama, é gaaɠa ga pagɔ), <verse eid="MAT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/>«naama yeeɠɛɠalai, zɔiti ta ɠɛ Zudé, naati ti ʋela, ti lɛ gizeiti ma. <verse eid="MAT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/>Ni nui ta a ɠɛna dooɠo bosuʋɛ ná-pɛlɛ ɠɔmaʋɛ, é mina yei ɠasɔ zeɠezu pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="MAT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/>Zɔi ɓalaagi a ɠɛ kpalagaʋɛ, naa mina ɠale ma lɛɛzu taazu, ná-seɠe wolai zeɠe vai zu. <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/>Naama voloiti su, maanɔɠɔi ɠa ɠɛ koma anzanuiti bɛ ta zɔiti ti ɲiimi veezu! <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/>À GALA maanɛɛnɛ ga wa-ʋelai mina zoloo samai ma, ɓaa dooɠo foloi ta ma. <verse eid="MAT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/>Tɔɔzei naama ziɛgi zu, kidaaʋiligi wola ɠa ɲɔu, nii kaipa eteai lɔɔzei yee ma, kɛɠala la dɛ ɠɛɛni, nii eyɛsu ɠɔ nu la mɔ kɛɠala ɠa pɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/>Gaamazu, ni GALA ge la ɠɛni deveni ga é ta ɠula naama voloiti tiegɔi la, nu nɔpɛ ge la ɓena ɠizo. Kɛlɛ, nui niiti é yiimazeɠeai ga tiye, naati maaʋele ma, toɠa ta ɠula naama maanɔɠɔi ma yeeɠɛɠalai la.<verse eid="MAT 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/>«Ni nui ta a ɠɛɛna wo ma: ‹À wɛlɛ, Kilista ɠa ʋɛ!›, ɓaa: ‹Toɠa munu!›, à mina la da. <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/>Tɔɔzei zɛɛ Kilistaiti ta zɛɛ ɠala goo wo nuiti ta ʋaazu ɠulazu kɛlɛma, ti ɗa laavɔɔ vaa wolaiti ta maaɓɛlɛ vaa wolaiti kɛ, nii a kɛ ti nuiti yaava, ni toɠa zoo ɠɛɛzu vɔlɔ, ti naati yaava, niiti GALA ge yiimazeɠeai ga tiye. <verse eid="MAT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/>Wɛlɛ, gè wo loa ɠisu ma yeeluɠɔ.<verse eid="MAT 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/>«Ni ta ɠɛɛna wo ma: ‹À wɛlɛ lɛɛ, toɠa teʋebai zu,› à mina li ná pa! Ɓaa ti ɠɛ wo ma: ‹Toɠa pɛlɛ ɠoozu ʋɛlɛi wu,› à mina la naa tanɔpɛ da. <verse eid="MAT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/>Tɔɔzei siɛgi zu Nu ná-Doun Zunui a ɠɛna ʋaa la, paa vai ɠa ɠɛ eɠɛ mainmain nii a ɗa ɠula folo ɠulazu ʋelei, é ɗa volo eyɛsu folo liizu ʋelei. <verse eid="MAT 24:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/>Ʋɛ nɔpɛ ani ʋoomai ná, miná ɠa ɗuaiti ta ɗa ɠaalɛ ba ná.»<verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋaa vai ʋolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maleke 13:24-27</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luke 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>«Naama ɠidaaʋili foloiti ta leʋena nɔ feya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 24:29">foloi zu ɠa ɓidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 24:29">alugi la mɔ ná-wozakalagi vea.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 24:29">Somideɠaiti ta ɠula geeɠɔlɔgi ʋa, ti loo bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 24:29">geeɠɔlɔgi zu zɛbɛiti ta ɲiikpi.<verse eid="MAT 24:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/>«Naa ʋoluma, Nu ná-Doun Zunui ná-poogi ɠa ɠula kɛlɛma niina geezuʋɛ. Eteai zu nuɓusɛiti pɛ ta ɗa wɔlɔ niina. Ti zɛba ti Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa, é ɗa ʋa geeɠɔlɔgi ma lonaɓiingiti maazu ga zɛbɛi ta lɛbiya wolai. <verse eid="MAT 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/>Naa ʋoluma puʋugi ɠa vɛɛna, toɠa ná-geezuɠeelaiti teʋe eteai ɠɔlɔkɔlɔma ná pɛ, ti ná-nuiti gaalɛ ba, niiti é yiimazeɠeai ga tiye, é zo zou ɓela ga, é li zou ɓela ga.»<verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kalagi nu a sɔlɔɔ kooleɠoole gului ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maleke 13:28-31</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luke 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>«Kooleɠoole gului ná-poogi ɠɛ wo ʋɛ ga kalagi: Siɛgi zu ma ɓekegiti ti ɠɛɛzu la yɔɠɔɓɔ, gaalaagi ma lɛnugiti ti ɗa lɛ ga, wo kwɛni naazu ga foɠoi maaɓuɠaa. <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/>Ʋele nɔ ɠana é la, siɛgi zu wo niima vaiti pɛ kaazu la, ti ɗa ɠɛ, à kwɛɛ ga Nu ná-Doun Zunui maaɓuɠaa pɛlɛlaʋɛ ʋa. <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, yamanii nii la ɓega ga leʋe, eyɛsu niima vaiti pɛ ti ɗa ɠɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/>Geeɠɔlɔgi ta zooi ta leʋe, kɛlɛ nɔ̀un daawooiti ti la leʋega pɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA gila kpe ka é etea ɠaaɓela foloi ɠwɛɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Maleke 13:32-37</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luke 17:26-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>«Nii é ga foloi ta yeeɠɛɠalai nii naama vai ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu la, nu nɔpɛ ge la naa ɠwɛɛ. Geezuɠeelaiti ti la kwɛɛ, Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɓɔɠɔi ɓalaa ge la kwɛɛ, kɛni Ɠɛɛɠɛ GALA gila kpe nɔ ɠa é kwɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/>Siɛgi zu Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠɛɛzu ʋaazu la, faiti ta ɗa ɠɛ, eɠɛʋelei é ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu la Nowe ná-yeeɠɛɠalai zu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/>Tɔɔzei yeeɠɛɠalai nii é leʋeni ziɛve golai luɠɔ, nuiti ti ɠɛni daamii wosu, ti ɗa kpɔɔleiti bo, ti ɗa anzaiti fulu ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ ta ti-lointi bɛ, eyɛsu naama voloi zeeli, yeei Nowe lɛɛni la keingi zu. <verse eid="MAT 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/>Ti la vɔlɔ ɠɛni inɛinɛni ga faa tanɔpɛ, eyɛsu ziɛve golai ʋa, é ti pɛ undaaʋili. Ʋele nɔ ɠana é ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu la, siɛgi zu Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋaazu la. <verse eid="MAT 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/>Naazu nu felegɔ ɠa ɠɛ botii ɠɛɛzu ʋɔɔma kpalagaʋɛ, gilagi ɠa zeɠe, zɔi yɛ ná. <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/>Nu felegɔ ɠa ɠɛ ɠɔnɔgi ziɠazu ʋɔɔma, gilagi ɠa zeɠe, zɔi yɛ ná.»<verse eid="MAT 24:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/>«À ɠaazuɓa mu, tɔɔzei wo la kwɛni, yeei wo-Maliɠii ʋaazu la. <verse eid="MAT 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/>À nii ɠaaɠa ga pagɔ: Ni pɛlɛ kɛɛɠɛi ɠɛni kwɛɛni yeeɠɛɠalai kpidii zu unma nui ʋaazu la, a la ɠaazuɓa, nii a kɛ é mina ná-pɛlɛi yɛ ná, naa ʋa daaɠale. <verse eid="MAT 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/>Naa ɠa é ba, wa ɓalaa, à ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ, mazɔlɔɔ Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa ʋaazu yeeɠɛɠalai ta ma, nii wo la vɔlɔ ɠisiɛni su pɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Botiɠɛ nu ʋagɔi ta botiɠɛ nu ɲɔi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luke 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>«Botiɠɛ nui ɓɛ ɠa mu é ga wooɠɛɠila nui, ta keleɠelegai, nii maliɠii seiɗai ná-botiɠɛ nuiti unda, nii a kɛ é ɠɔnɔgi ve ɛsɛ zea, yeeɠɛɠalai ma nii soloogai? <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naama wotiɠɛ nui, siɛgi zu maliɠii ʋaazu la, é ka, é ɗa naa ɠɛ, nii ma levei veai zea. <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, maliɠii ɠa sei kɔligiti pɛ unda. <verse eid="MAT 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/>Kɛlɛ ni toɠa ga botiɠɛ nu ɲɔi, é zɛba é ɗa ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma: ‹Màliɠii la ʋaazu fala,› <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/>é tɔɔzei niina ga é ɗa ná-botiɠɛɲɔɠɔiti doɠa, é ɗa daami wola wo, é ɗa dɔɔi ɓɔle ta dɔɔzo nuiti, <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/>naazu maliɠii ɠa ʋaazu foloi botiɠɛ nui ɠi ge la ba la, yeeɠɛɠalai nii é la kwɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/>Maliɠii ɠa faa zei ma ga gola, é so ʋelei nu a ɗa woovele nuiti so da. Miná ɠa gɔlɔi ta ɲiiga ziɛgai ná.<verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> anzalopo puugɔiti ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>«Naazu, geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai ɠa ɠula ga anzalopo puugɔ, niiti ti ta-lanboiti seɠeni, ti ɗa li anzazinigi laaɠomisu. <verse eid="MAT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/>Dɔɔlugɔiti ti ɠɛni ga ɠimalala nuiti, dɔɔlugɔiti ti ga ɠima nuiti. <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/>Zɔiti ti ɠɛni ga ɠimalala nuiti, naati ti ta-lanboiti daavegaiti seɠeni, ti la gulɔ ɠili kpɔni ba. <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/>Kɛlɛ ɠima geleiti ti gulɔi ʋuuni gooleiti su, ti kpɔ ta-lanboiti ba, ti ti zeɠe. <verse eid="MAT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/>Tɛi anzazinigi la ɠɛni ʋaani fala, ɲiimɛnii leʋeni ga ti pɛ, tama ti ɲiini.<verse eid="MAT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/>«Kua zaamai, zezei woni, ti ɠɛ ma: ‹Anzazinigi ʋaa! À ɠulana, wo daaɠomi!› <verse eid="MAT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/>Anzalopoi naati pɛ ti wuzeɠeni, ti ta-lanboiti kpɛtɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/>Zɔiti ti ɠɛni ga ɠimalala nuiti, naati ti ɠɛni ɠima geleiti ma: ‹À gi ɠɔ wa-wulɔiti su, tɔɔzei gá-lanboiti ta ga za.› <verse eid="MAT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/>Ɠima geleiti ti ɠɛni ti ma: ‹Ɓa-o, gulɔi niiti ti la kula ɠɛa ade ʋa, tɔun à li yaaɠoiti pɔ bɛ, wo ta ɠeya ná ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ.›<verse eid="MAT 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/>«Siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni liizu la gulɔi ɠeyazu, anzazinigi ʋaani. Zɔiti ti ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni, naati ti yɛni polu, ti lɛ vulu ɠɛɛ ʋɛlɛi wu, ti pɛlɛi laaɠulu.»<verse eid="MAT 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/>«Tago zuɠoozaai ma, anzalopoi zɔiti ɓalaa ti ʋaani, ti ɗa toligi wo, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Màliɠii, màliɠii, pɛlɛi laalao gi ʋɛ.› <verse eid="MAT 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/>Kɛlɛ é ɠɛni ti ma: ‹Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, gè la wo ɠwɛɛ.› <verse eid="MAT 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/>À ɠaazuɓa mu, tɔɔzei wo la foloi ta yeeɠɛɠalai ɠwɛɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> botiɠɛ nu saʋagɔiti ba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luke 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>«Toɠa ɠɛ eɠɛ zunui nii é ɠɛni liizu siɛi ma, é ná-botiɠɛ nuiti toli, é zɛba é ná-naavoloi ɠaliva ti ma ga ti ɗa suyaaɠo. <verse eid="MAT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/>É wali ɠae lɔɔlugɔ veeni ma mɔungi ya, é felegɔ ve gila zea, é wali ɠae ɠila fe ma ɠaaɓelagi ya. É feeni ɛsɛ pɛ zea, é zoloo ti-zɛbɛiti ma. Naa ʋoluma, é wuzeɠe niina, é li siɛi ma. <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/>Zɔi é wali ɠae lɔɔlugɔi zɔlɔɔni, é suyaaɠoni, é dɔɔlugɔ ɠili sɔlɔɔ ba. <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/>Zɔi é felegɔi zɔlɔɔni, naa ɓalaa suyaaɠoni, é felegɔ ɠili sɔlɔɔ ba. <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/>Kɛlɛ zɔi é sɔlɔɔni ga gila, naa liini, é zeɠei ʋɔ zooi wu, é maliɠii ná-walii lɔɔɠu su.<verse eid="MAT 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>«Sulɛbini ɠeke, eyɛsu botiɠɛ nui naati ti-maliɠii zɛba é ʋa, é ɠɛ ti ɠonabo bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/>Zɔi é dɔɔlugɔi zɔlɔɔni, naa ʋaani ga wali ɠae lɔɔlugɔi ta ma lɔnɔ dɔɔlugɔi zɔiti, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Màliɠii, wali ɠae lɔɔlugɔ ɠa è feeni zèa, gè dɔɔlugɔ ɠili sɔlɔɔgɛ ga ma lɔnɔgi. Wɛlɛ tiya ʋa.› <verse eid="MAT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/>Maliɠii ɠɛ ma: ‹Naa ʋagɛ, ɗa ga botiɠɛ nu ʋagɔ, nii nu a zoo laazu da. È ɠɛa ga lada nu faa goi zu. Naa ɠa é ba, nà faa wolaiti kaliva niina è ma. Ʋa, è ɠoozunɛ pɔ̀.›<verse eid="MAT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/>«Zɔi é felegɔi zɔlɔɔni, naa ɓalaa ʋaani, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Màliɠii, wali ɠae felegɔ ɠa è feeni zèa, gè felegɔ ɠili sɔlɔɔgɛ ga ma lɔnɔgi. Wɛlɛ tiya ʋa.› <verse eid="MAT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/>Maliɠii ɠɛ ma: ‹Naa ʋagɛ, ɗa ga botiɠɛ nu ʋagɔ, nii nu a zoo laazu da. É ɠɛa ga lada nu faa goi zu. Naa ɠa é ba, nà faa wolaiti kaliva niina è ma. Ʋa, è ɠoozunɛ pɔ̀.›<verse eid="MAT 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/>«Gaaɓelasu, zɔi é gilagi zɔlɔɔni, naa ʋaani tɔ ɓalaa, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Màliɠii, gè ɠɛa kwɛɛni ga ɗa ga zunui nii ná-fai wola ɓaai. Ʋɛ è la moloi vazani ná, miná ɠa ɗa ɗa teʋe ná. Nii è la siinni, naa ɠa ɗa ɗa gaawaai ɠula. <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/>Gè ɠɛni luazu, gè liini, gè ɗa-wali ɠae lɔɔɠu zooi wu. Wɛlɛ ba, ɗa-walii zeɠe.›<verse eid="MAT 25:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/>«Kɛlɛ maliɠii gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɗa ga botiɠɛ nu ɲɔuɲɔugi! Ɗa ga ɲaka nu wolai! È ɠɛa kwɛɛni ga ʋɛ gè la moloi vazani ná, miná ɠa nà ɗa teʋe ná, nii gè la siinni, naa ɠa nà ɗa gaawaai ɠula. <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/>È maa ɠɛa nɛɛni, é li ga nà-walii, è fe ɓange la nuiti zea. Naazu, siɛgi gè ɠalegai ma la, gè ɠɛa liizu gè nà-walii zeɠe, naa ɓɔ maalamai ʋa.› <verse eid="MAT 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/>Maliɠii ɠɛ ma: ‹À wali ɠaei ɠula zea, wo fe zɔi ya, nii puugɔi zea. <verse eid="MAT 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zɔi ani zea, ta ɠa ve naa ya ʋolu, eyɛsu é ʋooʋa zea. Kɛlɛ zɔi ani la zea, anɛɛ zɔɔgoi é zea, naa ɠa ɠula zea. <verse eid="MAT 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/>Botiɠɛ nu ɲɔi nii nɔnɔi, à so, wo pili ya etea ʋelei kpidii zu, ʋɛ gɔlɔi ta ɲiiga ziɛgai ná.› »<verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tukpɔ ɠaaɓelagi leʋe vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>«Siɛgi zu Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋaazu la ná-lɛbiyai zu, ta geezuɠeelaiti pɛ, toɠa zei ná-lɛbiya masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa. <verse eid="MAT 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/>Ziiti pɛ ta ɠaalɛ ba kakala. Toɠa ti yeeɠaaɠwɛ, ʋelei baala makɛ nui a ɗa baalagiti zeeɠaaɠwɛ la ta boliiti. <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/>Toɠa baalagiti pu ga yeezazu ʋelei, é boliiti pu ga ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei.<verse eid="MAT 25:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/>«Naa ʋoluma, masagi ɠa ɠɛ naati ma, ti zeezazu ʋelei: ‹Wɔiti Kɛ̀ɛ ná-tuyai wo ma, à ʋa, wo masadai zeɠe ga wɔnɔ, nii kɛʋele ɓɛtɛai wo ʋɛ, kaite eteai ɓɛtɛ yee ma. <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/>Tɔɔzei pului ɠɛni mà, wo ɠɔnɔgi ve zèa. Kpɔɔle wɔin sòni, wo ziɛi ve zèa. Gè ɠɛni ga wɛɛin, wo yeezei bù. <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/>Màaɲakai ɠɛni de, wo seɠe loo kɔ̀ba. Gè ɠɛni zeeɓɛzu, wo ʋa wo laali mà. Gè ɠɛni kasoi ɠa, wo ʋa pɔ̀ bɛ.›<verse eid="MAT 25:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/>«Naama ziɛgi zu, telebo nuiti ta gooɠaaʋote, ti ɠɛ ma: ‹Màliɠii, yeelɛ ɠa gi è ɠaani la, pului è ma, gi ɠɔnɔ fe è ya? Ɓaa kpɔɔle wɔin è ma, gi ziɛ ve è ya? <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/>Yeelɛ ɠa è ɠɛni la ga wɛɛin, gi yeezei è wu, ɓaa gi è maaɲakai ɠa, gi seɠe loo è ɠɔba? <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/>Yeelɛ ɠa è ɠɛni zeeɓɛzu la, ɓaa è ɠɛ kasoi ɠa, gi ʋa laaliizu è ma?›<verse eid="MAT 25:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/>«Masagi ɠa ti wooɠaaʋote, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, siɛgi pɛ su wo ɠɛni naa ɠɛɛzu la kɛ̀ɛloin niiti gila kpalaa bɛ, niiti ti yeemalɔiɗɛi, nà ɠa wo kɛɛni bɛ̀.›<verse eid="MAT 25:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/>«É zɛba é ɠɛ naati ma, ti kɔʋɛzu ʋelei: ‹Wɔiti wo ɠotoai, à zeɠe kòba, wo li ɠɔoɠɔ abui zu, nii kɛʋele ɓɛtɛai Inɛgi ʋɛ ta ná-keelaiti. <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/>Tɔɔzei pului ɠɛni mà, wo la ɠɔnɔgi veeni zèa. Kpɔɔle wɔin sòni, wo la ziɛi veeni zèa. <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/>Gè ɠɛni ga wɛɛin, wo la ɠɛni yeezeini bù. Màaɲakai ɠɛni de, wo la seɠe looni kɔ̀ba. Gè ɠɛni zeeɓɛzu, gè kasoi ɠa, wo la laaliini mà.›<verse eid="MAT 25:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/>«Naama ziɛgi zu, tiya ɓalaa ta gooɠaaʋote, ti ɠɛ ma: ‹Màliɠii, yeelɛ ɠa gi è ɠaani la, pului è ma, kpɔɔle wɔin è ma, è ga wɛɛin, ɓaa è maaɲakai, è ɗa zeeɓɛ, ɓaa è kasoi ɠa, gi la è maaleʋeboni?› <verse eid="MAT 25:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/>Názu toɠa ti wooɠaaʋote, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, siɛgi pɛ su wo ɠɛlɛni naa ɠɛɛzu la kɛ̀ɛloin niiti gila kpalaa bɛ, niiti ti yeemalɔiɗɛi, nà ɠa wo la ɠɛni kɛɛni bɛ̀.› »<verse eid="MAT 25:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/>«Naati ta li ɠɔoɠɔ undaaʋiligi zu, kɛlɛ telebo nuiti ta li ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui zu.»<verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s">Yaavai ɠili vai Yesu ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maleke 14:1-2</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luke 22:1-2</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Zan 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>Yesu ɓegai ma ga kalagi naati pɛ bo, é ɠɛni ná-kaladopoiti ma: <verse eid="MAT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/>«Wo suɠwɛɛni ga folo felegɔ ʋoluma, <char style="w" lemma="Pakegi">Pake</char> fɛtii ɠa ɠulazu, tama názu ɠa ti ʋaazu Nu ná-Doun Zunui lɔɔzu la nuiti zeezu, ti kpadɔ saa wului ma.»<verse eid="MAT 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta nuɓusɛiti ta-lotuɠɔiti ti zɛba ti ɠaalɛ ba zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai Kayife ná-koizuʋɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>Ti pɛ ti zolooni ma ga ti keleɠele ɠaiziɛ ga ti Yesu zo dɔɔɠuzu, ti paa. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>Kɛlɛ ti ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔ ma: «Kɛni ade mina kɛ fɛtii zu, nii a kɛ ade mina wutu teʋe bɛbɛi zaama.»<verse eid="MAT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi ziɛ vai Yesu ma <optbreak/> Ɓetani taazuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maleke 14:3-9</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Zan 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>Yesu ɠɛni Ɓetani, gee nu wɔlɔmai Simon ná-pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="MAT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/>Anzanui ta maaɓuɠani ba, goolei ɠɛni zoni zea, kpɛtɛai ga aaleɓatelegi, daavegai ga gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi, nii sɔngɔi wola ɓaai. Siɛgi zu Yesu ɠɛni la daamii wosu, anzanui gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi ʋuuni nɔungi zu.<verse eid="MAT 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>Kaladopoiti ti miná ɠaai ma, ti yiiɠaawanani ga gola, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Niima vaa zuɠoloɠolo ka lee? <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>Nu a la zoo gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi nuu ʋɔdizu ga sɔngɔ wola, ma walii ve bala nuiti zea.»<verse eid="MAT 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu naama vai ɠwɛɛgai ma, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Lee vaa zu wo anzanui nii ɓɔlɔzu? Faa ʋapa gola ɠa é kɛa bɛ̀. <verse eid="MAT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/>Bala nuiti ta wo ʋa yeenɔpɛ, kɛlɛ nɔ̀un gè la ʋaazu yɛsu wo ʋa yeenɔpɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/>É gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi nii ʋua kɔ̀lɔgi ma, nii a kɛ é màaɠulu vai ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, ʋɛ nɔpɛ niima Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeelizu ná eteai zu ná pɛ, nii ɓalaa anzanui nii kɛai, naa laa ɠa zeeli, é ɠɛ ga ɠizɛsui ná-faa zu.»<verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zudase yeezei vai Yesu yaava vai wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maleke 14:10-11</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luke 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, keela puugɔ maazu felegɔi (12) ɠila, nii daaseigi ɠɛni ga Zudase Isekaliyɔte, naa liini zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti pɔ bɛ, <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/>é ɠɛ ti ma: «Ni nà Yesu lɔɔna wo yeezu, wali lielegɔ ɠa wa fe zèa?» Ti wali ɠae ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) veeni zea. <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>É zo niina naama ziɛgi zu ma, é ɠɛni yeeɠɛɠala ʋagɔ ɠaiziɛzu ga é Yesu lɔ ti yeezu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ta ná-kaladopoiti ti Pake daamii wo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maleke 14:12-21</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luke 22:7-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Zan 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>Ɓului nii lɛʋɛ la su, naama vɛtii ma volo mɔungi, Yesu ná-kaladopoiti ti ʋaani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Mini ɠa è pɔ ga gi <char style="w" lemma="Pakegi">Pake</char> daamii ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ ná è ʋɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «À li taazuʋɛ, zunui inkɛ ʋɔ bɛ, wo ɠɛ ma: ‹Kalamɔn ɠɛ: Nà-yeeɠɛɠalai zeelia, è ʋɔ bɛ ɠa gè Pake fɛtii ɠulazu ná, gá nà-kaladopoiti.› » <verse eid="MAT 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>Kaladopoiti ti naa ɠɛɛni, nii Yesu ti leveni ma. Ti Pake daamii ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni.<verse eid="MAT 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Kpɔkɔi zeeliai ma, Yesu zeini daami laɓalii ɠakala ta keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12). <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>Siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni daamii wosu da, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, wo ɠila ka ʋaazu tèʋesu sìli nuiti pɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 26:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>Naama wooi kaladopoiti gola yiiɓɔlɔni. Ti ɠɛni gaazaɠasu ga seɠezeɠedai, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Nà ʋe mu ɓaa, Màliɠii?» <verse eid="MAT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/>É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Zɔi gi yeelɔai ɓɔni ɠilagi zu gá tɔ, naama nui ɠa é ʋaazu dɔ̀ɔzu sìli nuiti zeezu. <verse eid="MAT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/>Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa za, eɠɛʋelei sɛʋɛai la GALA sɛʋɛiti su, é lo tɔun ba. Kɛlɛ maanɔɠɔi ɠa naama nui luɠɔ, nii é ʋaazu Nu ná-Doun Zunui lɔɔzu sili nuiti zeezu. A la vizɔ ma nui ma ga é mina vɔlɔ zɔlɔɔ pɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>Zudase nii é ɠɛni yaavazu, naa ɓalaa gaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn, nà ʋe mu ɓaa?» Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è boga.»<verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maliɠii ná-Pake daami ɠaaɓelagi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maleke 14:22-26</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luke 22:14-20</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kolɛnte 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>Siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni daamii wosu da, Yesu ɓului zeɠeni. Kpegai ma ga mama fee ƓALA falii wo, é galeɠaleni, é fe kaladopoiti zea, é ɠɛ ma: «À seɠe, wo mi, nii ɠa é ga kpùsɛi.»<verse eid="MAT 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ziawɔi ta zeɠeni. Kpegai ma ga mamagi ve GALA bɛ, é feeni ti ya, é ɠɛ ma: «Wo pɛ à ɓɔɔle ga nii. <verse eid="MAT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/>Nii ɠa é ga mà ɲamai, nii é minazeɠegi laazeelizu. Tɔ ɠa puai nu mɔinmɔin bɛ, nii a kɛ ta-ɠotoiti suvaayɛ ti ʋɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/>Gè bo wo ma, gè la mɔ ansaɠɔ gwaai ma ɗɛi nii ta ɓɔlea pɛ, eyɛsu foloi ada kpɔle la ʋɔɔma ga niinɛ, Kɛ̀ɛ ná-masadai zu.»<verse eid="MAT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Ti ɓegai ma ga guyei loo, ti ɠulani, ti li Wolive wulu ɓelei ma ɠizei ma.<verse eid="MAT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bo fai ga Piyɛlɛ ɠa ʋaazu ɠɛlɛzu ba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maleke 14:27-31</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luke 22:31-34</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Zan 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>Yesu zɛba é ɠɛ ti ma: «Za ɓidii wo pɛ wa ʋaazu ɠɛlɛzu bà tɔɔzei nii ʋa é ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu ga ze, mazɔlɔɔ sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: ‹Nà ʋaazu baala makɛ nui loɠazu, naazu baala kpulugi zu ɠa vaza.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zkl 13:7</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/>Kɛlɛ siɛgi zu gè wuzeɠezu la, gè ɠula saai ya, nà tosu da wo luɠɔ Galilé yooi zu.»<verse eid="MAT 26:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>Piyɛlɛ kpɔɛi zeɠeni, é ɠɛ ma: «Anɛɛ ni zɔiti pɛ ta ɠɛlɛzu è ʋa, tɔɔzei nii ʋa é ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu ga ɗe, nɔ̀un gè la ɠɛlɛa è ʋa pɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Gè bo è ma ga gaamai, za kpidii nɔ, tɛɛ zinɛi ʋa ɠɛ é ɓɔɛ, ɗa ʋaazu ɠɛlɛzu bà ná zeizu ɠɛ saʋa.»<verse eid="MAT 26:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni ma ʋolu: «Anɛɛ ɓalaa da zaazu ʋɔɔma, naa ɠa ɠɛ, kɛlɛ gè la ɠɛlɛa è ʋa pɛ.» Kaladopoi zɔiti ɓalaa ti lɛɛni ga naama woo ɠilagi nɔ.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu GALA fali vai Gɛtɛsemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maleke 14:32-42</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luke 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Naa ʋoluma, Yesu ta ná-kaladopoiti ti zeelini adaʋɛ ta, ʋɛ ná laaseigi ga Gɛtɛsemane. É ɠɛni ti ma: «À zei ʋɛ, siɛgi zu nɔ̀un gè liizu la munu, gè GALA fali.» <verse eid="MAT 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>É zɛba é Piyɛlɛ zeɠe ta Zeɓedé ná-doun zunu felegɔiti. Naama ziɛgi zu, é tɔɔzeini ga é lɔ gaazuɠili wolai zu, ziiɓɔlɔ wolai ʋili ma. <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Ziiɓɔlɔi ʋooʋa zìimaʋɛ ma, eyɛsu é ɠɛ é pàa. À yɛ ʋɛ, ade ɠaazuɓa ʋɔɔma.»<verse eid="MAT 26:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>É lago liini fɔɛn luɠɔ, é laaʋɛ zooi ma, é GALA fali ɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Ee, Kɛ̀ɛ, ni toɠa zoo ɠɛɛzu, soolɛi ma ɗaawɔi nii maaɠooza bà. Kɛlɛ anɛɛ naa ʋe, zìima vai mina ɠɛ, kɛni ɗɔnɔi nɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>É ɠaleni ma kaladopoiti pɔ bɛ, é ti ɠa ɲiizu. É ɠɛni Piyɛlɛ ma: «Deɠɛmu wo la zooni, wo ʋa yɛ bà, ade ʋa ɠaazuɓa ʋɔɔma lɛlɛ ɠila daawu! <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/>À ɠaazuɓa, wo GALA fali, wo mina ʋa loozu tɛgai zu. Nui yɛnvui laavegɛ ga kisiɛ ʋagɔiti, kɛlɛ zɛbɛ la kpusɛi ʋa.»<verse eid="MAT 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>Naa ʋoluma, é maaɠoozani ti ʋa siɛ laa velesiɛi zu, é GALA fali, é ɠɛ ma: «Ee, Kɛ̀ɛ, ni ziawɔi nii la zooga maaɠoozazu bà, kɛni gè ɓɔɔle la, zèe ɠa bu, è-yiimai nɔ ɠɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 26:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>É ɠaleni ma ʋolu, é kaladopoiti ka ɲiizu, tɔɔzei ɲiimɛnii ɓɔini ti la ga gola. <verse eid="MAT 26:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>É zɛba é ti yɛ ná, é maaɠooza ti ʋa mɔnɔ, é GALA fali siɛ laa zaʋasiɛi zu, é ɗa lɛ woo ɠilagi nɔ ma.<verse eid="MAT 26:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Siɛgi zu é ɠaleni ma la, é ʋa ná-kaladopoiti pɔ bɛ, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Wa dɛ ɲiizu, wo ɗa looɠo? Yeeɠɛɠalai zeelia, Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠana ʋa lɔɔzu kotoba nuiti zeezu. <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/>À wuzeɠe, ade li. Zɔi é yàavazu, wɛlɛ ba, é ʋaazu.»<verse eid="MAT 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maleke 14:43-50</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luke 22:47-53</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Zan 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Yesu ɠɛni dɛ ɓɔɛzu, eyɛsu Zudase ɗa unkula, nii é ɠɛni ga keela puugɔ maazu felegɔi (12) ɠila. Bɛbɛ wolai ɠɛni polu, boɠa zɔkpɔiti ta kpekpe kpuɠaiti ti zoni ti ya. Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta nuɓusɛiti ta-lotuɠɔiti ka ti bɛbɛi naa leʋeni. <verse eid="MAT 26:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>Yaava nui Zudase poo gila dɛɛni ga tiye, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Zɔi nɔpɛ gè nɛɛnɛzu, gè laaʋɛ komaga, tɔ ɠana, à so.»<verse eid="MAT 26:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>Naa ɠa é kɛɛni, é sakpani nɔ Yesu ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn, ɗa ná!» É nɛɛnɛni ga daaʋɛ komagai. <verse eid="MAT 26:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Bɔ̀ɛ, nii è ʋaai kɛɛzu, naa ɠɛ!» Naa ʋoluma, zɔiti ti maaɓuɠani, ti yeeʋɛɛ Yesu ma, ti so.<verse eid="MAT 26:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, Yesu ná-siɛpoluiti gila ge ná-boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠulani ma laɠagi zu, é pili zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ná-duɔi ma, é naa woii leʋe ba. <verse eid="MAT 26:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Ɗa-woɠa zɔkpɔi lɔ ma laɠagi zu, tɔɔzei zɔiti kpein ti kɔɔi ɠɔɔzu ga boɠa zɔkpɔi, ti undaa ɠa ʋili ga boɠa zɔkpɔi. <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/>Ɗa kaazu ga gè la ɓena zoo gè ʋa wooɠula Kɛ̀ɛ ma ɓaa? A la zoo ɠani nɔ é geezuɠeelai ma waa mɔinmɔin teʋe, ti ʋa, ti ɓɔ bà. <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/>Kɛlɛ naazu GALA Sɛʋɛi zu wooiti daa ɠa zeeli ɠale? Tɔɔzei é bogɛ ga ʋele ɠa faiti maanɛai ga ti ɠɛɛ la.»<verse eid="MAT 26:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>Yesu zɛba é ɠɛ bɛbɛi ma: «Wo ʋaaʋɛ nɔ̀un so fai zu ga boɠa zɔkpɔiti ta kpekpe kpuɠaiti, eɠɛ toosu nu zo faa? Folo-o-folo gè ɠɛa ɠɛɛzu zeini GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ, gè ɗa nà-kalagi ve, wo la sòni názu. <verse eid="MAT 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/>Kɛlɛ niima vaiti pɛ kɛɛʋɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ GALA goo wo nuiti ta-zɛʋɛiti su wooiti daazeeli.» Naa ʋoluma, kaladopoiti pɛ ti zeɠeni koba, ti ʋela.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠɛɛ vai tukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolaiti kakala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Maleke 14:53-65</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luke 22:54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Zan 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Zɔiti ti Yesu zoni, ti liini la zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai Kayife ná-koizuʋɛ, ʋɛ tɔ kalamɔinti ta totuɠɔiti ti ɠaalɛɛni ba ná. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>Piyɛlɛ ʋilɛni polu ɠoozama, eyɛsu ti zeeli zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ná-koizuʋɛ. É lɔɔni koizuʋɛ, é zei salaʋusuiti koba, nii a kɛ é kwɛɛ, ʋelei naama vai ɠaaɓelazu la.<verse eid="MAT 26:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta tukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolaiti ti ɠɛni zɛɛ zeeleiti gaiziɛzu Yesu laalɔɠɔma, nii a kɛ ti tukpɔɠaaleʋe ga é za. <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>Kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni zeele zɔlɔɔsu, anɛɛ ɓalaa zɛɛ zeele mɔinmɔin ge ʋaani, ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ lɛ. Gaaɓelasu, felegɔ ʋaani, ti ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/>«Nii ɠa kɛai ma: ‹Nà zoo gè GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɠolo, gè lati, gè to ʋolu folo saʋagɔ laawu.› »<verse eid="MAT 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai wuzeɠeni, é ɠɛ ma: «È la nuu tanɔpɛ gaaʋotesu, nii niima nuiti ti bosu è laalɔɠɔma?» <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu maaɠɛni kpɔ. Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ɠɛni Yesu ma ʋolu: «Nà è ɠaazaɠasu zɛnvu su ƓALAGI laaseigi zu, ga è gaamai wo gi ma, ni ɗa ɠa è ga Kilista, GALA Doun Zunui.»<verse eid="MAT 26:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «È boga ɗa ɓɔɠɔi. Kɛlɛ nà bosu wo ma, é ɓudɛ naa maazu, é zo niima ziɛgi ma, wa ʋaazu Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠaazu, é zeini Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii yeezazuʋɛ, é ɗa ʋa geeɠɔlɔgi ma lonaɓiingiti maazu.»<verse eid="MAT 26:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai zɛba é ɠɔba zeɠeiti baliʋali ga, kidaaʋiligi maaʋele ma, é ɠɛ ma: «É woo ɲɔiti boga GALA daalɔɠɔma, zeele ɓɛgele ɠa ade ɓɛdɛi ba niina? Wo woo ɲɔi nii mɛnigai na! <verse eid="MAT 26:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/>Wa ɠisiɛzu ɠale?» Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Maanɛɛʋɛ ga é za.»<verse eid="MAT 26:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>Naazu ti laaɗɛi ʋilini gaazu, ti ɗa doɠa. Tanigaa ti ɠɛni goizuloɠazu, <verse eid="MAT 26:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa é è loɠaai? Naama nui lɛ ga giye, ɗɛi è ga Kilista!»<verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛlɛ ɠɛlɛ vai Yesu ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Maleke 14:66-72</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luke 22:56-62</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Zan 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, Piyɛlɛ yɛni zeini eteaʋɛ, koi zaamaʋɛ. Botiɠɛ anzanui ta maaɓuɠani ba, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɓalaa, è ɠɛni Galilé nui Yesu ʋa.» <verse eid="MAT 26:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>Kɛlɛ Piyɛlɛ zeɠeni ga ɛsɛ pɛ gaazu, é ɠɛ ma: «Nii mu è bosu, gè la vɔlɔ gaaɠaazu.»<verse eid="MAT 26:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>Tɛi é liini ga nu lɛɛzu ʋelei, botiɠɛ anzanui taɠili ge kaani, é ɠɛ zɔiti ma, niiti ti ɠɛni ná: «Zunui nii ɠɛni Nazalɛte nui Yesu ʋa.» <verse eid="MAT 26:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>É zeɠeni ga ʋolu, é ɠona vɔlɔ, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè la zunui nii ɠwɛɛ pa!»<verse eid="MAT 26:72"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Ná tago kɛai ma, zɔiti ti ɠɛni loni koizuʋɛ, naati ti maaɓuɠani Piyɛlɛ ʋa, ti ɠɛ ma: «Gaamazu, ɗa ɓalaa ɗa ga niima nuiti ti ta, nu ɠa naa ɠwɛɛsu è ɓɔɛ wooi nɔ ʋa.» <verse eid="MAT 26:73"/><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>Piyɛlɛ zɛba é ɠɛ ma: «Gè ɠonaa, GALA ge dòɠa, ni zɛɛ ɠa gè bosu, gè la zunui nii ɠwɛɛ pa!» Gaamago nɔ, tɛɛ zinɛi ɓɔɛni. <verse eid="MAT 26:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>Piyɛlɛ ɠigi looni naama wooi zu, nii Yesu boni ma ga: «Tɛɛ zinɛi ʋa ɠɛ é ɓɔɛ, ɗa ʋaazu ɠɛlɛzu bà ná zeizu ɠɛ saʋa.» É ɠulani, é wɔlɔ ga gola.<verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠɛɛ vai Pilate ɠakala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maleke 15:1</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luke 23:1-2</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Zan 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>Sobuzobui, zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti pɛ ta nuɓusɛiti ta-lotuɠɔiti ti ɠaalɛɛni ba, ti deve ʋɔɔma ga ti Yesu ʋaa. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Ti Yesu ɠilini, ti lii la, ti dɔ zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii Pilate yeezu.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zudase wana dɔɔ vai, é ɓɔɠɔ ʋaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Kɛɛwotiiti 1:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>Zudase nii é Yesu yaavani, naa kwɛɛgai ma ga ti ɓega ga Yesu zaa vai leve, wanai lɔɔni, é wali ɠae ʋuusaʋagɔi (30) zeɠe, é lii la zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta totuɠɔiti pɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Gè koto zeɠea ga gè sɔbalala nui ɠwɛɛ vai wo ma!» Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa-vaa ɠana, gɔun gá vaa nɔpɛ ge la naa zu!»<verse eid="MAT 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Zudase wali ɠaeiti pilini ya GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, é li, é ɓɔɠɔ zɛlɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ti wali ɠaeiti zɛʋɛni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Tɔgi la vaani bu ga ade ʋa niima walii ʋu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu naavoloi ma, tɔɔzei nu zɔngɔi ʋe.» <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>Tɛi ti ɓeni ga zoloo ma, ti liini, ti pɔlɔ liɠi lo nui ná-zooi ɠeya ga ma walii, ti naa ɠɛ ga wɛɛinti ta-ɠabamaʋɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/>Naa ɠa é kɛa zooi naa laasei pɛai la ga «ɲamaba yooi» zaaɠaza. <verse eid="MAT 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>Ʋele ɠana GALA goo wo nui Zelemi laawooi ʋilɛni la su, nii é boni ga: «Ti wali ɠae ʋuusaʋagɔi (30) zeɠea, nii Izilayɛle mavofodaiti ti zolooni ma ga sɔngɔi. <verse eid="MAT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/>Ti pɔlɔ liɠi lo nui ná-zooi ɠeyaa la, ʋelei Maliɠii dèveni la.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:9-10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12-13">Zkl 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 18:2-3">Zel 18:2-3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:1-2">19:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:6-15">32:6-15</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pilate Yesu ɠaazaɠa fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Maleke 15:2-5</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luke 23:3-5</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Zan 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>Yesu loni zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii ɠakala, naa gaazaɠa, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɠa è ga Zuifuiti ta-masagi?» Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è boga.» <verse eid="MAT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>Siɛgi zu zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta totuɠɔiti ti ɠɛni maalɔɔzu la, é la ɠɛni ti wooɠaaʋoteni. <verse eid="MAT 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Pilate zɛba é ɠɛ ma: «È la nuuma maalɔɔiti mɛnisu, nii ti bosu è laalɔɠɔma ɓaa?» <verse eid="MAT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu la ɠɛni maalɔɔi tanɔpɛ gooɠaaʋoteni. Naa ɠa é zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii wola laavɔɔni.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zaa vai leve vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maleke 15:6-15</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luke 23:13-25</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Zan 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>Pake fɛtii ɠula laa ɠilagila, zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii ɓena kasoɠa nu ɠila pilɛ bɛbɛi ʋɛ, nii nɔpɛ a la maavalina. <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>Tama naama ziɛgi zu, zunui ta ɠɛni kasoi ɠa, nii tɔɠɔɠulani gola, daaseigi ɠɛni ga Ɓalaɓase. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Pilate bɛbɛi ɠaai ma gaalɛai ba, é ti ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Nu felegɔi niiti su, ɓɛ ɠa wo pɔ ga gè pilɛ wo ʋɛ, Ɓalaɓase, ɓaa Yesu, nii é lolisu ga Kilista?» <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>Mazɔlɔɔ é suɠwɛɛni ga toloi maaʋele nɔ ɠa é kɛa, ti Yesu leʋega la pɔ.<verse eid="MAT 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>Siɛgi zu é ɠɛni zeini la tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ, anzai wooleʋeni ma, naa ɠɛ ma: «Mina ɗɔnɔ zeɠe telebo nui nii ná-fai tɛi su, mazɔlɔɔ za ɓidii gè wola ɓɔlɔʋɛ segi zu, tɔɔzei ná-fai ʋa.»<verse eid="MAT 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>Kɛlɛ zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta totuɠɔiti ti lɔɔni bɛbɛi unsu ga naati ti Ɓalaɓase ʋilɛ fai zuvali, kɛlɛ ti Yesu undaaʋili. <verse eid="MAT 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii kpɔɛi zeɠeni ʋolu, é bɛbɛi ɠaazaɠa, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa niima nu felegɔiti su, wo pɔ ga gè pilɛ wo ʋɛ?» Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɓalaɓase!»<verse eid="MAT 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>Pilate ti ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Lee ɠa mu nà kɛ ga Yesu, nii é lolisu ga Kilista?» Ti pɛ ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Kpadɔ saa wului ma!» <verse eid="MAT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>Pilate ti ɠaazaɠani ʋolu, é ɠɛ ma: «Faa ɲɔi ɓɛgele ɠa é kɛai?» Kɛlɛ tɔun ti ɠɛni wola ɓainsu sɛsɛ, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Kpadɔ saa wului ma!»<verse eid="MAT 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/>Tɛi Pilate kaani ga goo la vɔnisu ti ma, kɛlɛ ta nɔ ɠa é ʋilisu zɔngɔi zu, é ziɛi zeɠeni, bɛbɛi ɠaazuyɛ ba, é yeagba, é ɠɛ ma: «Zunui nii zaa vai la ùnma pɛ. Wo yɔɠɔzu vaa ɠana.» <verse eid="MAT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>Bɛbɛi gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Saa vai ɠa ga gi unma ɠasɔ, gá gi-lointi!»<verse eid="MAT 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Pilate zɛba é Ɓalaɓase ʋilɛ ti ʋɛ. É devei veeni ga ti Yesu loɠa ga kpakɔi. Naa ɓegai ma, é teʋeni ti ʋɔ kpadɔ vai zu saa wului ma.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɲɛɛɠulasui nii salaʋusuiti ti kɛɛni ga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Maleke 15:16-20</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Zan 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii ná-salaʋusuiti ti liini ga Yesu zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii ná-koizuʋɛ, ti salaʋusu ɓulugi pɛ gaalɛ ba koba. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>Ti ná-seɠeiti kula kɔba, ti seɠe ɓɔi golai ta loo kɔba. <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>Ti ɠaingi vɛlɛni ga masa bɔɔlɔgi, ti dɔ unma, ti seeli kpakui la zeezai ɠa, ti zɛba ti ɗa ʋilɛ ɲiibiɠa kakala, ti ɗa ɲɛɛɠula su, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ná, ee, Zuifuiti ta-masagi!» <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>Ti ɠɛni laaɗɛi ʋilisu ma. Naa ʋolu, ti seeli kpakui ɠulani zea, ti ɗa doɠa la nɔungi zu. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Ti ɓegai ma ga ɲɛɛɠula su, ti seɠe wolai ɠulani kɔba, ti ná-seɠeiti too kɔba, ti lii la ga ti kpadɔ saa wului ma.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɓadɔ vai saa wului ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maleke 15:21-32</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luke 23:26-43</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Zan 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>Ti ɠulazuʋɛ taai ʋa, ti ɠomini ga zunui ta, nii daaseigi ɠɛni ga Simon, Silɛne nu ɠɛni de. Salaʋusuiti ti kɛɛni zea ga maaɓaa vaa ga kɛni é Yesu zaa wului zeɠe. <verse eid="MAT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Ti zeeliai ma adɛ ta, ʋɛ ná laaseigi ɠa Gɔlegota (nii poluʋɛ ga «unkala adaʋɛ»), <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/>ti dɔɔi veeni Yesu ya ga é kpɔle, nii ti supuni ga gaazulati ani ɠonai. Kɛlɛ é kɔɠɔgai ma, é la mɔ ɠɛni kɛɛni, é ʋa kpɔle.<verse eid="MAT 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/>Siɛgi zu ti ɓeni la ga kpadɔ saa wului ma, salaʋusuiti ti ná-seɠeiti gaaɠwɛɛni ʋa ga kpakutoomai. <verse eid="MAT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>Naa ʋoluma ti zeini koba ga ti makɛ kpaan. <verse eid="MAT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>Ti saa ungi zɛʋɛni, ti kpakpa un maazuʋɛ, ti ɠɛ ma: «Zuifuiti ta-masagi Yesu ɠa.» <verse eid="MAT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Ti ti ɓadɔni ʋɔɔma saa wuluiti ma ta toosu nu felegɔ, gilagi ɠɛni zeezazu ʋelei, zɔi ɠɛ kɔʋɛzu ʋelei.<verse eid="MAT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>Zɔiti ti ɠɛni leʋesu ga ná ʋelei, naati ti ɠɛni ungi ɲiikpisu, ti ɗa poomu, <verse eid="MAT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/>ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ɗɛi è GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɠolozu, è to ʋolu folo saʋagɔ laawu, ɓɔɠɔ ɠizona! Ni ɗa ga GALA Doun Zunui, ɠula saa wului ma, é yei.»<verse eid="MAT 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ɓalaa, ta tɔ kalamɔinti, naa ʋɛɛ totuɠɔiti ba, ti ɠɛni ɲɛɛɠulazu su, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>«É zɔiti kizoga, kɛlɛ é la zooga é ʋa ɓɔɠɔ ɠizo! Nii ɠa é ga Izilayɛle masagi? É yei lɛɛ, é ɠula saa wului ma, naazu gá la da niina! <verse eid="MAT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/>É ɠitoga GALA ba, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Nà ga GALA Doun Zunui,› ni GALA ge nɛɛʋɛ ʋɛ ɠiteɠite, naa kizo na.» <verse eid="MAT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>Ʋele nɔ ɠana toosu nuiti ɓalaa, niiti ti ti ɓadɔni ʋɔɔma saa wuluiti ma ta tiye, ti ɠɛni ɲɛɛɠulazu la su.<verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zaa vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maleke 15:33-41</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luke 23:44-49</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Zan 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Foloi gaalɔgai ma, kpidii ʋɛɛni zooi zu ná pɛ, eyɛsu lɛlɛi zaʋasiɛi ma kpɔkɔ voloi. <verse eid="MAT 27:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/>Kpɔkɔ volo lɛlɛi zaʋasiɛi ma, Yesu kpee looni ga woo wola, é ɠɛ ma: «Eli, Eli, lama saɓaketani?» (nii poluʋɛ ga «Nà-GALAGI, nà-GALAGI, lee vaa zu è ɠɛlɛa bà?»).<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:2">Guy 22:2</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Siɛgi zu ti naama wooi mɛnini da, zɔiti ti ɠɛni ná, naa tanigaa ti ɠɛni ma: «Toɠa Eli lolisu.»<verse eid="MAT 27:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/>Ti ɠila ge ɓizɛni, é seɠe ɓuɠai lɔ dɔɔ ɓodai wu, é gili seeli kpakui ʋa, é tete Yesu ma ga naa kpɔle. <verse eid="MAT 27:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>Kɛlɛ zɔiti ti ɠɛni ma: «Zɛ ná! Ada ka ni Eli ɠa ʋa, é kizo.»<verse eid="MAT 27:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Yesu ɓainni ʋolu ga woo wola, naa ʋoluma niina zii loo.<verse eid="MAT 27:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, kwɛpele seɠezuɠoozagi nii é ɠɛni zɛlɛni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, naa ʋalini ga su fele, é zo ungaʋɛ, é yei buuʋɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɛlɛ ʋɛ: <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Ɛgz 26:31-33</ref></char>.</char></note> Zooi ɓalini, fasaiti ti ʋaliʋali. <verse eid="MAT 27:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>Kabaiti daalaoni, GALA nu mɔinmɔingaa ti-ma wɔvɛiti ti wuzeɠe, <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>ti ɠula kabaiti su. Siɛgi zu Yesu wuzeɠeni la, é ɠula saai ya, ti lɛɛni Zeluzalɛme taazuʋɛ, nu mɔinmɔin ge ti ɠaani.<verse eid="MAT 27:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Siɛgi zu Wɔlɔme zalaʋusu ɠundiɠii ta salaʋusui niiti ti ɠɛni wɛlɛzu Yesu ma, ti zou ɓalii ɠaani la, naa ʋɛɛ fai pɛ ba niiti ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu, dualuagi lɔɔni ti zu, ti ɠɛ ma: «Gaamazu, zunui nii ɠɛa ga GALA Doun Zunui!»<verse eid="MAT 27:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>Anzanu mɔinmɔingaa ɓalaa ti ɠɛni loni ɠoozama, ti ɗa wɛlɛ ná ʋa. Naati ti ɠɛni ga zɔiti ti ɠɛni Yesu ʋolu, kaite é zo Galilé yooi zu, ga ti ɗa maaleʋebo. <verse eid="MAT 27:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/>Naati saama, Magedala nui Mali ɠɛni ná, naa ʋɛɛ Zake ta Zozɛfe ti-lee Mali ʋa, naa ʋɛɛ Zeɓedé ná-doun zunuiti ti-lee ɓalaa ba.<verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu maaɠulu vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maleke 15:42-47</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luke 23:50-56</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Zan 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Kpɔkɔi zeeliai ma, zunui ta ʋaani, é ga naavolo nu, daaseigi ɠɛni ga Zozɛfe, Alimaté taazuʋɛ nu ɠɛni de. Tɔ ɓalaa é ɠɛni ga Yesu ná-kaladopoi ta. <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>É liini, é Yesu ma ʋoomai maavali Pilate ma. Pilate devei veeni ga ti Yesu ma ʋoomai ve zea. <verse eid="MAT 27:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>Zozɛfe Yesu ma ʋoomai zeɠeni, é maavelevele ga geze ɠole seɠei, <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>é da kaba niinɛi zu, nii é bɔɔni fasai ʋa ɓɔɠɔ ma vaa ma. Naa ʋoluma é kɔtu zɛbɛlɛ golai ɠilikilini, é da kabai la, é ɗa li niina. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>Magedala nui Mali ta Mali zɔi ti ɠɛni zeini ná kabai laawu.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kabai makɛ vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>Dooɠo foloi ma ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛi leʋegai ma, poluma zobui, zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta Faliziɛinti ti liini ʋɔɔma Pilate ʋɔ bɛ, <verse eid="MAT 27:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/>ti ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, gi suɠwɛɛni ga siɛgi zu zɛɛ nui nii ɠɛni la vulua, é ɠɛni ma: ‹Folo saʋagɔ a leʋena, nà wuzeɠezu, gè ɠula saai ya.› <verse eid="MAT 27:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>Soma mu è devei ve ga ti kabai makɛ ga pagɔ folo saʋagɔ laawu, naa ɠa a kɛ ná-kaladopoiti ti mina ʋa, ti ʋa ma ʋoomai unma ná, naa ʋoluma ti ʋa ɗa ɠɛ nuɓusɛiti ma: ‹É wuzeɠea, é ɠula saai ya.› Zɛɛ ɠaaɓelagi naa ɠa ɲɔu ma mɔungi ʋa.»<verse eid="MAT 27:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>Pilate ɠɛni ti ma: «Zèe ɠa bu, à salaʋusuiti seɠena, wo li, ti ɗa wɛlɛ kabai ma ga ʋelei wo pɔ la.» <verse eid="MAT 27:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Ti liini, ti kabai maaɓɛɛ vai ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ. Ti yeeʋogi yɛni kɔtui ʋa, ti salaʋusuiti sei ná.<verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu wuzeɠe vai, <optbreak/> é ɠula saai ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Dooɠo foloi leʋegai ma, dɔɔɠɔi ma volo mɔungi sobuzobui, Magedala nui Mali ta Mali zɔi ti liini wɛlɛzu kabai ma.<verse eid="MAT 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Gaamago, zou ɓali wolai ɠɛɛni. Mazɔlɔɔ Maliɠii ná-geezuɠeelai ɠila ge yeini, é kɔtui ɠilikili, é seɠe kabai la, é zei maazu. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>Gaazuʋɛ ɠɛni eɠɛ mainmain, ná-seɠeiti ti ɠole pepe eɠɛ kobe kolegi. <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>Salaʋusui niiti ti ɠɛni wɛlɛzu kabai ma, naati ti zu ɠɛni ɓalizu ga duai, ti loo eɠɛ ta za.<verse eid="MAT 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>Kɛlɛ geezuɠeelai ɓɔɛni anzanuiti pɔ, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À mina lua. Gè kwɛni ga Yesu ɠa wo gaiziɛzu, nii ti kpadɔni saa wului ma. <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>É la mɔ ʋɛ, é wuzeɠea, é ɠula saai ya, eɠɛʋelei é boni la. À ʋa, wo wɛlɛ, ʋɛ é ɠɛa laani ná. <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>Naa ʋoluma, à li fala, wo bo ná-kaladopoiti ma ga é wuzeɠea, é ɠula saai ya. Wɛlɛ tɔun vɔlɔ, é toga da wo luɠɔ Galilé yooi zu, miná ɠa wa ka ná. Naa ɠa é ɠɛa bɛ̀ ga gè bo wo ma.»<verse eid="MAT 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>Ti zeɠeni kabalaʋɛ ga suvilɛ, ti-yiimaʋɛ laavegai ga dualuagi ta koozunɛ wolai. Ti ɓizɛni ga ti naama wooi laazeeli kaladopoiti ma. <verse eid="MAT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>Gaamago Yesu ti laaɠomini, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wo unga.» Ti maaɓuɠani ba, ti velevele ga kɔɠɔiti, ti nɔkɔ bu. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Yesu zɛba é ɠɛ ti ma: «À mina lua. À li, wo ɠɛ kɛ̀ɛlointi ma, ti li Galilé yooi zu, miná ɠa ta kàa ná.»<verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Salaʋusuiti ta-ʋoluvaawogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Siɛgi zu anzanuiti ti ɠɛni la pelei ma, salaʋusui niiti ti ɠɛni kabai makɛsu, naa tanigaa ti lɛɛni taazuʋɛ. Nii pɛ é ɠɛɛni, ti naa wo zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ma. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Tɛi naati ti ɓeni ga zoloo faa ɠila ma ta totuɠɔiti, ti wali wola veeni salaʋusuiti zea, <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>ti ɠɛ naati ma: «Wa ɗa ɠɛ ma nɔ: ‹Gi yɛgɛ ɲiizu, ná-kaladopoiti ti ʋa kpidii, ti unma.› <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>Ni kola vaa ma zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii a mɛnina, gá ʋɛ zii ɠa, nii a kɛ kpɔlɔ mina zeeli wo ma.» <verse eid="MAT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Salaʋusuiti ti yeezeini naama walii wu, ti naa wo, nii zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolaiti ti boni ti ma. Zaaɠaza naama wooi vazagɛ Zuifuiti saama.<verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ná-kaladopoiti teʋe fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maleke 16:14-18</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luke 24:36-49</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Zan 20:19-23</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Kɛɛwotiiti 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>Kaladopo puugɔ maazu ɠilagiti (11) ti liini naama ɠizei ma Galilé yooi zu, ʋɛ Yesu ná lɛɛni ga tiye. <verse eid="MAT 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Siɛgi zu ti pɛtɛni la, ti nɔkɔni bu, kɛlɛ anɛɛ naa ʋe, tanigaa ti ɠɛni inɛinɛsu. <verse eid="MAT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>Yesu maaɓuɠani ti ʋa, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Zobogi pɛ feeʋɛ zèa geeɠɔlɔgi zu ta zooi ma. <verse eid="MAT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/>À li mu, wo ziiti pɛ kɛ ga nà-kaladopoiti, wo ti ɓatize Ɠɛɛɠɛ GALA, ta Doun Zunui, ta Zɛnvu Ɲadegai laaseigi zu, <verse eid="MAT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/>wo ti ɠala ga ti naati pɛ so, nii gè wo leveai la. Wɛlɛ, nà yɛsu wo ʋa foloi pɛ su, eyɛsu etea ɠaaɓela foloi zeeli.»<verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
